<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="NUM" style="id">- Kutu Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Kupetigwa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kitabu cha Kupetigwa</para>
  <para style="toc2">Kupetigwa</para>
  <para style="toc3">Kup</para>
  <para style="mt2">Kitabu cha ikane cha Musa kikemigwa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Kupetigwa</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongozi</para>
  <para style="ip">Kitabu cha Kupetigwa cholonga mbuli ya umwanza wa iwanhu wa Izilaeli kwa miyaka malongo mane kubitila kuluwala wang'hali hawanavika mwiisi Imulungu iyalongile kowagwaa, isi ya Kanaani. Kitabu kino chokemigwa Kupetigwa kwavija kina vifungu vibili vilagusa iwambigalo wose kwa wose walondigwe kuchola kuna ing'hondo mna kila kabila mwiisula 1 na sula ya 26. Iwanhu oifunza mbuli za Bibilia olonga kamba kitabu kino cha Kupetigwa na ivitabu viyagwe va malagizo, Mwanduso na Kulawa na Mbuli za Walawi na Kumbukumbu da Malagizo vandikigwa na mtula ndagu Musa. Mbuli ino yokoneka mkitabu chenyego, ikitabu cha Kupetigwa chosonga kwa kulonga kamba Imulungu kalonga na Musa, lola Kupetigwa 1:1. Vivija yodahika kamba Musa kandika ivitabu avo na wafundiza wa malagizo ako kumwande wengeza ivinhu viyagwe. Kamba lola Kupetigwa 12:3, “Musa kakala muhole ng'hani, kubanza iwanhu wose wayagwe wakalile mwiisi.”</para>
  <para style="ip">Mna umwanza wao kubitila kuluwala, iwanhu wa Izilaeli wanung'unika na wamulema Imulungu miyanza mingi, kwa mbuli ayo wakobozwa. Mfano wa mbuli ino kipindi Waizilaeli viwadumbile na kunung'unika kamba iwanhu wa Kanaani wakala na nguvu ng'hani kubanza hewo, lola Kupetigwa 14:1-4. Kwa mbuli ayo Imulungu kalonga kamba ulelo wose wa iwanhu awo wofa wang'hali Waizilaeli hawana kwingila mwiisi iwalongeligwe ogweleligwa. Vivija Musa hamtegeleze Imulungu na hatogolelwe kwingila mwiisi iyalongile Imulungu kowagwaa. Hamoja awo iwanhu wamulema Imulungu, ila heyo kagendelela kuwakaliza. Mfano, iwanhu owehila Waizilaeli viwamkodile imtula ndagu wa kimhazi yakemigwe Balaam ili yawaduwile Waizilaeli, lakini Imulungu kamtenda yalonge mbuli za kutambika, lola Kupetigwa 22-24.</para>
  <para style="iot">Mbuli zili mkitabu</para>
  <para style="io">Sula ya 1 mbaka ya 10 ina mbuli za kupetigwa kwa Waizilaeli, na vija zing'hambi vizilondigwe kukala na sang'hano ya walava nhosa, na zinhosa zilavigwe na kila kabila kipindi uupango wa nhosa viulavigwe kwa Imulungu.</para>
  <para style="io">Abaho ikitabu cholonga mbuli ya mwanza wa Waizilaeli kubitila kuluwala, sula ya 10 mbaka 25.</para>
  <para style="io">Sula ya 26 mbaka 36 zosimulila mbuli ya kupetigwa kwa mwanza wa kabili na mafundizo gayagwe mbuli ya Waizilaeli. Vivija gamatwaga ga kila hanhu Waizilaeli kuwekile ng'hambi viwakalile ochola mwiisi iyalongile Imulungu na isi ayo viigoligwe kwa makabila kipindi viwengile mumo.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="NUM 1"/>
  <para style="s">Waizilaeli odaha kuchola kuing'hondo opetigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 1:1"/>Mna isiku ya ichanduso ya mwezi wa kabili, mwaka wa kabili Waizilaeli viwalawile Misili, Mndewa Imulungu kalonga na Musa mdihema da mting'hano ako kuluwala lwa Sinai, kamulongela, <verse eid="NUM 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 1:2"/>“Gweye na Haluni muwapete Waizilaeli wose, na mugandike matwaga ga wambigalo wose kamba vizili ng'holo zao na makabila gao. <verse eid="NUM 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 1:3"/>Waja wose odaha kuchola kuna ing'hondo weli na miyaka malongo mabili na kugendelela, wekeni mna ivibumbila va wakalizi wa ng'hondo. <verse eid="NUM 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 1:4"/>Avo mbigalo imoja kulawa kila kabila yailumbe na mweye, kila imoja yeli kilongozi wa wanhu wa kabila jake.” <verse eid="NUM 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 1:5"/>“Gano gago matwaga ga wanhu onda wakutaze.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 1:5">Kabila da Lubeni kokuwa Elisuli mwanage Shedeuli,<verse eid="NUM 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 1:6"/>kabila da Simeoni kokuwa Shelumieli mwanage Sulishadai,<verse eid="NUM 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 1:7"/>kabila da Yuda kokuwa Nashoni mwanage Aminadabu,<verse eid="NUM 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 1:8"/>kabila da Isakali kokuwa Nasaneli mwanage Suali,<verse eid="NUM 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 1:9"/>kabila da Zabuloni kokuwa Eliabu mwanage Heloni,<verse eid="NUM 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 1:10"/>kulawa kwa wanage Yusufu, kabila da Efulaimu kokuwa Elishama mwanage Amihudi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 1:10">kabila da Manase kokuwa Gamalieli mwanage Pedasuli,<verse eid="NUM 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 1:11"/>kabila da Benjamini kokuwa Abidani mwanage Gideoni,<verse eid="NUM 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 1:12"/>kabila da Dani kokuwa Ahiezeli mwanage Amishadai,<verse eid="NUM 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 1:13"/>kabila da Asheli kokuwa Pagieli mwanage Okilani,<verse eid="NUM 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 1:14"/>kabila da Gadi kokuwa Eliasafu mwanage Deueli,<verse eid="NUM 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 1:15"/>kabila da Nafutali kokuwa Ahila mwanage Enani.”<verse eid="NUM 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 1:16"/>Wano awo vilongozi wasaguligwe hagati ya Waizilaeli kamba vilongozi wakulu wa ng'holo zao na vilongozi wakulu wa makabila ga Izilaeli.<verse eid="NUM 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 1:17"/>Avo Musa na Haluni wawasola ivilongozi awo watambuligwe. <verse eid="NUM 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 1:18"/>Mna isiku ya ichanduso ya mwezi wa kabili waiting'hana hamoja na kibumbila chose cha wanhu wakalile wapetigwe kila munhu mulukolo lwake na kabila jake, wagandika matwaga ga wambigalo wose wakalile na miyaka malongo mabili na kugendelela, kamba viweli mzing'holo zao na makabila gao, <verse eid="NUM 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 1:19"/>kamba Mndewa Imulungu viyamulagize Musa. Avo Musa kawapeta wanhu awo ako kuluwala lwa Sinai.<verse eid="NUM 1:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 1:20"/>Wanhu walawile kabila da Lubeni yakalile mwana chaudele wa Izilaeli, kwa kukweleleza ulelo wao kamba viweli mna zing'holo zao na makabila gao, kamba kila twaga da kila imoja wao vidili, kila mbigalo yakalile na miyaka malongo mabili na kugendelela, yodaha kuchola kuna ing'hondo, <verse eid="NUM 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 1:21"/>wakala elufu alobaini na sita na magana tano (46,500).<verse eid="NUM 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 1:22"/>Kulawa kabila da Simeoni kwa kukweleleza ulelo wao kamba viweli mna zing'holo zao na makabila gao, kamba kila twaga da kila imoja wao vidili, kila mbigalo yakalile na miyaka malongo mabili na kugendelela, yodaha kuchola kuna ing'hondo, <verse eid="NUM 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 1:23"/>wakala elufu hamsini na tisa na magana ndatu (59,300).<verse eid="NUM 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 1:24"/>Kulawa kabila da Gadi, kwa kukweleleza ulelo wao kamba viweli mna zing'holo zao na makabila gao, kamba kila twaga da kila imoja wao vidili, kila mbigalo yakalile na miyaka malongo mabili na kugendelela, yodaha kuchola kuna ing'hondo, <verse eid="NUM 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 1:25"/>wakala elufu alobaini na tano na magana sita na hamsini (45,650).<verse eid="NUM 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 1:26"/>Kulawa kabila da Yuda, kwa kukweleleza ulelo wao kamba viweli mna zing'holo zao na makabila gao, kamba kila twaga da kila imoja wao vidili, kila mbigalo yakalile na miyaka malongo mabili na kugendelela, yodaha kuchola kuna ing'hondo, <verse eid="NUM 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 1:27"/>wakala elufu sabini na nne na magana sita (74,600).<verse eid="NUM 1:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 1:28"/>Kulawa kabila da Isakali, kwa kukweleleza ulelo wao kamba viweli mna zing'holo zao na makabila gao, kamba kila twaga da kila imoja wao vidili, kila mbigalo yakalile na miyaka malongo mabili na kugendelela, yodaha kuchola kuna ing'hondo, <verse eid="NUM 1:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 1:29"/>wakala elufu hamsini na nne na magana nne (54,400).<verse eid="NUM 1:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 1:30"/>Kulawa kabila da Zabuloni, kwa kukweleleza ulelo wao kamba viweli mna zing'holo zao na makabila gao, kamba kila twaga da kila imoja wao vidili, kila mbigalo yakalile na miyaka malongo mabili na kugendelela, yodaha kuchola kuna ing'hondo, <verse eid="NUM 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 1:31"/>wakala elufu hamsini na saba na magana nne (57,400).<verse eid="NUM 1:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 1:32"/>Kulawa kabila da Efulaimu mwanage Yusufu, kwa kukweleleza ulelo wao kamba viweli mna zing'holo zao na makabila gao, kamba kila twaga da kila imoja wao vidili, kila mbigalo yakalile na miyaka malongo mabili na kugendelela, yodaha kuchola kuna ing'hondo, <verse eid="NUM 1:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 1:33"/>wakala elufu alobaini na magana tano (40,500).<verse eid="NUM 1:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 1:34"/>Kulawa kabila da Manase mwanage Yusufu, kwa kukweleleza ulelo wao kamba viweli mna zing'holo zao na makabila gao, kamba kila twaga da kila imoja wao vidili, kila mbigalo yakalile na miyaka malongo mabili na kugendelela, yodaha kuchola kuna ing'hondo, <verse eid="NUM 1:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 1:35"/>wakala elufu selasini na mbili na magana mbili (32,200).<verse eid="NUM 1:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 1:36"/>Kulawa kabila da Benjamini, kwa kukweleleza ulelo wao kamba viweli mna zing'holo zao na makabila gao, kamba kila twaga da kila imoja wao vidili, kila mbigalo yakalile na miyaka malongo mabili na kugendelela, yodaha kuchola kuna ing'hondo, <verse eid="NUM 1:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 1:37"/>wakala elufu selasini na tano na magana nne (35,400).<verse eid="NUM 1:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 1:38"/>Kulawa kabila da Dani, kwa kukweleleza ulelo wao kamba viweli mna zing'holo zao na makabila gao, kamba kila twaga da kila imoja wao vidili, kila mbigalo yakalile na miyaka malongo mabili na kugendelela, yodaha kuchola kuna ing'hondo, <verse eid="NUM 1:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 1:39"/>wakala elufu sitini na mbili na magana saba (62,700).<verse eid="NUM 1:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 1:40"/>Kulawa kabila da Asheli, kwa kukweleleza ulelo wao kamba viweli mna zing'holo zao na makabila gao, kamba kila twaga da kila imoja wao vidili, kila mbigalo yakalile na miyaka malongo mabili na kugendelela, yodaha kuchola kuna ing'hondo, <verse eid="NUM 1:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 1:41"/>wakala elufu alobaini na moja na magana tano (41,500).<verse eid="NUM 1:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 1:42"/>Kulawa kabila da Nafutali, kwa kukweleleza ulelo wao kamba viweli mna zing'holo zao na makabila gao, kamba kila twaga da kila imoja wao vidili, kila mbigalo yakalile na miyaka malongo mabili na kugendelela, yodaha kuchola kuna ing'hondo, <verse eid="NUM 1:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 1:43"/>wakala elufu hamsini na ndatu na magana nne (53,400).<verse eid="NUM 1:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 1:44"/>Wanhu wano awo wapetigwe na Musa na Haluni na kwa kutazigwa na waja vilongozi longo na wabili wa Izilaeli, kila imoja kakala kilongozi wa lukolo lwake. <verse eid="NUM 1:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 1:45"/>Avo wambigalo wose kwa wose wa Izilaeli weli na miyaka kusongela malongo mabili na kugendelela, wadahile kuchola kuna ing'hondo, <verse eid="NUM 1:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 1:46"/>wakala laki sita na elufu ndatu na magana tano na hamsini (603,550).<verse eid="NUM 1:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 1:47"/>Lakini Walawi hawapetigwe hamoja na gaja gamakabila gayagwe, <verse eid="NUM 1:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 1:48"/>kwavija Mndewa Imulungu kamulongela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 1:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 1:49"/>“Sikuuwapete wanhu wa kabila da Lawi hamoja na wanhu wayagwe wa Izilaeli, <verse eid="NUM 1:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 1:50"/>lakini uwasagule ili wadilolege goya dihema da mting'hano na viya vake vose na kila kinhu kili mgati, wadipape hamoja na viya vake vose. Wasang'hanile mumo na weke ng'hambi yao kudizunguluka dihema. <verse eid="NUM 1:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 1:51"/>Dihema dahang'oligwa, Walawi awo onda wading'ole na dahasimikigwa, Walawi awo onda wadisimike. Munhu yoyose heli Mulawi yahadikwesela dihema yakomigwe. <verse eid="NUM 1:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="NUM 1:52"/>Waizilaeli wayagwe wose weke ng'hambi zao mna gamabumbila bumbila, kila munhu mna ing'hambi yake hasi ya bendela ya ikibumbila chake. <verse eid="NUM 1:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NUM 1:53"/>Lakini Walawi weke ng'hambi yao kudizunguluka dihema na wadilole goya ili munhu yoyose sikuyadikwesele behi na kuitenda ng'hasiliki yangu iwe ng'hulu mbuli ya wanhu zangu wa Izilaeli.” <verse eid="NUM 1:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="NUM 1:54"/>Avo Waizilaeli watenda kamba Mndewa Imulungu viyamulagize Musa.<verse eid="NUM 1:54"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="NUM 2"/>
  <para style="s">Ng'hambi za makabila zopangigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 2:1"/>Mndewa Imulungu kawalagiza Musa na Haluni, <verse eid="NUM 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 2:2"/>“Waizilaeli weke ng'hambi zao kudizunguluka dihema da mting'hano, kila munhu yakale hanhu heli na bendela ilagusa kabila jake na hana ikilaguso cha ulukolo lwake.”<verse eid="NUM 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 2:3"/>Wanhu onda weke ng'hambi mwambu wa kudilawila zuwa chokuwa kibumbila kili hasi ya bendela ya Yuda, kamba viweli mna gamakabila gao na kilongozi wa kabila da Yuda kokuwa Nashoni mwanage Aminadabu. <verse eid="NUM 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 2:4"/>Kabila da Yuda dokuwa na wambigalo elufu sabini na nne na magana sita (74,600).<verse eid="NUM 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 2:5"/>Wanhu onda weke ng'hambi behi na wanhu wa kabila da Yuda okuwa kabila da Isakali, kilongozi wao kokuwa Nasaneli mwanage Suali. <verse eid="NUM 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 2:6"/>Kabila da Isakali dokuwa na wambigalo elufu hamsini na nne na magana nne (54,400).<verse eid="NUM 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 2:7"/>Abaho kabila da Zabuloni okwika ng'hambi yao na kilongozi wao kokuwa Eliabu mwanage Heloni. <verse eid="NUM 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 2:8"/>Kabila da Zabuloni dokuwa na wambigalo elufu hamsini na saba na magana nne (57,400).<verse eid="NUM 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 2:9"/>Iwanhu wose onda wawe mna ikibumbila cha Yuda kamba viweli mna gamakabila gao okuwa laki imoja na elufu semanini na sita na magana nne (186,400). Hewo awo onda walongole kusegela.<verse eid="NUM 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 2:10"/>Wanhu onda weke ng'hambi mwambu wa kusini, chokuwa kibumbila kili hasi ya bendela ya Lubeni kamba viweli mna gamakabila gao na kilongozi wa kabila da Lubeni kokuwa Elisuli mwanage Shedeuli. <verse eid="NUM 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 2:11"/>Kabila da Lubeni dokuwa na wambigalo elufu alobaini na sita magana tano (46,500).<verse eid="NUM 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 2:12"/>Wanhu onda weke ng'hambi behi na kabila da Lubeni okuwa wanhu wa kabila da Simeoni, kilongozi wao kokuwa Shelumieli mwanage Sulishadai. <verse eid="NUM 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 2:13"/>Kabila da Simeoni dokuwa na wambigalo elufu hamsini na tisa na magana ndatu (59,300).<verse eid="NUM 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 2:14"/>Abaho wanhu wa kabila da Gadi okwika ng'hambi yao na kilongozi wao kokuwa Eliasafu mwanage Leueli. <verse eid="NUM 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 2:15"/>Kabila da Gadi dokuwa na wambigalo elufu alobaini na tano na magana sita na hamsini (45,650).<verse eid="NUM 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 2:16"/>Iwanhu wose onda wawe mna ikibumbila cha Lubeni kamba viweli mna gamakabila gao okuwa laki moja na elufu hamsini na moja na magana nne na hamsini (151,450). Wano awo onda wasegele mmwanza wa kabili.<verse eid="NUM 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 2:17"/>Abaho ing'hambi ya kabila da Walawi ili hagati ya izing'hambi zose, na kuno odipapa ajo dihema na kusegela najo. Kila kabila dochola kwa kukweleleza hanhu hake hasi ya bendela yake.<verse eid="NUM 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 2:18"/>Wanhu onda weke ng'hambi mwambu wa kudihongela zuwa, chokuwa kibumbila kili hasi ya bendela ya Efulaimu kamba viweli mna gamakabila gao na kilongozi wa kabila da Efulaimu kokuwa Elishama mwanage Amihudi. <verse eid="NUM 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 2:19"/>Kabila da Efulaimu dokuwa na wambigalo elufu alobaini na magana tano (40,500).<verse eid="NUM 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 2:20"/>Wanhu onda weke ng'hambi behi na kabila da Efulaimu okuwa wanhu wa kabila da Manase, kilongozi wao kokuwa Gamalieli mwanage Pedasuli. <verse eid="NUM 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 2:21"/>Kabila da Manase dokuwa na wambigalo elufu selasini na mbili na magana mbili (32,200).<verse eid="NUM 2:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 2:22"/>Abaho wanhu wa kabila da Benjamini okwika ng'hambi yao na kilongozi wao kokuwa Abidani mwanage Gideoni. <verse eid="NUM 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 2:23"/>Kabila da Benjamini dokuwa na wambigalo elufu selasini na tano na magana nne (35,400).<verse eid="NUM 2:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 2:24"/>Iwanhu wose onda wawe mna ikibumbila cha Efulaimu kamba viweli mna gamakabila gao okuwa laki imoja na elufu nane na magana moja (108,100). Wano awo onda wasegele mmwanza wa kadatu.<verse eid="NUM 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 2:25"/>Wanhu onda weke ng'hambi mwambu wa kasikazini chokuwa kibumbila kili hasi ya bendela ya Dani kamba viweli mna gamakabila gao na kilongozi wa kabila da Dani kokuwa Ahiezeli mwanage Amishadai. <verse eid="NUM 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 2:26"/>Kabila da Dani dokuwa na wambigalo elufu sitini na mbili na magana saba (62,700).<verse eid="NUM 2:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 2:27"/>Abaho wanhu onda weke ng'hambi behi yao okuwa kabila da Asheli, kilongozi wao kokuwa Pagieli mwanage Okilani. <verse eid="NUM 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 2:28"/>Kabila da Asheli dokuwa na wambigalo elufu alobaini na moja magana tano (41,500).<verse eid="NUM 2:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 2:29"/>Abaho wanhu wa kabila da Nafutali okwika ng'hambi yao na kilongozi wao kokuwa Ahila mwanage Enani. <verse eid="NUM 2:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 2:30"/>Kabila da Nafutali dokuwa na wambigalo elufu hamsini na ndatu na magana nne (53,400).<verse eid="NUM 2:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 2:31"/>Iwanhu wose onda wawe mna ikibumbila cha Dani kamba viweli mna gamakabila gao okuwa laki imoja na elufu hamsini na saba na magana sita (157,600). Kibumbila kino cha Dani chokuwa mmwanza wa ikimambukizo.<verse eid="NUM 2:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 2:32"/>Wano awo Waizilaeli wapetigwe kamba viweli mna gamakabila gao, mzing'hambi za vibumbila vao, wose kwa wose wakala laki sita na elufu ndatu na magana tano na hamsini (603,550). <verse eid="NUM 2:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 2:33"/>Lakini Walawi hawapetigwe hamoja na wanhu wayagwe wa Izilaeli, kamba Mndewa Imulungu viyamulagize Musa.<verse eid="NUM 2:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 2:34"/>Avo Waizilaeli watenda kila kinhu kamba Mndewa Imulungu viyamulagize Musa. Avo weka ng'hambi kamba viweli mna izibendela zao, wachola mwanza wao kuno kila munhu kailongoza na lukolo lwake na ulelo wake.<verse eid="NUM 2:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="NUM 3"/>
  <para style="s">Imulungu kowasagula Walawi wawataze walava nhosa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 3:1"/>Uno awo ulelo wa Haluni na Musa kipindi Mndewa Imulungu viyalongile na Musa ako kulugongo lwa Sinai. <verse eid="NUM 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 3:2"/>Haluni kakala na wana wane na hewo wakala Nadabu imwana chaudele na Abihu na Eleazali na Itamali. <verse eid="NUM 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 3:3"/>Wano wose wagidiligwa mavuta wawe walava nhosa. <verse eid="NUM 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 3:4"/>Lakini Nadabu na Abihu wafa kuulongozi wa Mndewa Imulungu viwakalile omulavila Imulungu moto haulondigwe ako kuluwala lwa Sinai. Awo wakala hawalelile wana, avo Eleazali na Itamali wasang'hana kamba walava nhosa kipindi tatao viyakalile mgima.<verse eid="NUM 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 3:5"/>Mndewa Imulungu kamulongela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 3:6"/>“Wagale behi wanhu wa kabila da Lawi na uweke kuulongozi wa mulava nhosa Haluni ili wamsang'hanile heyo. <verse eid="NUM 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 3:7"/>Wasang'hane hanhu hake na hanhu ha Waizilaeli wose mna dihema da mting'hano. <verse eid="NUM 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 3:8"/>Wavilole goya viya vose va dihema da mting'hano na wawataze Waizilaeli kusang'hana hanhu hang'alile. <verse eid="NUM 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 3:9"/>Gweye umgwelele Haluni na wanage awo iwalawi wawe hamoja nao, hewo walavigwa hagati ya Waizilaeli wawasang'hanile hewo. <verse eid="NUM 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 3:10"/>Abaho msagule Haluni na wanage wasang'hane kamba walava nhosa, lakini munhu yoyose iyagwe yonda yasang'hane sang'hano ayo yakomigwe.”<verse eid="NUM 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 3:11"/>Mndewa Imulungu kamulongela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 3:12"/>“Lola niye niwasagula Walawi na niwalava hagati ya Waizilaeli wose hanhu ha kila mwana chaudele wa kimbigalo wa Waizilaeli, avo Walawi wose wangu niye, <verse eid="NUM 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 3:13"/>kwavija kila mwana chaudele wa munhu na wa mnyama ni wangu. Kipindi viniwakomile wana chaudele wa Wamisili nimsola kila mwana chaudele wa Izilaeli, kila mwana chaudele wa munhu na vivija wa mnyama, wose okuwa wangu. Niye ayo Mndewa Imulungu.”<verse eid="NUM 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Walawi opetigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 3:14"/>Musa viyakalile kuluwala lwa Sinai Mndewa Imulungu kamulongela, <verse eid="NUM 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 3:15"/>“Wapete Walawi wose kamba viweli muulelo wao na lukolo lwao, kila mbigalo kusongela wana ving'hele weli na mwezi umoja na kugendelela.” <verse eid="NUM 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 3:16"/>Avo Musa kawapeta kamba Mndewa Imulungu, viyamulagize. <verse eid="NUM 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 3:17"/>Wanage Lawi wakala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 3:17">Gelishoni na Kohati na Melali.<verse eid="NUM 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 3:18"/>Gano gago matwaga ga wana wa Gelishoni kamba vizili ng'holo zao, Libini na Shimei.<verse eid="NUM 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 3:19"/>Gano gago matwaga ga wana wa Kohati kamba vizili ng'holo zao, Amulamu na Ishali na Hebuloni na Uzieli.<verse eid="NUM 3:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 3:20"/>Gano gago matwaga ga wana wa Melali kamba vizili ng'holo zao, Mahili na Mushi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 3:20">Uno awo ulelo wa Walawi kamba viweli mzing'holo zao.<verse eid="NUM 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 3:21"/>Ng'holo za Walibini na Washimei zilawa kwa Gelishoni. <verse eid="NUM 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 3:22"/>Wambigalo wose wapetigwe kusongela wana ving'hele weli na mwezi umoja na kugendelela wakala elufu saba na magana tano (7,500). <verse eid="NUM 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 3:23"/>Ulelo uno wa Gelishoni, walondigwa kwika ng'hambi yao mwambu wa kudihongela zuwa, kumzingo wa dihema da mting'hano. <verse eid="NUM 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 3:24"/>Nayo Eliasafu mwanage Laeli kokuwa kilongozi wa ulelo wa Gelishoni. <verse eid="NUM 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 3:25"/>Sang'hano ya ulelo wa Gelishoni ikala kudilola goya dihema da mting'hano, hamoja na ingubiko ya dihema na panziya da ulwivi lwa dihema, <verse eid="NUM 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 3:26"/>mapanziya ga uluwa uzunguluke dihema na upango wa nhosa na panziya da ulwivi lwa uluwa na nzabi zake. Sang'hano ayo yose ikala yao.<verse eid="NUM 3:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 3:27"/>Ng'holo za Waamulami na Waishali na Wahebuloni na Wauzieli zilawa kwa Kohati. <verse eid="NUM 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 3:28"/>Iwambigalo wose kwa wose kusongela wana ving'hele weli na mwezi umoja na kugendelela wakala elufu nane na magana sita (8,600). Hewo sang'hano yao ikala kuvilola goya vinhu vili mna ihanhu hong'ala. <verse eid="NUM 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 3:29"/>Ulelo wa Kohati walondigwa weke ng'hambi yao mwambu wa kusini wa dihema da mting'hano, <verse eid="NUM 3:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 3:30"/>nayo Elisafani mwanage Uzieli kakala kilongozi wa ulelo wa Kohati. <verse eid="NUM 3:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 3:31"/>Hewo sang'hano yao ikala kudilola goya sanduku da lagano, na imeza na ikingolobweda cha kwikila taa, zimhango za nhosa na viya visang'hanilwa hanhu hong'ala na dipanziya da hanhu hong'ala ng'hani, sang'hano za vinhu avo vose ikala yao.<verse eid="NUM 3:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 3:32"/>Nayo Eleazali mwanage mulava nhosa mkulu Haluni katendigwa yawe kilongozi wa iwakulu wa Walawi, na iwasang'hanaji wose wa hanhu hong'ala.<verse eid="NUM 3:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 3:33"/>Ng'holo za Wamahili na Wamushi zilawa kwa Melali. <verse eid="NUM 3:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 3:34"/>Uno awo ulelo wa Melali. Wambigalo wose wapetigwe kusongela wana ving'hele weli na mwezi umoja na kugendelela wakala elufu sita na magana mbili (6,200). <verse eid="NUM 3:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 3:35"/>Kilongozi wa ulelo wa Melali kakala Sulieli mwanage Abihaili, awo olondigwa weke ng'hambi yao mwambu wa kasikazini wa dihema da mting'hano. <verse eid="NUM 3:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 3:36"/>Hewo sang'hano yao ikala kulola mbao za dihema da mting'hano na fito zake na zimhanda na vikalilo vake na vinhu vose va kugogeleza dihema, sang'hano ya vinhu avo vose ikala yao. <verse eid="NUM 3:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 3:37"/>Vivija walondigwa kuzilola zimhanda za uluwa, na vikalilo vake na vifungilo vake na nzabi zake.<verse eid="NUM 3:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 3:38"/>Musa na Haluni na wanao weka ng'hambi yao mwambu wa kudilawilila zuwa kuulongozi wa dihema da mting'hano, hewo sang'hano yao ikala kulava nhosa na kulola goya hanhu hong'ala na kusang'hana hanhu aho mbuli ya kinhu chochose kilondigwe kwa Waizilaeli. Munhu yoyose iyagwe yahakwesa behi yakomigwe. <verse eid="NUM 3:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 3:39"/>Walawi wose kamba viweli muulelo wao, wambigalo wose kusongela wana ving'hele weli na mwezi umoja na kugendelela, awo wapetigwe na Musa na Haluni kamba viwalagizwe na Mndewa Imulungu wakala elufu ishilini na mbili (22,000).<verse eid="NUM 3:39"/></para>
  <para style="s">Wana chaudele ogomboligwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 3:40"/>Abaho Mndewa Imulungu kamulongela Musa, “Uwapete chaudele wose wa kimbigalo wa Waizilaeli kusongela wana ving'hele weli na mwezi umoja na kugendelela. <verse eid="NUM 3:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 3:41"/>Vivija uwabagule Walawi mbuli yangu niye Mndewa Imulungu hanhu ha iwana wa chaudele wa iwanhu wa Izilaeli, na vivija ubagule fugo zose za Walawi kamba hanhu ha fugo za chaudele za wanhu wa Izilaeli.”<verse eid="NUM 3:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 3:42"/>Avo Musa kawapeta wana wose chaudele wa Waizilaeli, kamba Mndewa Imulungu viyamulagize. <verse eid="NUM 3:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 3:43"/>Wana chaudele wose wa kimbigalo kamba matwaga gao vigeli, kusongela wana ving'hele wa mwezi umoja na kugendelela, wakala elufu ishilini na mbili na magana mbili na sabini na ndatu (22,273).<verse eid="NUM 3:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 3:44"/>Abaho Mndewa Imulungu kamulongela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 3:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 3:45"/>“Sambi wabagule Walawi wose wawe wangu hanhu ha wana chaudele wa Waizilaeli. Vivija ubagule fugo ya Walawi wose kamba hanhu ha wana chaudele wa fugo ya Waizilaeli, niye ayo Mndewa Imulungu. <verse eid="NUM 3:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 3:46"/>Mbuli ya kuwagombolela wana chaudele wa kimbigalo wa Waizilaeli magana mbili sabini na ndatu (273), wabanzile iwambigalo wose wa Walawi, <verse eid="NUM 3:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 3:47"/>avo kulawa kwa kila imoja wa awo wabanzile usole vihande vitano va shaba kamba viwopima hanhu hong'ala, <verse eid="NUM 3:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 3:48"/>na sente azo za kuwagombolela awo wabanzile umgwee Haluni na wanage.”<verse eid="NUM 3:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 3:49"/>Avo Musa katogola kuzisola sente azo za kuwagombolela awo wabanzile Walawi, awo waswelile kugomboligwa. <verse eid="NUM 3:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 3:50"/>Avo kavibokela kulawa kwa awo iwana chaudele wa Waizilaeli vihande va shaba elufu moja magana ndatu sitini na tano, kamba viwopima hanhu hong'ala, <verse eid="NUM 3:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 3:51"/>kawagwaa Haluni na wanage zisente azo, kamba Mndewa Imulungu viyamulagize.<verse eid="NUM 3:51"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="NUM 4"/>
  <para style="s">Sang'hano za ulelo wa Kohati</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 4:1"/>Mndewa Imulungu kamulongela Musa na Haluni, <verse eid="NUM 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 4:2"/>“Mna Iwalawi wapeteni wanhu wa ulelo wa Kohati kamba viweli mzing'holo zao na mzing'anda zao, <verse eid="NUM 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 4:3"/>muwapete wambigalo wose weli na miyaka malongo madatu mbaka malongo matano waja odaha kusang'hana mdihema da mting'hano.<verse eid="NUM 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 4:4"/>“Sang'hano ya ulelo wa Kohati yokuwa kuvipapa viya vose vili hanhu hong'ala ng'hani. <verse eid="NUM 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 4:5"/>Kipindi cha kusegela chahavika Haluni na wanage wengile mng'anda ya dihema wadihumuluse dipanziya dili kuulongozi wa disanduku da lagano, abaho wadigubike disanduku da lagano kwa panziya dijo. <verse eid="NUM 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 4:6"/>Uchanha yake wadigubike na ing'hwembe ya mnyama wa mbahali na wadikunzule dikumbi da langi ya buluu. Abaho wengize zimango za kudipapila disanduku.<verse eid="NUM 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 4:7"/>“Uchanha ya meza ili kuulongozi wangu niye Mndewa Imulungu wakunzule dikumbi da buluu na uchanha yake weke sahani na ivikasi va ubani na bakuli na bilika mbuli ya kulavila nhosa ya king'waji. Gago gamagate gasigale aho mmeza siku zose. <verse eid="NUM 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 4:8"/>Abaho, wavike viya vose mdikumbi didung'hu na uchanha yake weke ingubiko ya ng'hwembe ya mnyama wa mbahali. Abaho wengize zimango za kuipapila.<verse eid="NUM 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 4:9"/>“Wasole dikumbi da buluu wagubikile ikingolobweda cha kwikila taa hamoja na taa zake, na viya va kugogela makala ga moto na viya va kuhalila moto na viya vose va kwikila mavuta. <verse eid="NUM 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 4:10"/>Abaho wakike ikingolobweda hamoja na viya vake vose mna ing'hwembe ya mnyama wa mbahali, na wengize zimango za kukipapila.<verse eid="NUM 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 4:11"/>“Abaho wakunzule dikumbi da buluu uchanha ya upango wa zahabu na waugubike kwa ng'hwembe ya mhala. Abaho wengize zimango za kuupapila.<verse eid="NUM 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 4:12"/>“Wasole viya vose va kusang'hanila hanhu hong'ala, wavifunge mdikumbi da buluu na wavigubike kwa ng'hwembe ya mhala, abaho wengize zimango za kupapila.<verse eid="NUM 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 4:13"/>“Wasegese imitozi ili uchanha ya uupango wa nhosa na wadikunzule dikumbi da langi ya zambalau uchanha yake. <verse eid="NUM 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 4:14"/>Uchanha yake weke viya vose visang'haniligwa hana uupango, lwiko lwa kuzolela mitozi na bakuli na lwiko lwa kuhindulila nhosa na viya va kuhalila moto, abaho uchanha yake wakunzule ingubiko ya ng'hwembe ya mnyama wa mbahali. Na wengize zimango za kupapila.<verse eid="NUM 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 4:15"/>“Abaho, Haluni na wanage wahamambukiza kuhagubika hanhu hong'ala hamoja na vinhu vose viyagwe waitande kwa mwanza, abaho wanhu wa ulelo wa Kohati weze wavipape. Lakini hewo hawalondigwa kuvikwasa viya avo ving'alile ili sikuwafe, ino ayo sang'hano ya ulelo wa Kohati kipindi chose dihema da mting'hano chahahamizwa.<verse eid="NUM 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 4:16"/>“Eleazali mwanage Haluni imulava nhosa, kolondigwa yagalolese mavuta ga taa na ubani na nhosa za ndiya zilavagwa kila siku na gamavuta gang'alile. Yalolese kila kinhu kili mgati ya dihema ajo.”<verse eid="NUM 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 4:17"/>Mndewa Imulungu kamulongela Musa na Haluni, <verse eid="NUM 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 4:18"/>“Sikumuwakanhe ulelo wa Kohati mna Iwalawi. <verse eid="NUM 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 4:19"/>Avo, ili sikumuwahonze wakomigwe vonda wavikwesele viya avo ving'alile ng'hani, utende vino kumwao, Haluni na wanage wengile mgati na wampangile kila imoja sang'hano yake. <verse eid="NUM 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 4:20"/>Lakini Wakohati hawalondigwa kwingila na kuvilola viya avo ving'alile, wahatenda vivo wofa.”<verse eid="NUM 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sang'hano ya ulelo wa Gelishoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 4:21"/>Mndewa Imulungu kamulongela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 4:22"/>“Uwapete wanhu wa ulelo wa Gelishoni kamba viweli mzing'holo zao na mzing'anda zao, <verse eid="NUM 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 4:23"/>uwapete wambigalo wose weli na miyaka malongo madatu mbaka malongo matano waja odaha kusang'hana mdihema da mting'hano.<verse eid="NUM 4:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 4:24"/>“Sang'hano yao yokuwa ino, <verse eid="NUM 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 4:25"/>kupapa mapanziya ga dihema da mting'hano, na ngubiko yake na ingubiko ya ng'hwembe ya mnyama wa mbahali na dipanziya dili haulwivi lwa dihema, <verse eid="NUM 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 4:26"/>wapape mapanziya na nzabi za uluwa uzunguluke dihema na upango wa nhosa, panziya da ulwivi lwa uluwa na vinhu vose va kusang'hanila mumo. Hewo sang'hano yao yokuwa kwa viya avo vose. <verse eid="NUM 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 4:27"/>Sang'hano zose azo iwe kupapa hebu sang'hano yoyose iyagwe, waitende kwa kulagizwa na Haluni na wanage. Uwalagize ivinhu vose viwolondigwa kupapa. <verse eid="NUM 4:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 4:28"/>Sang'hano ayo itendigwe na wanhu wa ulelo wa Gelishoni mna dihema da mting'hano na walongozwe na Itamali mwanage Haluni imulava nhosa.<verse eid="NUM 4:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sang'hano ya ulelo wa Melali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 4:29"/>“Uwapete wanhu wa ulelo wa Melali, kamba viweli mzing'holo zao na mzing'anda zao, <verse eid="NUM 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 4:30"/>uwapete wambigalo weli na miyaka malongo madatu mbaka miyaka malongo matano waja odaha kusang'hana mdihema da mting'hano. <verse eid="NUM 4:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 4:31"/>Sang'hano yao yokuwa kupapa zimbao na zifito na zimhanda na ivikalilo va dihema da mting'hano, <verse eid="NUM 4:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 4:32"/>vivija wapape na zimhanda za uluwa zizunguluke mhande zose, ivikalilo, na vifungilo vake na nzabi hamoja na vinhu vake vose na viya vake viyagwe vose. Na gweye kowapangila ivinhu va kupapa kamba matwaga gao vigeli. <verse eid="NUM 4:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 4:33"/>Sang'hano ayo itendigwe na wanhu wa ulelo wa Melali mna dihema da mting'hano na walongozwe na Itamali mwanage Haluni imulava nhosa.”<verse eid="NUM 4:33"/></para>
  <para style="s">Walawi opetigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 4:34"/>Avo, Musa na Haluni na vilongozi wayagwe wa wanhu wawapeta wanhu wa ulelo wa Kohati kamba viweli mzing'holo zao na mzing'anda zao. <verse eid="NUM 4:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 4:35"/>Wambigalo wose weli na miyaka malongo madatu mbaka malongo matano, kila munhu yadahile kusang'hana mna dihema da mting'hano, <verse eid="NUM 4:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 4:36"/>wose kwa wose wakala elufu mbili na magana saba na hamsini (2,750). <verse eid="NUM 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 4:37"/>Wanhu awo wa ulelo wa Kohati awo wasang'hane mdihema da mting'hano. Musa na Haluni wawapeta kamba Mndewa Imulungu viyamulagize Musa.<verse eid="NUM 4:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 4:38"/>Ulelo wa Gelishoni wapetigwa kamba viweli mzing'holo zao na mzing'anda zao. <verse eid="NUM 4:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 4:39"/>Wambigalo wose weli na miyaka malongo madatu mbaka malongo matano, kila munhu yadahile kusang'hana mna dihema da mting'hano, <verse eid="NUM 4:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 4:40"/>wose kwa wose wakala elufu mbili magana sita na selasini (2,630). <verse eid="NUM 4:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 4:41"/>Wanhu awo wa ulelo wa Gelishoni awo wasang'hane mdihema da mting'hano. Musa na Haluni wawapeta kamba Mndewa Imulungu viyawalagize.<verse eid="NUM 4:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 4:42"/>Ulelo wa Melali wapetigwa kamba viweli mna zing'holo zao na mzing'anda zao. <verse eid="NUM 4:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 4:43"/>Wambigalo wose weli na miyaka malongo madatu mbaka malongo matano, kila munhu yadahile kusang'hana mna dihema da mting'hano, <verse eid="NUM 4:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 4:44"/>wose kwa wose wakala elufu ndatu na magana mbili (3,200). <verse eid="NUM 4:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 4:45"/>Wanhu awo wa ulelo wa Melali awo wasang'hane mdihema da mting'hano. Musa na Haluni wawapeta kamba Mndewa Imulungu viyamulagize Musa.<verse eid="NUM 4:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 4:46"/>Avo, Walawi wose wapetigwa na Musa na Haluni na vilongozi wa wanhu, kamba viweli mzing'holo zao na mzing'anda zao. <verse eid="NUM 4:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 4:47"/>Wambigalo wose weli na miyaka malongo madatu mbaka malongo matano, kila munhu yadahile kusang'hana na kupapa dihema da mting'hano, <verse eid="NUM 4:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 4:48"/>wose kwa wose wakala elufu nane na magana tano na semanini (8,580). <verse eid="NUM 4:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 4:49"/>Kila munhu kagweleligwa sang'hano yake ya kinhu cha kupapa, wapetigwa kamba Mndewa Imulungu viyamulagize Musa.<verse eid="NUM 4:49"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="NUM 5"/>
  <para style="s">Wanhu wafitile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 5:1"/>Mndewa Imulungu kamulongela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 5:2"/>“Walagize Waizilaeli wamulave kunze ya ing'hambi munhu yoyose yeli na utamu wa dikulu na munhu yolawa udusi na munhu yoyose yafitile kwa kukwasa maiti. <verse eid="NUM 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 5:3"/>Muwalave kunze wanhu kamba awo, wambigalo na watwanzi ili sikuwawafitize wanhu zangu wayagwe mna ing'hambi inikala.” <verse eid="NUM 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 5:4"/>Avo Waizilaeli wawalava wanhu kamba awo kunze ya ing'hambi watenda kamba Mndewa Imulungu viyamulagize Musa.<verse eid="NUM 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Malipo mbuli ya kutenda gehile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 5:5"/>Mndewa Imulungu kamulagiza Musa, <verse eid="NUM 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 5:6"/>“Walongele Waizilaeli, ‘Kamba munhu yoyose mbigalo hebu mtwanzi yahaleka kumtamanila Mndewa Imulungu na yahatenda nzambi, munhu ayo kokuwa kabananga. <verse eid="NUM 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 5:7"/>Munhu ayo kolondigwa yaitambule nzambi ayo na kolondigwa yalihe kwa kija kiyabanange na vivija yongeze asilimia ishilini na abaho yamgwelele ija iyamtendele gehile. <verse eid="NUM 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 5:8"/>Lakini kamba munhu ayo kafa na kamba kabule ndugu yodaha kubokela kija kilihigwe, avo kinhu acho kigaligwe kwa Mndewa Imulungu mbuli ya iwalava nhosa. Vivija yagale ng'hondolo wa kimbigalo ili yatendeligwe loholo da nzambi zake. <verse eid="NUM 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 5:9"/>Kila sadaka ing'alile ilavigwa na Waizilaeli kwa Mndewa Imulungu yokuwa ya mulava nhosa. <verse eid="NUM 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 5:10"/>Kila kinhu kilavigwe kwa Mndewa Imulungu, kinhu acho chokuwa cha mulava nhosa.’ ”<verse eid="NUM 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mbuli ya watwanzi olawa kunze ya umzengo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 5:11"/>Abaho Mndewa Imulungu kamulongela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 5:12"/>“Walongele Waizilaeli, ‘Kamba mwehe wa munhu yahatenda ugoni na mbigalo iyagwe, <verse eid="NUM 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 5:13"/>bila mkasano wake kujuwa hata kamba kuduhu munhu yamgogile ugoni heyo kokuwa kafita. <verse eid="NUM 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 5:14"/>Avo, mkasano wake yahakona shaka kwa mwehe wake ayo kamba kaifitiza hebu kamba yahamonela wivu hata kamba haifitize, <verse eid="NUM 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 5:15"/>avo wose wabili wachole kwa mulava nhosa na wagale nhosa ilondigwa, nhosa yenyego iwe vibaba vibili va usage wa shaili, lakini sikuugeligwe mavuta hebu ubani, kwavija ayo nhosa ya ndiya ya mbigalo yomonela shaka mwehe wake, nhosa ayo yolavigwa kwa mbuli ayo.<verse eid="NUM 5:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 5:16"/>“ ‘Mulava nhosa yamgale mtwanzi ayo behi, na yamwimize kuulongozi wa Mndewa Imulungu. <verse eid="NUM 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 5:17"/>Abaho yagele mazi gong'ala mna inongo na abaho yadehe timbwisi dili kuuvungu wa dihema da mting'hano na yadigele mmo mnongo ili gamazi gawe usungu. <verse eid="NUM 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 5:18"/>Mulava nhosa yamwike mtwanzi ayo kuulongozi wa Mndewa Imulungu na yamgubule zimvili na yamgwee ayo inhosa ya indiya ilavigwe mbuli ya koneligwa shaka. Imulava nhosa yagoge inongo ili na mazi gogala makungu. <verse eid="NUM 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 5:19"/>Abaho mulava nhosa yamduwilize ayo imtwanzi kuno yolonga, “Kamba huwasile na mbigalo iyagwe, na kuifitiza kuno kwa mmakono ga mkasano wako, avo makungu golawa mmazi gano geli usungu sikugakupate. <verse eid="NUM 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 5:20"/>Lakini kamba kubena dilagano na kuno kwa mmakono ga mkasano wako na kuifitiza kwa kuwasa na mbigalo iyagwe yeli siyo mkasano wako, <verse eid="NUM 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 5:21"/>avo Mndewa Imulungu yakukoboze na uduwiligwe mna iwanhu wako, uwe mgumba na inda yako ivimbe. <verse eid="NUM 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 5:22"/>Mazi gano gogala makungu gengile mna iinda yako na gakutende mgumba na inda yako ivimbe.” Na ayo imtwanzi yedike, “Ona, Ona.”<verse eid="NUM 5:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 5:23"/>“ ‘Abaho mulava nhosa yagandike gago gamakungu mkitabu na yagakoshele mgamazi gago gausungu. <verse eid="NUM 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 5:24"/>Abaho yamng'weze mtwanzi ayo gago gamazi geli usungu gogala makungu, nago gokwingila mgati na gomtenda inda yake ilume ng'hani. <verse eid="NUM 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 5:25"/>Abaho imulava nhosa yaisole ayo inhosa ya indiya ya koneligwa shaka mmakono ga ayo imtwanzi na yainule uchanha kamba kilaguso kwa Mndewa Imulungu abaho yaigale hana uupango wa nhosa. <verse eid="NUM 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 5:26"/>Abaho yadehe ganza dimoja da ayo inhosa ya indiya kamba kinhu cha kukumbuka kamba nhosa ayo yose ilavigwa kwa Mndewa Imulungu na yaisome moto muupango wa nhosa. Abaho yamng'weze ayo imtwanzi gago gamazi. <verse eid="NUM 5:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 5:27"/>Yahamambukiza kugang'wa gago gamazi, kamba kaifitiza na kabena dilagano da umzengo, gago gamazi gogala makungu gomtenda inda yake ilume ng'hani, lukuli lwake lovimba na isambo yosambuka sambuka. Mtwanzi ayo kogakalila makungu mna iwanhu wake. <verse eid="NUM 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 5:28"/>Lakini kamba mtwanzi ayo haifitize bule na habanange kinhu, avo kuduhu kinhu chonda kimpate, na kolela wana.<verse eid="NUM 5:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 5:29"/>“ ‘Avo gano gago malagizo kwa mbuli ya koneligwa shaka, kamba mtwanzi kammakono ga mkasano wake, na kobena lagizo da umzengo na koifitiza, <verse eid="NUM 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 5:30"/>hebu kamba mbigalo yahakona wivu na komonela shaka mwehe wake. Komwimiza mtwanzi ayo kuulongozi wa Mndewa Imulungu, imulava nhosa kotenda gose golondigwa. <verse eid="NUM 5:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 5:31"/>Imkasano kokuwa habanange kinhu, ila imtwanzi kolondigwa yagae kwa awo ubananzi wake.’ ”<verse eid="NUM 5:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="NUM 6"/>
  <para style="s">Malagizo ga Mnazili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 6:1"/>Mndewa Imulungu kamulongela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 6:2"/>“Walongele Waizilaeli vino, ‘Kamba mbigalo hebu mtwanzi yahaiduwila yawe Mnazili, kamba heyo kailava kwa Mndewa Imulungu, <verse eid="NUM 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 6:3"/>avo sikuyang'we divai hebu ugimbi, na sikuyang'we mazi ga zabibu hebu kuja zabibu zipile hebu zinyalile. <verse eid="NUM 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 6:4"/>Kipindi acho chose sikuyaje kinhu chochose kulawa mumzabibu, dikokwa hebu ing'hwembe ya kunze.<verse eid="NUM 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 6:5"/>“ ‘Kipindi acho chose sikuyabee mvili zake, mbaka chahesha acho ikipindi cha kuilava kwa Mndewa Imulungu, yakale yang'alile yazileke mvili zake ziwe nhali. <verse eid="NUM 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 6:6"/>Siku zose viyokala kuno kailava kwa Mndewa Imulungu, sikuyaukwesele mtufi wa munhu yafile, <verse eid="NUM 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 6:7"/>hata kamba yahawa tatake, mamake, mkulu wake hebu mdodo wake hebu lumbu jake, sikuyaifitize kwavija mvili zake zolagusa heyo kailava kwa Mndewa Imulungu. <verse eid="NUM 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 6:8"/>Kipindi acho chose kokuwa kang'ala kwa Mndewa Imulungu.<verse eid="NUM 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 6:9"/>“ ‘Kamba munhu yahafa kwa kusinhukiza behi yake na kuzifitiza mvili zake, avo yabete mbaka siku da saba na kokuwa kang'ala na mdisiku da saba yabee mvili zake. <verse eid="NUM 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 6:10"/>Mna isiku ya nane yamgalile imulava nhosa hana ulwivi lwa dihema da mting'hano huwa wabili hebu makinda mabili ga njiwa. <verse eid="NUM 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 6:11"/>Mulava nhosa yamulave imoja kwa nhosa ya kusegesa nzambi na iyagwe kwa nhosa ya kusoma moto, na heyo komtendela loholo, kwavija katenda nzambi mbuli ya maiti. Siku didijo yaditende pala jake ding'ale, <verse eid="NUM 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 6:12"/>na yailave kwa Mndewa Imulungu kwa siku zake za kuilava. Avo siku za ichanduso hazipetigwa bule kwavija mvili zake zikalile zilavigwe kwa Mndewa Imulungu zifitizigwa. Avo, yagale mwana ng'hondolo wa kimbigalo wa mwaka umoja kamba nhosa ya kulihila gehile.<verse eid="NUM 6:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 6:13"/>“ ‘Gano gago malagizo ga munhu Mnazili vonda yamambukize siku za kuilava kwa Mndewa Imulungu. Yagaligwe hana ulwivi lwa dihema da mting'hano, <verse eid="NUM 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 6:14"/>na yamulavile Mndewa Imulungu nhosa zake. Mwana ng'hondolo wa kimbigalo wa mwaka umoja yelibule kilema chochose mbuli ya nhosa ya kusoma moto, na mwana ng'hondolo wa kitwanzi wa mwaka umoja yelibule kilema chochose mbuli ya nhosa ya kusegesa nzambi, na ng'hondolo wa kimbigalo yelibule kilema chochose mbuli ya nhosa ya kugala kuilumba. <verse eid="NUM 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 6:15"/>Vivija yagale kigelo kimemile magate hagageligwe hamila, na maandazi ga usage ulibule midundulu na utibwilizigwe na mavuta na vigate visisili vigeligwe mavuta na nhosa ya ndiya na king'waji.<verse eid="NUM 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 6:16"/>“ ‘Mulava nhosa yamulavile Mndewa Imulungu vinhu avo vose na vivija yalave inhosa ya kusegesa nzambi na nhosa ya kusoma moto. <verse eid="NUM 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 6:17"/>Yamulavile Mndewa Imulungu ayo ing'hondolo wa kimbigalo kamba nhosa ya kugala kuilumba vivija yalave na ikigelo cha magate hagageligwe hamila na inhosa ya indiya na iking'waji.<verse eid="NUM 6:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 6:18"/>“ ‘Aho hana ulwivi lwa dihema da mting'hano, munhu ayo yaiduwile yabee mvili zake na yazigele muumoto ukwaka hasi ya inhosa ya kugala kuilumba.<verse eid="NUM 6:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 6:19"/>“ ‘Abaho mulava nhosa yasole mkono wa ija ing'hondolo wa kimbigalo kuno ukimusigwe, yamgwee mmakono munhu ayo yaiduwile yahamambukiza kubea mvili zake ziyakalile nazo viyailavile kwa Mndewa Imulungu na vivija yamgwee andazi dimoja hadigeligwe hamila kulawa mkigelo na kigate kimoja kisisili hakigeligwe hamila. <verse eid="NUM 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 6:20"/>Abaho mulava nhosa yavinule uchanha vinhu avo kulagusa kamba vilavigwa kwa Mndewa Imulungu. Vinhu avo vose ving'ala kwa imulava nhosa hamoja na ikidali kinuligwe uchanha na ikihili kilavigwe kamba nhosa. Vinhu avo vose vahatendigwa, munhu ayo yaiduwile kodaha kung'wa divai.<verse eid="NUM 6:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 6:21"/>“ ‘Gano gago malagizo kwa munhu Mnazili. Nhosa yake kwa Mndewa Imulungu iwe kamba viyaiduwile, hamoja kodaha kwengeza kulava kinhu chochose, heyo kolondigwa kutenda kamba viyaiduwile kamba malagizo gakuilava kwa Mndewa Imulungu vigalonda.’ ”<verse eid="NUM 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kuwatambikila wanhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 6:22"/>Mndewa Imulungu kamulongela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 6:23"/>“Mulongele Haluni na wanage, ‘Kamba vino vivo vimulondigwa kuwatambikila Waizilaeli. Muwalongele vino,<verse eid="NUM 6:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 6:24"/>Mndewa Imulungu yawatendele ganogile na yawakalize.<verse eid="NUM 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 6:25"/>Mndewa Imulungu yawamwemwesele mulenge wa kihanga chake na yawonele bazi.<verse eid="NUM 6:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 6:26"/>Mndewa Imulungu yawenulile kihanga chake na yawagwee tindiwalo.’ ”<verse eid="NUM 6:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 6:27"/>Mndewa Imulungu kalonga, “Kamba oditambula twaga jangu mbuli ya Waizilaeli, niye nowatendela ganogile.”<verse eid="NUM 6:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="NUM 7"/>
  <para style="s">Sadaka za vilongozi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 7:1"/>Mna isiku Musa viyamambukize kudimiza wima dihema ding'ala, kadigidila mavuta na kadilava kwa Mndewa Imulungu hamoja na iviya vake vose, na kaugidila mavuta uupango wa nhosa na viya vake vose. <verse eid="NUM 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 7:2"/>Vilongozi wa Izilaeli na iwakulu wa zing'holo na vilongozi wa gamakabila, awo wawemilile iwanhu wapetigwe weza mdihema, <verse eid="NUM 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 7:3"/>wamgalila Mndewa Imulungu sadaka zao. Mituka igubikigwe sita na ming'ombe mibigalo longo na wabili, na kila vilongozi wabili wagala mtuka umoja, na kila kilongozi kagala ng'ombe imoja mbigalo. Viwavigalile kuulongozi wa dihema ding'ala, <verse eid="NUM 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 7:4"/>Mndewa Imulungu kamulongela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 7:5"/>“Uvibokele vinhu avo ili visang'hanilwe mna dihema da mting'hano, uwagwee Walawi vinhu avo, kila munhu kwa sang'hano yake.” <verse eid="NUM 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 7:6"/>Avo Musa kasola imituka na iming'ombe mibigalo kawagwaa Walawi. <verse eid="NUM 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 7:7"/>Wagelishoni wagweleligwa mituka mibili na ming'ombe mibigalo mine, kamba sang'hano yao ya kupapila ivinhu va dihema viikalile, <verse eid="NUM 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 7:8"/>na Wamelali wagweleligwa mituka mine na ming'ombe mibigalo mine, ili watendele sang'hano yao ya kupapila ivinhu va dihema. Walongozwa na kilongozi wao Itamali mwanage Haluni imulava nhosa. <verse eid="NUM 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 7:9"/>Lakini Musa hawagwelele kinhu chochose Wakohati, kwavija hewo wakala na sang'hano ya kuvilola goya viya ving'ala vilondigwa kupapigwa mmaega.<verse eid="NUM 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 7:10"/>Vilongozi awo walava sadaka siku didija upango wa nhosa viugidiligwe mavuta mbuli ya kuulava upango awo kwa Mndewa Imulungu. Walava sadaka zao kuulongozi wa upango wa nhosa. <verse eid="NUM 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 7:11"/>Mndewa Imulungu kamulongela Musa, “Kila siku kilongozi imoja yagale sadaka yake mbuli ya kuulava kumwangu niye Mndewa Imulungu upango wa nhosa.”<verse eid="NUM 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 7:12"/>Avo, munhu yasongile kugala sadaka siku ya ichanduso kakala Nashoni mwanage Aminadabu kulawa kabila da Yuda. <verse eid="NUM 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 7:13"/>Sadaka zake zikala, sahani imoja ya shaba ili na uzito wa kilo imoja na nusu na bakuli imoja ya shaba ili na uzito wa gilamu magana manane, kamba viwapimaga mna dihema ding'ala, ayo isahani na ibakuli vimemezigwa usage ulibule midundulu na utibwilizigwe na mavuta mbuli ya nhosa ya ndiya, <verse eid="NUM 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 7:14"/>na kisahani kimoja cha zahabu kili na uzito wa gilamu gana na longo kuno kimemezigwa ubani, <verse eid="NUM 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 7:15"/>bofu bigalo da ng'ombe, ng'hondolo wa kimbigalo imoja na mwana ng'hondolo wa kimbigalo yeli na mwaka umoja, mbuli ya nhosa ya kusoma moto, <verse eid="NUM 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 7:16"/>mbuzi mbigalo imoja mbuli ya nhosa ya kusegesa nzambi, <verse eid="NUM 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 7:17"/>ming'ombe mibigalo mibili, ng'hondolo wa kimbigalo watano, mbuzi wa kimbigalo watano na wana ng'hondolo wa kimbigalo watano wa mwaka umoja mbuli ya nhosa za kugala kuilumba. Azo zikala sadaka za Nashoni mwanage Aminadabu.<verse eid="NUM 7:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 7:18"/>Siku da kabili, Nasaneli mwanage Suali kilongozi wa kabila da Isakali kagala sadaka zake. <verse eid="NUM 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 7:19"/>Sadaka zake zikala, sahani imoja ya shaba ili na uzito wa kilo imoja na nusu na bakuli imoja ya shaba ili na uzito wa gilamu magana manane, kamba viwapimaga mna dihema ding'ala, ayo isahani na ibakuli vimemezigwa usage ulibule midundulu utibwilizigwe na mavuta mbuli ya nhosa ya ndiya, <verse eid="NUM 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 7:20"/>na kisahani kimoja cha zahabu kili na uzito wa gilamu gana na longo kuno kimemezigwa ubani, <verse eid="NUM 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 7:21"/>bofu bigalo da ng'ombe, ng'hondolo wa kimbigalo imoja na mwana ng'hondolo wa kimbigalo yeli na mwaka umoja, mbuli ya nhosa ya kusoma moto, <verse eid="NUM 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 7:22"/>na mbuzi mbigalo imoja mbuli ya nhosa ya kusegesa nzambi, <verse eid="NUM 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 7:23"/>na ming'ombe mibigalo mibili, ng'hondolo wa kimbigalo watano, mbuzi wa kimbigalo watano na wana ng'hondolo wa kimbigalo watano wa mwaka umoja mbuli ya nhosa za kugala kuilumba. Azo zikala sadaka za Nasaneli mwanage Suali.<verse eid="NUM 7:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 7:24"/>Siku da kadatu ikala zamu ya Eliabu mwanage Heloni, kilongozi wa kabila da Zabuloni. <verse eid="NUM 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 7:25"/>Sadaka zake zikala, sahani imoja ya shaba ili na uzito wa kilo imoja na nusu na bakuli imoja ya shaba ili na uzito wa gilamu magana manane, kamba viwapimaga mna dihema ding'ala, ayo isahani na ibakuli vimemezigwa usage ulibule midundulu utibwilizigwe na mavuta mbuli ya nhosa ya ndiya, <verse eid="NUM 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 7:26"/>na kisahani kimoja cha zahabu kili na uzito wa gilamu gana na longo kuno kimemezigwa ubani, <verse eid="NUM 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 7:27"/>bofu bigalo da ng'ombe, ng'hondolo wa kimbigalo imoja na mwana ng'hondolo wa kimbigalo yeli na mwaka umoja, mbuli ya nhosa ya kusoma moto, <verse eid="NUM 7:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 7:28"/>na mbuzi mbigalo imoja mbuli ya nhosa ya kusegesa nzambi, <verse eid="NUM 7:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 7:29"/>na ming'ombe mibigalo mibili, ng'hondolo wa kimbigalo watano, mbuzi wa kimbigalo watano na wana ng'hondolo wa kimbigalo watano wa mwaka umoja mbuli ya nhosa za kugala kuilumba. Azo zikala sadaka za Eliabu mwanage Heloni.<verse eid="NUM 7:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 7:30"/>Siku ya ikane ikala zamu ya Elisuli mwanage Shedeuli, kilongozi wa kabila da Lubeni. <verse eid="NUM 7:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 7:31"/>Sadaka zake zikala, sahani imoja ya shaba ili na uzito wa kilo imoja na nusu na bakuli imoja ya shaba ili na uzito wa gilamu magana manane, kamba viwapimaga mna dihema ding'ala, ayo isahani na ibakuli vimemezigwa usage ulibule midundulu utibwilizigwe na mavuta mbuli ya nhosa ya ndiya, <verse eid="NUM 7:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 7:32"/>na kisahani kimoja cha zahabu kili na uzito wa gilamu gana na longo kuno kimemezigwa ubani, <verse eid="NUM 7:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 7:33"/>bofu bigalo da ng'ombe, ng'hondolo wa kimbigalo imoja na mwana ng'hondolo wa kimbigalo yeli na mwaka umoja, mbuli ya nhosa ya kusoma moto, <verse eid="NUM 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 7:34"/>na mbuzi mbigalo imoja mbuli ya nhosa ya kusegesa nzambi, <verse eid="NUM 7:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 7:35"/>na ming'ombe mibigalo mibili, ng'hondolo wa kimbigalo watano, mbuzi wa kimbigalo watano na wana ng'hondolo wa kimbigalo watano wa mwaka umoja mbuli ya nhosa za kugala kuilumba. Azo zikala sadaka za Elisuli mwanage Shedeuli.<verse eid="NUM 7:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 7:36"/>Siku ya tano ikala zamu ya Shelumieli mwanage Sulishadai, kilongozi wa kabila da Simeoni. <verse eid="NUM 7:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 7:37"/>Sadaka zake zikala, sahani imoja ya shaba ili na uzito wa kilo imoja na nusu na bakuli imoja ya shaba ili na uzito wa gilamu magana manane, kamba viwapimaga mna dihema ding'ala, ayo isahani na ibakuli vimemezigwa usage ulibule midundulu utibwilizigwe na mavuta mbuli ya nhosa ya ndiya, <verse eid="NUM 7:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 7:38"/>na kisahani kimoja cha zahabu kili na uzito wa gilamu gana na longo kuno kimemezigwa ubani, <verse eid="NUM 7:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 7:39"/>bofu bigalo da ng'ombe, ng'hondolo wa kimbigalo imoja na mwana ng'hondolo wa kimbigalo yeli na mwaka umoja, mbuli ya nhosa ya kusoma moto, <verse eid="NUM 7:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 7:40"/>na mbuzi mbigalo imoja mbuli ya nhosa ya kusegesa nzambi, <verse eid="NUM 7:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 7:41"/>na ming'ombe mibigalo mibili, ng'hondolo wa kimbigalo watano, mbuzi wa kimbigalo watano na wana ng'hondolo wa kimbigalo watano wa mwaka umoja mbuli ya nhosa za kugala kuilumba. Azo zikala sadaka za Shelumieli mwanage Sulishadai.<verse eid="NUM 7:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 7:42"/>Siku da sita ikala zamu ya Eliasafu mwanage Deueli, kilongozi wa kabila da Gadi. <verse eid="NUM 7:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 7:43"/>Sadaka zake zikala, sahani imoja ya shaba ili na uzito wa kilo imoja na nusu na bakuli imoja ya shaba ili na uzito wa gilamu magana manane, kamba viwapimaga mna dihema ding'ala, ayo isahani na ibakuli vimemezigwa usage ulibule midundulu utibwilizigwe na mavuta mbuli ya nhosa ya ndiya, <verse eid="NUM 7:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 7:44"/>na kisahani kimoja cha zahabu kili na uzito wa gilamu gana na longo kuno kimemezigwa ubani, <verse eid="NUM 7:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 7:45"/>bofu bigalo da ng'ombe, ng'hondolo wa kimbigalo imoja na mwana ng'hondolo wa kimbigalo yeli na mwaka umoja, mbuli ya nhosa ya kusoma moto, <verse eid="NUM 7:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 7:46"/>na mbuzi mbigalo imoja mbuli ya nhosa ya kusegesa nzambi, <verse eid="NUM 7:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 7:47"/>na ming'ombe mibigalo mibili, ng'hondolo wa kimbigalo watano, mbuzi wa kimbigalo watano na wana ng'hondolo wa kimbigalo watano wa mwaka umoja mbuli ya nhosa za kugala kuilumba. Azo zikala sadaka za Eliasafu mwanage Deueli.<verse eid="NUM 7:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 7:48"/>Siku da saba ikala zamu ya Elishama mwanage Amihudi, kilongozi wa kabila da Efulaimu. <verse eid="NUM 7:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 7:49"/>Nhosa zake zikala, sahani imoja ya shaba ili na uzito wa kilo imoja na nusu na bakuli imoja ya shaba ili na uzito wa gilamu magana manane, kamba viwapimaga mna dihema ding'ala, ayo isahani na ibakuli vimemezigwa usage ulibule midundulu utibwilizigwe na mavuta mbuli ya nhosa ya ndiya, <verse eid="NUM 7:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 7:50"/>na kisahani kimoja cha zahabu kili na uzito wa gilamu gana na longo kuno kimemezigwa ubani, <verse eid="NUM 7:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 7:51"/>bofu bigalo da ng'ombe, ng'hondolo wa kimbigalo imoja na mwana ng'hondolo wa kimbigalo yeli na mwaka umoja, mbuli ya nhosa ya kusoma moto, <verse eid="NUM 7:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="NUM 7:52"/>na mbuzi mbigalo imoja mbuli ya nhosa ya kusegesa nzambi, <verse eid="NUM 7:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NUM 7:53"/>na ming'ombe mibigalo mibili, ng'hondolo wa kimbigalo watano, mbuzi wa kimbigalo watano na wana ng'hondolo wa kimbigalo watano wa mwaka umoja mbuli ya nhosa za kugala kuilumba. Azo sadaka za Elishama mwanage Amihudi.<verse eid="NUM 7:53"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="NUM 7:54"/>Siku da nane ikala zamu ya Gamalieli mwanage Pedasuli, kilongozi wa kabila da Manase. <verse eid="NUM 7:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="NUM 7:55"/>Nhosa zake zikala, sahani imoja ya shaba ili na uzito wa kilo imoja na nusu na bakuli imoja ya shaba ili na uzito wa gilamu magana manane, kamba viwapimaga mna dihema ding'ala, ayo isahani na ibakuli vimemezigwa usage ulibule midundulu utibwilizigwe na mavuta mbuli ya nhosa ya ndiya, <verse eid="NUM 7:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="NUM 7:56"/>na kisahani kimoja cha zahabu kili na uzito wa gilamu gana na longo kuno kimemezigwa ubani, <verse eid="NUM 7:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="NUM 7:57"/>bofu bigalo da ng'ombe, ng'hondolo wa kimbigalo imoja na mwana ng'hondolo wa kimbigalo yeli na mwaka umoja, mbuli ya nhosa ya kusoma moto, <verse eid="NUM 7:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="NUM 7:58"/>na mbuzi mbigalo imoja mbuli ya nhosa ya kusegesa nzambi, <verse eid="NUM 7:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="NUM 7:59"/>na ming'ombe mibigalo mibili, ng'hondolo wa kimbigalo watano, mbuzi wa kimbigalo watano na wana ng'hondolo wa kimbigalo watano wa mwaka umoja mbuli ya nhosa za kugala kuilumba. Azo zikala sadaka za Gamalieli mwanage Pedasuli.<verse eid="NUM 7:59"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="NUM 7:60"/>Siku da tisa ikala zamu ya Abidani mwanage Gideoni, kilongozi wa kabila da Benjamini. <verse eid="NUM 7:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="NUM 7:61"/>Sadaka zake zikala, sahani imoja ya shaba ili na uzito wa kilo imoja na nusu na bakuli imoja ya shaba ili na uzito wa gilamu magana manane, kamba viwapimaga mna dihema ding'ala, ayo isahani na ibakuli vimemezigwa usage ulibule midundulu utibwilizigwe na mavuta mbuli ya nhosa ya ndiya, <verse eid="NUM 7:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="NUM 7:62"/>na kisahani kimoja cha zahabu kili na uzito wa gilamu gana na longo kuno kimemezigwa ubani, <verse eid="NUM 7:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="NUM 7:63"/>bofu bigalo da ng'ombe, ng'hondolo wa kimbigalo imoja na mwana ng'hondolo wa kimbigalo yeli na mwaka umoja, mbuli ya nhosa ya kusoma moto, <verse eid="NUM 7:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="NUM 7:64"/>na mbuzi mbigalo imoja mbuli ya nhosa ya kusegesa nzambi, <verse eid="NUM 7:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="NUM 7:65"/>na ming'ombe mibigalo mibili, ng'hondolo wa kimbigalo watano, mbuzi wa kimbigalo watano na wana ng'hondolo wa kimbigalo watano wa mwaka umoja mbuli ya nhosa za kugala kuilumba. Azo zikala sadaka za Abidani mwanage Gideoni.<verse eid="NUM 7:65"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="NUM 7:66"/>Siku ya longo ikala zamu ya Ahiezeli mwanage Amishadai, kilongozi wa kabila da Dani. <verse eid="NUM 7:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="NUM 7:67"/>Sadaka zake zikala, sahani imoja ya shaba ili na uzito wa kilo imoja na nusu na bakuli imoja ya shaba ili na uzito wa gilamu magana manane, kamba viwapimaga mna dihema ding'ala, ayo isahani na ibakuli vimemezigwa usage ulibule midundulu utibwilizigwe na mavuta mbuli ya nhosa ya ndiya, <verse eid="NUM 7:67"/><verse number="68" style="v" sid="NUM 7:68"/>na kisahani kimoja cha zahabu kili na uzito wa gilamu gana na longo kuno kimemezigwa ubani, <verse eid="NUM 7:68"/><verse number="69" style="v" sid="NUM 7:69"/>na bofu bigalo da ng'ombe, ng'hondolo wa kimbigalo imoja na mwana ng'hondolo wa kimbigalo yeli na mwaka umoja, mbuli ya nhosa ya kusoma moto, <verse eid="NUM 7:69"/><verse number="70" style="v" sid="NUM 7:70"/>na mbuzi mbigalo imoja mbuli ya nhosa ya kusegesa nzambi, <verse eid="NUM 7:70"/><verse number="71" style="v" sid="NUM 7:71"/>na ming'ombe mibigalo mibili, ng'hondolo wa kimbigalo watano, mbuzi wa kimbigalo watano na wana ng'hondolo wa kimbigalo watano wa mwaka umoja mbuli ya nhosa za kugala kuilumba. Azo sadaka za Ahiezeli mwanage Amishadai.<verse eid="NUM 7:71"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="NUM 7:72"/>Siku ya longo na imoja ikala zamu ya Pagieli mwanage Okilani, kilongozi wa kabila da Asheli. <verse eid="NUM 7:72"/><verse number="73" style="v" sid="NUM 7:73"/>Sadaka zake zikala, sahani imoja ya shaba ili na uzito wa kilo imoja na nusu na bakuli imoja ya shaba ili na uzito wa gilamu magana manane, kamba viwapimaga mna dihema ding'ala, ayo isahani na ibakuli vimemezigwa usage ulibule midundulu utibwilizigwe na mavuta mbuli ya nhosa ya ndiya, <verse eid="NUM 7:73"/><verse number="74" style="v" sid="NUM 7:74"/>na kisahani kimoja cha zahabu kili na uzito wa gilamu gana na longo kuno kimemezigwa ubani, <verse eid="NUM 7:74"/><verse number="75" style="v" sid="NUM 7:75"/>bofu bigalo da ng'ombe, ng'hondolo wa kimbigalo imoja na mwana ng'hondolo wa kimbigalo yeli na mwaka umoja, mbuli ya nhosa ya kusoma moto, <verse eid="NUM 7:75"/><verse number="76" style="v" sid="NUM 7:76"/>na mbuzi mbigalo imoja mbuli ya nhosa ya kusegesa nzambi, <verse eid="NUM 7:76"/><verse number="77" style="v" sid="NUM 7:77"/>na ming'ombe mibigalo mibili, ng'hondolo wa kimbigalo watano, mbuzi wa kimbigalo watano na wana ng'hondolo wa kimbigalo watano wa mwaka umoja mbuli ya nhosa za kugala kuilumba. Azo zikala sadaka za Pagieli mwanage Okilani.<verse eid="NUM 7:77"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="NUM 7:78"/>Siku ya longo na mbili ikala zamu ya Ahila mwanage Enani, kilongozi wa kabila da Nafutali. <verse eid="NUM 7:78"/><verse number="79" style="v" sid="NUM 7:79"/>Sadaka zake zikala, sahani imoja ya shaba ili na uzito wa kilo imoja na nusu na bakuli imoja ya shaba ili na uzito wa gilamu magana manane, kamba viwapimaga mna dihema ding'ala, ayo isahani na ibakuli vimemezigwa usage ulibule midundulu utibwilizigwe na mavuta mbuli ya nhosa ya ndiya, <verse eid="NUM 7:79"/><verse number="80" style="v" sid="NUM 7:80"/>na kisahani kimoja cha zahabu kili na uzito wa gilamu gana na longo kuno kimemezigwa ubani, <verse eid="NUM 7:80"/><verse number="81" style="v" sid="NUM 7:81"/>na bofu bigalo da ng'ombe, ng'hondolo wa kimbigalo imoja na mwana ng'hondolo wa kimbigalo yeli na mwaka umoja, mbuli ya nhosa ya kusoma moto, <verse eid="NUM 7:81"/><verse number="82" style="v" sid="NUM 7:82"/>na mbuzi mbigalo imoja mbuli ya nhosa ya kusegesa nzambi, <verse eid="NUM 7:82"/><verse number="83" style="v" sid="NUM 7:83"/>na ming'ombe mibigalo mibili, ng'hondolo wa kimbigalo watano, mbuzi wa kimbigalo watano na wana ng'hondolo wa kimbigalo watano wa mwaka umoja mbuli ya nhosa za kugala kuilumba. Azo zikala sadaka za Ahila mwanage Enani.<verse eid="NUM 7:83"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="84" style="v" sid="NUM 7:84"/>Sadaka zose kwa zose zilavigwe na vilongozi wa Izilaeli mbuli ya uupango wa nhosa siku viulavigwe kwa Mndewa Imulungu zikala, sahani za shaba longo na mbili, bakuli za shaba longo na mbili, na visahani va zahabu longo na mbili. <verse eid="NUM 7:84"/><verse number="85" style="v" sid="NUM 7:85"/>Kila sahani ya shaba ikala na uzito wa kilo imoja na nusu, na kila bakuli ya shaba ikala na uzito wa gilamu magana manane. Avo, viya vose avo vikala na uzito wa kilo malongo mabili na saba na gilamu magana sita kamba viwapimaga mna dihema ding'ala.<verse eid="NUM 7:85"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="86" style="v" sid="NUM 7:86"/>Avo ivisahani va zahabu longo na vibili vimemile ubani, kila kimoja kikala na uzito wa gilamu gana na longo kamba viwapimaga mna dihema ding'ala, vose kwa vose vikala na uzito wa kilo imoja na gilamu magana madatu na malongo mabili. <verse eid="NUM 7:86"/><verse number="87" style="v" sid="NUM 7:87"/>Wanyama wose wagaligwe mbuli ya nhosa ya kusoma moto wakala ming'ombe mibigalo longo na mibili, na ng'hondolo mbigalo longo na wabili, na wana ng'hondolo wa kimbigalo wa mwaka umoja wakala longo na mbili, hamoja na inhosa ya indiya na mbuzi mbigalo longo na mbili mbuli ya nhosa ya kusegesa nzambi. <verse eid="NUM 7:87"/><verse number="88" style="v" sid="NUM 7:88"/>Wanyama wose wagaligwe mbuli ya nhosa ya kugala kuilumba wakala, ming'ombe mibigalo malongo mabili na wane, ng'hondolo mbigalo malongo sita, mbuzi mbigalo malongo sita na wana ng'hondolo wa kimbigalo wa mwaka umoja malongo sita. Azo zizo sadaka zilavigwe mbuli ya upango wa nhosa, siku viugidiligwe mavuta.<verse eid="NUM 7:88"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="89" style="v" sid="NUM 7:89"/>Musa viyengile mna dihema da mting'hano ili kulonga na Mndewa Imulungu, kahulika sauti kulawa mwambu wa uchanha wa ingubiko ya disanduku da lagano, hagati ya awo iviumbe wabili weli na mabawa, sauti ayo imulongela.<verse eid="NUM 7:89"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="NUM 8"/>
  <para style="s">Kwikigwa kwa taa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 8:1"/>Mndewa Imulungu kamulongela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 8:2"/>“Mulongele Haluni, ‘Vonda uzike azo zitaa saba mna ikingolobweda, uzike ili zimwemwese kuulongozi wa acho ikingolobweda.’ ”<verse eid="NUM 8:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 8:3"/>Haluni katenda vivo, kazika azo zitaa ili zimwemwese mwambu wa kuulongozi wa ikingolobweda, kamba Mndewa Imulungu viyamulagize Musa. <verse eid="NUM 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 8:4"/>Kulawa uchanha mbaka hasi acho ikingolobweda kitendigwa kwa zahabu isomigwe kwa moto kamba vivija Mndewa Imulungu viyamulagusile Musa.<verse eid="NUM 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Walawi osunhigwa na kulavigwa kwa Imulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 8:5"/>Mndewa Imulungu kamulagiza Musa, <verse eid="NUM 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 8:6"/>“Uwabagule Walawi mna iwanhu wa Izilaeli, na uwatende wang'ale. <verse eid="NUM 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 8:7"/>Vino vivo vonda uwatende wang'ale, wamizile mazi gang'alile abaho uwalongele wakaibee mzing'huli zao zose, na wafuwe viwalo vao na wakoge. <verse eid="NUM 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 8:8"/>Abaho wasole bofu dimoja bigalo da ng'ombe na nhosa ya ndiya, awo uusage unogile utibwilizigwe na mavuta. Vivija na gweye usole dibofu diyagwe da ng'ombe mbuli ya nhosa ya kusegesa nzambi. <verse eid="NUM 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 8:9"/>Abaho uwatende wanhu wose wa Izilaeli waiting'hane na uwagale Walawi kuulongozi wa dihema da mting'hano. <verse eid="NUM 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 8:10"/>Vonda uwagale Walawi kuulongozi wangu, Waizilaeli wose wayagwe wawekile makono gao Walawi, <verse eid="NUM 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 8:11"/>abaho Haluni yaweke awo Iwalawi kuulongozi wangu kamba nhosa ya kwinuligwa uchanha mna iwanhu wa Izilaeli ili wanisang'hanile. <verse eid="NUM 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 8:12"/>Abaho Walawi weke makono gao mna gamapala ga awo iwang'ombe mbigalo, imoja umulave nhosa ya kusegesa nzambi, na iyagwe umulave nhosa ya kusoma moto ilavigwe kumwangu, ili uwatendele loholo awo Iwalawi.<verse eid="NUM 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 8:13"/>“Abaho uwatende Walawi weme kuulongozi wa Haluni na wanage na uweke kuulongozi wangu kamba nhosa ya kwinuligwa uchanha. <verse eid="NUM 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 8:14"/>Kwa nzila ayo kowabagula Walawi mna iwanhu wa Izilaeli wayagwe ili wawe wangu. <verse eid="NUM 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 8:15"/>Wahamambukiza kuwatenda Walawi wang'ale na kuwalava kamba nhosa ya kwinuligwa uchanha, odaha kusang'hana kuna dihema da mting'hano. <verse eid="NUM 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 8:16"/>Awo walavigwa kumwangu, hanhu ha wana chaudele wa kimbigalo wa Waizilaeli. <verse eid="NUM 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 8:17"/>Kwavija wana chaudele wa kimbigalo mna iwanhu wa Izilaeli wangu niye, yawe munhu hebu mnyama, kwavija kudisiku viniwakomile wana chaudele wose ako Misili, niwalava hewo kumwangu. <verse eid="NUM 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 8:18"/>Avo, sambi nowasola Walawi hanhu ha wana wa chaudele wa Waizilaeli, <verse eid="NUM 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 8:19"/>na nimgwelela Haluni na wanage, kamba nhunza kulawa kwa Waizilaeli, ili wasang'hane kuna dihema da mting'hano mbuli ya Waizilaeli na wawatendele loholo ili sikukulawilile mikubulo hagati ya Waizilaeli vonda wakwese hanhu hong'ala.”<verse eid="NUM 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 8:20"/>Avo, Musa na Haluni na wanhu wose wa Izilaeli wawalava Walawi kwa Mndewa Imulungu, kamba Mndewa viyamulagize Musa. <verse eid="NUM 8:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 8:21"/>Walawi waisunha mbuli ya nzambi zao na wavifuwa viwalo vao, na Haluni kawalava kamba nhosa ya kwinuligwa uchanha kuulongozi wa Mndewa Imulungu. Vivija Haluni kawatendela loholo ili wang'ale. <verse eid="NUM 8:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 8:22"/>Ago gose vigatendigwe Walawi wasonga kusang'hana kuna dihema da mting'hano kuno olongozwa na Haluni na wanage, kamba Mndewa Imulungu viyamulagize Musa.<verse eid="NUM 8:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 8:23"/>Mndewa Imulungu kamulongela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 8:24"/>“Kila Mulawi yeli na miyaka malongo mabili na tano na kugendelela kolondigwa yasang'hane kuna dihema da mting'hano, <verse eid="NUM 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 8:25"/>na yaleke sang'hano ayo yahavikiza miyaka malongo matano. <verse eid="NUM 8:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 8:26"/>Lakini, kodaha kuwataza Walawi wayage kukaliza dihema, ila sikuyasang'hane sang'hano za siku zose. Vino vivo vonda uwagwelele Walawi sang'hano za kusang'hana.”<verse eid="NUM 8:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="NUM 9"/>
  <para style="s">Pasaka ya kabili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 9:1"/>Abaho Mndewa Imulungu kamulongela Musa kuluwala lwa Sinai mna umwezi wa ichanduso muumwaka wa kabili toka viwasegele mwiisi ya Misili, kalonga, <verse eid="NUM 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 9:2"/>“Waizilaeli waideng'helele nyimwilinyimwili ya Pasaka mna ikipindi kikigwe. <verse eid="NUM 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 9:3"/>Nyimwilinyimwili ayo yokuwa siku ya longo na nne muumwezi uno na wakweleleze malagizo gake.”<verse eid="NUM 9:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 9:4"/>Avo, Musa kawalongela Waizilaeli kamba olondigwa waideng'helele nyimwilinyimwili ayo ya Pasaka. <verse eid="NUM 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 9:5"/>Avo, waideng'helela nyimwilinyimwili ayo ya Pasaka kuluwala lwa Sinai mna isiku ya longo na nne mna umwezi wa ichanduso. Waizilaeli watenda kila kinhu kamba Mndewa Imulungu viyamulagize Musa.<verse eid="NUM 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 9:6"/>Lakini wanhu wayagwe wakalile kuko hawadahile kuideng'helela nyimwilinyimwili ayo ya Pasaka, kwavija wakala wakwasile maiti, avo wafita. Wanhu awo wamcholela Musa na Haluni, <verse eid="NUM 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 9:7"/>wawalongela, “Siye tufita kwavija tukwasa maiti, avo habali togomesigwa kumulavila Mndewa Imulungu nhosa zake mna ikipindi kikigwe hamoja na Waizilaeli wayagwe?”<verse eid="NUM 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 9:8"/>Musa kawedika, “Beteni mbaka vonda nipate malagizo ga mbuli yenu kulawa kwa Mndewa Imulungu.”<verse eid="NUM 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 9:9"/>Na Mndewa Imulungu kamulongela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 9:10"/>“Walongele Waizilaeli, ‘Imoja wenu hebu munhu wa ulelo wenu yahakuwa kafita mbuli ya kukwasa maiti hebu kamnzila mmwanza, lakini kolonda kuideng'helela nyimwilinyimwili ya Pasaka, <verse eid="NUM 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 9:11"/>munhu ayo kodaha kuideng'helela mna isiku ya longo na nne ya mwezi wa kabili. Yaideng'helele kwa kuja nyama ya ng'hondolo na magate hagageligwe hamila na mboga zili usungu. <verse eid="NUM 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 9:12"/>Sikuwasigase kinhu chochose mbaka imitondo vivija sikuwabene zege jojose da ing'hondolo wa Pasaka na waideng'helele Pasaka kamba malagizo gake vigolonga. <verse eid="NUM 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 9:13"/>Lakini munhu yoyose yong'ala hebu heli mmwanza, yahaleka kuideng'helela nyimwilinyimwili ya Pasaka, yabaguligwe na wanhu zake kwavija hanilavile nhosa mna ikipindi kikigwe. Kolondigwa yatagusigwe kwa nzambi yake.<verse eid="NUM 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 9:14"/>“ ‘Kamba kuna munhu baki kokala kumwenu na kolonda kuideng'helela nyimwilinyimwili ya Pasaka, kolondigwa yatende kamba malagizo ga Pasaka vigolonda. Kila munhu kolondigwa yakweleleze malagizo gano, yawe munhu baki hebu mwenekae.’ ”<verse eid="NUM 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Wingu uchanha ya dihema</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 40:34-38">Kulawa 40:34-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 9:15"/>Siku vidisimikigwe dihema ding'alile, wingu dihumuluka na kudigubika dihema. Ikilo mbaka imitondo wingu dijo joneka kamba moto. <verse eid="NUM 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 9:16"/>Vivo viikalile kila siku, imisi wingu digubika dihema na ikilo joneka kamba moto. <verse eid="NUM 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 9:17"/>Wingu dijo dahasegelaga uchanha ya dihema, Waizilaeli otula ng'hambi yao na okwika ng'hambi kabili hanhu kudili wingu dijo. <verse eid="NUM 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 9:18"/>Waizilaeli wasegela kwa kulagizwa na Mndewa Imulungu na vivija weka ng'hambi kwa kulagizwa na Mndewa Imulungu. Kipindi chose wingu dijo vidikala uchanha ya dihema wanhu wakala mwiing'hambi ayo. <verse eid="NUM 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 9:19"/>Kamba wingu dijo dikala uchanha ya dihema kwa siku nyingi, Waizilaeli wamtegeleza Mndewa Imulungu na hawasegele bule. <verse eid="NUM 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 9:20"/>Kipindi kiyagwe wingu dijo dikala uchanha ya dihema kwa siku ndodo, lakini Waizilaeli wakalile mwiing'hambi wasegela kamba Mndewa Imulungu viyalagize. <verse eid="NUM 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 9:21"/>Kipindi kiyagwe wingu dikala uchanha ya dihema kulawa ichungulo mbaka imitondo, na vidisegesigwe wagendelela na mwanza. Na kamba wingu dikala uchanha ya dihema imisi yose na kilo kigima, dahasegesigwa na hewo osonga kusegela. <verse eid="NUM 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 9:22"/>Kamba wingu dahakala uchanha ya dihema kwa siku mbili hebu mwezi umoja hebu mwaka, Waizilaeli osigala mna ing'hambi, lakini dahasegesigwa na hewo vivija osegela. <verse eid="NUM 9:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 9:23"/>Kwa kulagizwa na Mndewa Imulungu Waizilaeli weka ng'hambi na kwa kulagizwa na Mndewa Imulungu wagendelela na mwanza. Wagagoga malagizo ga Mndewa Imulungu kamba viyalagize kubitila Musa.<verse eid="NUM 9:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="NUM 10"/>
  <para style="s">Mhalati za shaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 10:1"/>Mndewa Imulungu kamulongela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 10:2"/>“Tenda mhalati mbili za shaba ing'ala, na mhalati azo zitoigwe kipindi cha kuwakema wanhu na kipindi cha kubena ing'hambi. <verse eid="NUM 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 10:3"/>Mhalati zose mbili zahatoigwa hamoja, wanhu wose waiting'hane behi na gweye kuulongozi wa ulwivi lwa idihema da mting'hano. <verse eid="NUM 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 10:4"/>Lakini kamba yahatoigwa mhalati imoja, vilongozi waiyeka wa makabila ga Izilaeli awo olondigwa kuiting'hana kuulongozi wako. <verse eid="NUM 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 10:5"/>Mhalati ayo yahatoigwa kidogo, wanhu iwokala kuzing'hambi zili mwambu wa kudilawila zuwa wasonge kusegela. <verse eid="NUM 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 10:6"/>Mhalati ayo yahatoigwa kidogo mwanza wa kabili, iwanhu okala kuzing'hambi za mwambu wa kusini wasonge kusegela. Kila kipindi mhalati yahatoigwa kamba avo yokuwa kilaguso cha kusonga umwanza. <verse eid="NUM 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 10:7"/>Lakini kipindi cha kuwakema wanhu waiting'hane, mhalati azo zitoigwe kwa kugendelela siyo kidogo. <verse eid="NUM 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 10:8"/>Wanhu wa ulelo wa Haluni, awo iwalava nhosa, awo onda wazitowe azo zimhalati. Mbuli azo muzigoge siku zose mweye na ulelo wenu.<verse eid="NUM 10:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 10:9"/>“Kipindi cha ng'hondo mwiisi yenu na iwanhu owehila wahawavamila, mulave kilaguso cha ng'hondo kwa kutowa azo zimhalati ili Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu, yawakumbuke na yawahonye kulawa kwa iwanhu owehila. <verse eid="NUM 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 10:10"/>Vivija mna ikipindi chenu cha kudeng'helela, kamba vija nyimwilinyimwili za kusimbuka kwa mbalamwezi na nyimwilinyimwili ziyagwe, mozitowa mhalati azo kipindi vimulava nhosa zenu za kusoma moto na nhosa zenu za kugala kuilumba. Baho niye Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu nowakumbuka. Niye ayo Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu.”<verse eid="NUM 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Waizilaeli obena ing'hambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 10:11"/>Mna isiku ya malongo mabili ya mwezi wa kabili, mwaka wa kabili toka Waizilaeli viwasegele Misili, wingu dikalile dimile uchanha ya dihema da mting'hano disegesigwa, <verse eid="NUM 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 10:12"/>na Waizilaeli wasonga mwanza wa kusegela kuluwala lwa Sinai. Wingu dijo disegela na abaho dima kuluwala lwa Palani.<verse eid="NUM 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 10:13"/>Kwa mwanza wa ichanduso Waizilaeli wasegela kwa kulagizwa na Mndewa Imulungu, kamba Musa viyawalongele. <verse eid="NUM 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 10:14"/>Waja wakalile hasi ya ibendela ya kabila da Yuda, wasonga kusegela kibumbila kimoja mbaka kibumbila kiyagwe. Kilongozi wa kabila da Yuda kakala Nashoni mwanage Aminadabu. <verse eid="NUM 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 10:15"/>Nasaneli mwanage Suali kakala kilongozi wa kabila da Isakali. <verse eid="NUM 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 10:16"/>Na heyo Eliabu mwanage Heloni kakala kilongozi wa kabila da Zabuloni.<verse eid="NUM 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 10:17"/>Abaho, dihema difunguligwa na wanhu wa ulelo wa Gelishoni na Melali awo wadipapile, wasonga kusegela.<verse eid="NUM 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 10:18"/>Abaho, iwanhu wakalile hasi ya ibendela ya kabila da Lubeni, wasegela kibumbila kimoja mbaka kibumbila kiyagwe. Kilongozi wa kabila da Lubeni kakala Elisuli mwanage Shedeuli. <verse eid="NUM 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 10:19"/>Shelumieli mwanage Sulishadai kakala kilongozi wa kabila da Simeoni. <verse eid="NUM 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 10:20"/>Na heyo Eliasafu mwanage Deueli kakala kilongozi wa kabila da Gadi.<verse eid="NUM 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 10:21"/>Abaho wanhu wa ulelo wa Kohati wasonga mwanza kuno wapapa viya ving'alile. Viwavikile, wavika dihema disimikigwa.<verse eid="NUM 10:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 10:22"/>Abaho, iwanhu wakalile hasi ya bendela ya kabila da Efulaimu, wasonga kusegela kibumbila kimoja mbaka kibumbila kiyagwe. Kilongozi wa kabila da Efulaimu kakala Elishama mwanage Amihudi. <verse eid="NUM 10:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 10:23"/>Gamalieli mwanage Pedasuli kakala kilongozi wa kabila da Manase, <verse eid="NUM 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 10:24"/>na Abidani mwanage Gideoni kakala kilongozi wa kabila da Benjamini.<verse eid="NUM 10:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 10:25"/>Kukimambukizo, waja wakalile hasi ya bendela ya kabila da Dani, wakalile kamba wakalizi wa ivibumbila vose vilongole, wasonga kusegela, kibumbila kimoja mbaka kibumbila kiyagwe. Kilongozi wa kabila da Dani kakala Ahiezeli mwanage Amishadai. <verse eid="NUM 10:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 10:26"/>Pagieli mwanage Okilani kakala kilongozi wa kabila da Asheli. <verse eid="NUM 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 10:27"/>Na Ahila mwanage Enani kakala kilongozi wa kabila da Nafutali. <verse eid="NUM 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 10:28"/>Vino vivo viwatendile Waizilaeli kamba viwakalile mna ivibumbila vao, kila viwabenile ing'hambi na kusonga kusegela.<verse eid="NUM 10:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 10:29"/>Avo, Musa kamulongela mulamu wake yokemigwa Hobabu mwanage Leueli, Mmidiani mkwe wake, “Siye tochola hanhu hohose Mndewa Imulungu kuyalongile, ‘Nowagwaa mweye hanhu hano.’ Avo, tuchole wose, na siye tokutendela ganogile, kwavija Mndewa Imulungu kalonga kotugwaa siye Waizilaeli ganogile.” <verse eid="NUM 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 10:30"/>Hobabu kedika, “Aka niye sichola na mweye, ila nobwela mwiisi yangu kwa wanhu wa lukolo lwangu.” <verse eid="NUM 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 10:31"/>Musa kamulongela, “Chonde sikuutuleke, kwavija gweye kojuwa hanhu ha kwika ing'hambi ako kuluwala, na kodaha kuwa kilongozi wetu. <verse eid="NUM 10:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 10:32"/>Kamba wahachola na siye chochose kinogile chonda yatutendele Mndewa Imulungu, na gweye vivija kotendeligwa kinhu acho.”<verse eid="NUM 10:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kusonga kwa mwanza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 10:33"/>Avo wanhu wachola umwanza kwa siku ndatu kulawa kulugongo lwa Mndewa Imulungu. Sanduku da lagano da Mndewa Imulungu diwalongolela kuzahila hanhu ha kwika ing'hambi. <verse eid="NUM 10:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 10:34"/>Kila viwakalile ochola kulawa ng'hambi imoja mbaka iyagwe, wingu da Mndewa Imulungu dikala uchanha yao imisi yose.<verse eid="NUM 10:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 10:35"/>Kila kipindi sanduku vidinuligwe ili wasegele, Musa kalonga, “Inuka, gweye Mndewa Imulungu, uwapwililise iwanhu okwihila, na uwatende wakimbile kuulongozi wako.” <verse eid="NUM 10:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 10:36"/>Na sanduku vidinenuligwe, Musa kalonga, “Oo Mndewa Imulungu wabwelele wanhu maelufu kwa maelufu ga Waizilaeli.”<verse eid="NUM 10:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="NUM 11"/>
  <para style="s">Moto kulawa kwa Mndewa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 11:1"/>Wanhu wasonga kumuyalalila Mndewa Imulungu mbuli ya magazo gao. Mndewa Imulungu viyahulike vivo kagevuzika, kagala moto hagati yao. Moto awo ukwaka na kulukuza kumgwazo wa ing'hambi. <verse eid="NUM 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 11:2"/>Wanhu wamulilila Musa, na heyo kampula Mndewa Imulungu na moto awo ufa. <verse eid="NUM 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 11:3"/>Avo hanhu aho hakemigwa Tabela<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kwa Kiebulania </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Tabela </char><char style="ft" closed="false">dofambula kulukula.</char></note>, kwavija moto kulawa kwa Mndewa Imulungu ukwaka hagati ya iwanhu.<verse eid="NUM 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">Musa kosagula wavele malongo saba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 11:4"/>Mna iwanhu wa Izilaeli kukala na wanhu wayagwe wakala osulukila ng'hani kuja nyama. Avo Waizilaeli wasonga kulila olonga, “Maza tupate nyama tuje! <verse eid="NUM 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 11:5"/>Towakumbuka waja iwasomba watukalile towaja bule ako Misili, matanga, matigiti, mhuza, vitungulu na vitungulu saumu! <verse eid="NUM 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 11:6"/>Lakini sambi tudonha haduhu ndiya iyagwe ila ino imana iiyeka!”<verse eid="NUM 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 11:7"/>Mana ikala kamba viwili uhemba, langi yake ikala kamba ya ukole. <verse eid="NUM 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 11:8"/>Wanhu wazunguluka na waidondola, abaho wadunda kwa mabwe ga kudundila hebu waidunda mmatuli, abaho waiteleka na watenda magate, uhailanza ikala kamba vigate vikanzingigwe kwa mavuta. <verse eid="NUM 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 11:9"/>Kungugu vidilagale mna ing'hambi ikilo vivija imana nayo ilagala na dijo dikungugu.<verse eid="NUM 11:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 11:10"/>Musa kahulika wanhu olila kuzing'anda zose, kila munhu hana ulwivi lwa kibanda chake. Avo, Mndewa Imulungu kagevuzika ng'hani na Musa vivija kagevuzika. <verse eid="NUM 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 11:11"/>Avo, Musa kamulongela Mndewa Imulungu, “Habali konitendela gehile niye msang'hanaji wako? Habali konihila niye na kunigwaa zigo da kuwalola wanhu wose wano? <verse eid="NUM 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 11:12"/>Kwani niye ayo niwalumbile, kwani niye ayo niwalelile, mbaka kunongela niwapape mmhambaga yangu kamba mlezi viyopapa king'hele, na niwagale mwiisi yuuiduwile kwa iwahenga zao? <verse eid="NUM 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 11:13"/>Noipata kwahi nyama ya kuwagwaa wanhu wose wano? Kwavija olila kuulongozi wangu olonga, ‘Tugwee nyama tuje!’ <verse eid="NUM 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 11:14"/>Sidaha kuwalola wanhu wose wano niye niiyeka, zigo dino sididaha bule! <verse eid="NUM 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 11:15"/>Kamba konitendela vino, vinoga unikome! Kamba koninogela, sikuundeke nigae kabili.”<verse eid="NUM 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 11:16"/>Avo, Mndewa Imulungu kamulongela Musa, “Wating'hanize wavele malongo saba wa Izilaeli, awo oukona gweye otegelezigwa na otogoligwa kamba vilongozi, uwagale mdihema da mting'hano, weme behi na gweye. <verse eid="NUM 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 11:17"/>Nohumuluka hanhu aho na kulonga na gweye, na nosola hanhu ha loho inikugwelele gweye, nowagwaa wanhu awo. Na hewo owalola wanhu wano hamoja na gweye, ili sambi udipape zigo dino gweye wiiyeka. <verse eid="NUM 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 11:18"/>Avo walongeleni iwanhu, ‘Muisasale mbuli ya mayo, moja nyama. Mndewa Imulungu kahulika molila na kulonga kuduhu wa kuwagwaa nyama, na kamba mukala vinogile ako Misili. Avo, Mndewa Imulungu kowagwaa nyama, na molondigwa muije. <verse eid="NUM 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 11:19"/>Moja nyama siyo kwa siku dimoja diiyeka hebu siku mbili hebu siku tano hebu siku longo hebu siku malongo mabili, <verse eid="NUM 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 11:20"/>lakini moja nyama kwa kipindi chose cha mwezi mgima! Moija mbaka iwalawile mmhula, na mbaka moidonha. Gano gose kwavija mmulema Mndewa Imulungu yeli baha hagati yenu, na molila kuno molonga, Habali tusegela Misili?’ ”<verse eid="NUM 11:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 11:21"/>Lakini Musa kamulongela Mndewa Imulungu, “Iwambigalo wose oniwalongoza laki sita awo ogenda kwa magulu, na gweye kolonga, ‘Nowagwaa nyama ya kuja mwezi mgima!’ <verse eid="NUM 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 11:22"/>Avo, todaha kuchinja ng'hondolo na ng'ombe ili wose wenele? Avo, tukavule iwasomba wose mmbahali mbuli yao?”<verse eid="NUM 11:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 11:23"/>Mndewa Imulungu kamulongela Musa, “Vino udahi wangu uhunguka? Beta ulole kamba gaja ganongile gaukweli hebu siyo.”<verse eid="NUM 11:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 11:24"/>Avo Musa kasegela kawalongela iwanhu gaja galongigwe na Mndewa Imulungu. Abaho kawasagula wavele malongo saba kulawa hagati ya iwavele weli vilongozi na kaweka behi kuzunguluka dihema. <verse eid="NUM 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 11:25"/>Aho Mndewa Imulungu kahumuluka mdiwingu na kalonga na heyo. Abaho kasola hanhu ha iloho iyamgwelele Musa, kawagwaa kila imoja wa awo iwavele malongo saba. Loho ayo viiwengile awo iwavele wasonga kulagula, lakini hawabwelele kutenda vivo.<verse eid="NUM 11:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 11:26"/>Wavele wabili mna iwavele awo malongo saba wasaguligwe, Elidadi na Medadi wakala wasigale mna ing'hambi, wayao viwacholile kuna dihema. Loho iwezila mumo mna ing'hambi wasonga kulagula aho kuwakalile. <verse eid="NUM 11:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 11:27"/>Mbwanga imoja kasomoka kakimbila kamulongela Musa, “Elidadi na Medadi olagula kuna ing'hambi.”<verse eid="NUM 11:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 11:28"/>Avo, Yoshua mwanage Nuni, yakalile komtaza Musa toka viyakalile mbwanga, kamulongela, “Musa mkulu wangu wagomese!”<verse eid="NUM 11:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 11:29"/>Musa kamulongela, “Vino kokona migongo mbuli ya niye? Vahanogile Mndewa Imulungu yahawagwelele loho yake wanhu wose wawe watula ndagu!” <verse eid="NUM 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 11:30"/>Abaho Musa kabwela kuna ing'hambi hamoja na awo iwavele wa Izilaeli.<verse eid="NUM 11:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Imulungu kogala ng'hwale</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 11:31"/>Bahaja Mndewa Imulungu kagala beho nyukwanyukwa, beho ajo digala ng'hwale kulawa mbahali na wema behi na ing'hambi, wakala utali wa mwanza wa kuchola siku dimoja kila mwambu kuzunguluka ing'hambi, wailundiza hamoja kuvikila mkigudi kulawa hasi. <verse eid="NUM 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 11:32"/>Avo, siku ayo yose imisi na ikilo na siku iyagwe, wanhu wahunganika kudondola ng'hwale, kuduhu munhu yadondole hasi ya kilo elufu imoja. Wawanika ili wanyale kila hanhu kumgwazo wa ing'hambi. <verse eid="NUM 11:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 11:33"/>Nyama viikalile ing'hali nyingi na wanhu viwakalile wang'hali kuimambukiza kuija. Mndewa Imulungu kawagevuzikila iwanhu, kawatowa kwa mikubulo mikulu. <verse eid="NUM 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 11:34"/>Avo hanhu aho hakemigwa Kibiloti Hataava,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Twaga </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kibiloti Hataava </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kwa Kiebulania dofambula mapanga ga wamelo.</char></note> kwavija hanhu aho, aho kuwazikigwe iwanhu wakalile wamelo.<verse eid="NUM 11:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 11:35"/>Kulawa aho Kibiloti Hataava wanhu wachola mbaka Haseloti, weka ng'hambi yao na wakala kuko.<verse eid="NUM 11:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="NUM 12"/>
  <para style="s">Miliamu na Haluni ombeza Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 12:1"/>Abaho Miliamu na Haluni wasonga kumulonga vihile Musa kwavija kakala yasolile mtwanzi Mkushi. <verse eid="NUM 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 12:2"/>Walonga, “Vino Mndewa Imulungu kalonga na kumulagiza Musa yaiyeka? Vino halongile na siye vivija?” Mndewa Imulungu kazihulika mbuli azo. <verse eid="NUM 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 12:3"/>Musa kakala muhole ng'hani, kubanza iwanhu wose wayagwe wakalile mwiisi.<verse eid="NUM 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 12:4"/>Bahaja Mndewa Imulungu kawalongela, Musa na Haluni na Miliamu, “Mweye wadatu mwize kuna dihema da mting'hano.” Avo, wose wadatu wachola kuna dihema da mting'hano. <verse eid="NUM 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 12:5"/>Baho Mndewa Imulungu kahumuluka mna imhanda ya wingu, kema hana ulwivi lwa dihema, kawakema Haluni na Miliamu. Wose wabili wakwesa kuulongozi. <verse eid="NUM 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 12:6"/>Abaho Mndewa Imulungu kawalongela, “Tegelezeni mbuli zangu. Kamba hana mtula ndagu hagati yenu, niye Mndewa Imulungu noigubula kwa kumulagusila vinhu na nolonga na heyo mzinzozi. <verse eid="NUM 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 12:7"/>Lakini kwa msang'hanaji wangu Musa, haili vivo. Heyo kana sang'hano ya kuwalola wanhu zangu wose. <verse eid="NUM 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 12:8"/>Niye nolonga na heyo kihanga kwa kihanga, silonga kwa kuzunguluka. Heyo konyona niye Mndewa Imulungu vinili. Avo habali hamdumbile kumulonga vihile msang'hanaji wangu Musa?”<verse eid="NUM 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 12:9"/>Aho Mndewa Imulungu kawagevuzikila, kasegela. <verse eid="NUM 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 12:10"/>Wingu vidisegele uchanha ya dihema, Miliamu koneka kana utamu wa dikulu, ukala mzelu kamba pamba. Haluni viyahinduke na kumulola Miliamu kakanganya, kumona kana utamu wa dikulu. <verse eid="NUM 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 12:11"/>Aho Haluni kamulongela Musa, “Chonde nokupula mndewa wangu, sikuutukoboze kwavija tutenda ubozi na nzambi. <verse eid="NUM 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 12:12"/>Sikuumtende Miliamu yawe kamba munhu yavumbuke yafile, na nusu ya lukuli lwake lukola.”<verse eid="NUM 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 12:13"/>Musa kamulilila Mndewa Imulungu yolonga, “Chonde, go Mndewa Imulungu muhonye!”<verse eid="NUM 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 12:14"/>Lakini Mndewa Imulungu kamulongela Musa, “Kamba tatake yahamtemela mate mkihanga chake, vino, sambi yakone kinyala kwa siku saba? Avo, mulave kunze ya ing'hambi yakale kuko kwa siku saba, abaho yabwele mwiing'hambi.” <verse eid="NUM 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 12:15"/>Avo, Miliamu kawingigwa yachole kunze ya ing'hambi kwa siku saba. Wanhu hawagendelele na mwanza mbaka Miliamu viyabwezigwe kuna ing'hambi. <verse eid="NUM 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 12:16"/>Vigabitile gago wanhu wagendelela na mwanza kulawa Haseloti, weka ng'hambi kuluwala lwa Palani.<verse eid="NUM 12:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="NUM 13"/>
  <para style="s">Wanhu longo na wabili otumigwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 1:19-33">Kumbukumbu 1:19-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 13:1"/>Mndewa Imulungu kamulongela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 13:2"/>“Watume wanhu wachole wakaisungulile isi ya Kanaani, isi yonda niwagwee wanhu wa Izilaeli. Umtume munhu imoja kulawa kila kabila, na munhu ayo yawe kilongozi.”<verse eid="NUM 13:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 13:3"/>Kwa kulagizwa na Mndewa Imulungu Musa kawatuma wanhu kulawa kuluwala lwa Palani. Wanhu watumigwe wakala vilongozi wa makabila gose ga Izilaeli. <verse eid="NUM 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 13:4"/>Gano gago matwaga ga wanhu awo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 13:4">Kabila da Lubeni, kachola Shamua mwanage Zakuli.<verse eid="NUM 13:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 13:5"/>Kabila da Simeoni kachola Shafati mwanage Holi.<verse eid="NUM 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 13:6"/>Kabila da Yuda kachola Kalebu mwanage Yefune.<verse eid="NUM 13:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 13:7"/>Kabila da Isakali kachola Igali mwanage Yusufu.<verse eid="NUM 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 13:8"/>Kabila da Efulaimu kachola Hoshea mwanage Nuni.<verse eid="NUM 13:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 13:9"/>Kabila da Benjamini kachola Paliti mwanage Lafu.<verse eid="NUM 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 13:10"/>Kabila da Zabuloni kachola Gadieli mwanage Sodi.<verse eid="NUM 13:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 13:11"/>Kabila da Yusufu ndio kulonga kabila da Manase, kachola Gadi mwanage Susi.<verse eid="NUM 13:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 13:12"/>Kabila da Dani kachola Amieli mwanage Gemali.<verse eid="NUM 13:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 13:13"/>Kabila da Asheli kachola Setuli mwanage Mikaeli.<verse eid="NUM 13:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 13:14"/>Kabila da Nafutali kachola Nabi mwanage Wofisi.<verse eid="NUM 13:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 13:15"/>Kabila da Gadi kachola Geueli mwanage Maki.<verse eid="NUM 13:15"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 13:16"/>Gano gago matwaga ga iwanhu Musa yawatumile wachole wakaisungulile isi ya Kanaani. Musa kamgwaa Hoshea mwanage Nuni, twaga diyagwe, kamkema Yoshua.<verse eid="NUM 13:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 13:17"/>Musa viyawatumile wachole wakaisungulile isi ya Kanaani, kawalongela, “Avo choleni Negebu, mkakwele ivigongo, <verse eid="NUM 13:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 13:18"/>mkaisungulile ili mujuwe isi ayo viili. Vivija loleni kamba iwanhu iwokala mumo wana nguvu hebu wadoda, kamba wengi hebu wadodo. <verse eid="NUM 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 13:19"/>Loleni kamba isi ayo inoga hebu iha, na mulole kamba wanhu okala mzing'hambi hebu okala mzing'anda zizungulusiligwe. <verse eid="NUM 13:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 13:20"/>Vivija isungulileni kamba isi yenyego ina mboji hebu kuduhu, ina muhulo hebu kuduhu. Mgangamale vonda mubwele soleni matunda ga isi ayo.” Kipindi acho ukala msimu wa zabibu kusonga kwipa.<verse eid="NUM 13:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 13:21"/>Avo wanhu awo wachola kuisungulila isi ayo kulawa kuluwala lwa Sini mbaka Lehobu, behi na nzila ya kwingilila Hamati. <verse eid="NUM 13:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 13:22"/>Wachola mbaka Negebu na wabita mbaka buga da Hebuloni. Amo wawavika Waahimani na Washeshai na Watalimai, ulelo wa Anaki. Buga da Hebuloni dikala dilongole kuzengwa kwa miyaka saba ding'hali hadinazengwa buga da Soani dili ako Misili. <verse eid="NUM 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 13:23"/>Viwavikile kubonde da Eshikoli, wanhu awo wakanha tambi dikalile na zabibu nyingi, wasomeka lumango wadipapa wanhu wabili. Vivija wasola makomamanga<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:23 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Makomamanga </char><char style="ft" closed="false">gaigala na matonga.</char></note> na tini. <verse eid="NUM 13:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 13:24"/>Hanhu aho hakemigwa bonde da Eshikoli mbuli ya ditambi da zabibu dikanhigwe na iwanhu awo wa Izilaeli kuko.<verse eid="NUM 13:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 13:25"/>Viwamambukize kuisungulila isi ayo kwa siku malongo mane, wanhu awo wabwela. <verse eid="NUM 13:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 13:26"/>Wabwela kwa Musa na Haluni na umting'hano wose wa Waizilaeli ako Kadeshi, kuluwala lwa Palani, walonga gose gawone na wawalagusila matunda ga isi ayo. <verse eid="NUM 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 13:27"/>Wamulongela Musa, “Tuvika mwiisi yuututumile kuisungulila, isi ayo imema maziwa na uki! Gano gago matunda ga isi ayo. <verse eid="NUM 13:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 13:28"/>Lakini iwenekae wa isi ayo wana nguvu ng'hani na mabuga gao makulu na gazunguluswa senyenge ya mibwe. Vivija tuyona mizinhu mikulu, awo iwanhu wa ulelo wa Anaki. <verse eid="NUM 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 13:29"/>Waamaleki okala ako Negebu, Wahiti na Wayebusi na Waamoli okala kuvigongo, na Wakanaani okala behi na bahali ya Meditelania na behi ya lwanda lwa Yolidani.”<verse eid="NUM 13:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 13:30"/>Lakini Kalebu kawatenda wanhu wanyamale kuulongozi wa Musa, kawalongela, “Tucholeni tukaisole isi ayo, kwavija todaha kuwahuma.”<verse eid="NUM 13:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 13:31"/>Lakini iwanhu wacholile kuisungulila isi ayo na heyo, walonga, “Hatudaha kuwatowa wanhu awo, hewo wana nguvu kubanza siye.” <verse eid="NUM 13:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 13:32"/>Avo wabwililisa mbuli za uvizi hagati ya Waizilaeli mbuli ya isi ayo iwacholile kuisungulila, walonga, “Isi ayo hainogile bule kukala. Vivija iwanhu wose tuwone kuko wakulu ng'hani. <verse eid="NUM 13:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 13:33"/>Ako tuyona mizinhu mikulu, awo iwanhu wa ulelo wa Anaki. Siye tuyona kamba mbalangulu na hewo vivo watuwone.”<verse eid="NUM 13:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="NUM 14"/>
  <para style="s">Wanhu omuyalalila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 14:1"/>Ikilo acho wanhu wose wa Izilaeli waiyalala na kulila. <verse eid="NUM 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 14:2"/>Wamuyalalila Musa na Haluni walonga, “Vinoga twahafile ako Misili! Vinoga twahafile baha kuluwala! <verse eid="NUM 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 14:3"/>Habali Mndewa Imulungu kotugala mwiisi ayo? Tokomigwa mwiing'hondo, wehe zetu na wanetu ogogigwa! Vinoga tubwele Misili.” <verse eid="NUM 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 14:4"/>Avo wasonga kuilongela, “Tusagule kilongozi, tubwele Misili!”<verse eid="NUM 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 14:5"/>Avo, Musa na Haluni wagwa kingubanguba kuulongozi wa iwanhu wose wa Izilaeli. <verse eid="NUM 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 14:6"/>Yoshua mwanage Nuni na Kalebu mwanage Yefune, awo wakalile mna iwanhu wacholile kuisungulila isi ayo, wadega viwalo vao kwa usungu, <verse eid="NUM 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 14:7"/>wawalongela wanhu wose wa Izilaeli, “Isi itucholile kuisungulila inoga ng'hani. <verse eid="NUM 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 14:8"/>Kamba Mndewa Imulungu kotunogela, kotugala kuko na kotugwaa isi ayo imemile maziwa na uki. <verse eid="NUM 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 14:9"/>Lakini sikummuleme Mndewa Imulungu, na sikumuwadumbe iwenekae wa isi ayo, kwavija hewo kamba wana wadodo kumwetu. Kiwotamanila kisegesigwa, lakini Mndewa Imulungu kahamoja na siye, sikumuwadumbe!” <verse eid="NUM 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 14:10"/>Lakini iwanhu wose walonda kuwatowa mabwe. Bahaja ukulu wa Mndewa Imulungu oneka uchanha ya dihema da mting'hano, kuulongozi wa iwanhu wose wa Izilaeli.<verse eid="NUM 14:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Musa kowapulila iwanhu kwa Imulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 14:11"/>Abaho Mndewa Imulungu kamulongela Musa, “Vino wanhu wano onibezeli mbaka lini? Mbaka lini ogendelela kuleka kunitamanila, hamoja nitenda vinhu vingi va unzonza hagati yao? <verse eid="NUM 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 14:12"/>Nowakoboza kwa mitamu, na nowafagila wose, lakini kulawa kumwako gweye, notenda wanhu wa isi iyagwe, weli na nguvu kubanza hewo!”<verse eid="NUM 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 14:13"/>Lakini Musa kamulongela Mndewa Imulungu, “Kuwalava wanhu wano mwiisi ya Misili kwa nguvu zako. Wamisili wahahulika kamba kuwatenda vivo wanhu zako, <verse eid="NUM 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 14:14"/>owalongela wanhu okala isi ino. Wanhu wano wahulika kamba gweye Mndewa Imulungu kwa hamoja na siye, kwavija gweye Mndewa Imulungu koneka kwa meso kipindi wingu jako dahemaga uchanha yetu, na gweye kutulongolelaga, imisi kwa mhanda ya wingu na ikilo kwa mhanda ya moto. <verse eid="NUM 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 14:15"/>Avo, kamba uhawakoma wanhu zako kwa mwanza umoja, wanhu wa isi ziyagwe zihulike nhogolwa zako olonga, <verse eid="NUM 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 14:16"/>‘Mndewa Imulungu kawakoma wanhu zake kuluwala kwavija kalemelwa kuwagala mwiisi iyaiduwile kowagwaa.’ <verse eid="NUM 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 14:17"/>Avo, sambi nokupula Mndewa Imulungu, utulagusile udahi wako kwa kutenda kamba viutulongele, <verse eid="NUM 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 14:18"/>‘Niye Mndewa Imulungu sigevuzika himahima, nimema bazi na nogela kumgongo nzambi na gehile. Lakini sileka kuwakoboza wana na wazukulu mbaka ulelo wa kadatu na wa ikane kwa nzambi za iwahenga zao.’ <verse eid="NUM 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 14:19"/>Nokupula ugele kumgongo nzambi za wanhu wano, kamba unogelwa wako viwili mkulu na kamba viuzigelaga kumgongo nzambi za wanhu wano toka walawe ako Misili mbaka sambi.”<verse eid="NUM 14:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 14:20"/>Mndewa Imulungu kamwidika, “Nizigela kumgongo nzambi zao kamba viupulile. <verse eid="NUM 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 14:21"/>Lakini nokulongela, kamba niye vinili mgima, na kamba isi yose viimemile ukulu wangu, <verse eid="NUM 14:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 14:22"/>haduhu hata munhu imoja mna iwao onile ukulu wangu na unzonza niutendile Misili na kuluwala abaho onigeza miyanza yose na olema kunitegeleza, <verse eid="NUM 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 14:23"/>koyona isi iniiduwile kwa wahenga zao kamba nowagwaa, vivija na iwanhu waja onibezeli niye honda wayone. <verse eid="NUM 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 14:24"/>Lakini kwavija msang'hanaji wangu Kalebu kavingine, na kanitegeleza goya, nomvikiza mwiisi ayo iyacholile kuisungulila, vivija ulelo wake oitawala. <verse eid="NUM 14:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 14:25"/>Kwavija Waamaleki na Wakanaani okala kugamabonde ga isi ayo, avo mayo mubwele kukisogo muchole kuluwala kuna inzila ilongoza bahali ya Shamu.”<verse eid="NUM 14:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 14:26"/>Abaho Mndewa Imulungu kamuuza Musa na Haluni, <verse eid="NUM 14:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 14:27"/>“Wanhu wano ogendelela kuniyalalila mbaka lini? Nidonha na kuiyalala kwa wanhu wa Izilaeli! <verse eid="NUM 14:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 14:28"/>Avo walongeleni, ‘Kamba vinili mgima nolonga niye Mndewa Imulungu, nowatendela gagaja gamhulike molonga. <verse eid="NUM 14:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 14:29"/>Mofa na ng'huli zenu zopigisigwa mmuno kuluwala kwavija muniyalalila niye, kuduhu hata imoja wenu yapetigwe yeli na miyaka malongo mabili na kugendelela, <verse eid="NUM 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 14:30"/>yonda yengile mwiisi iniwalongele nowagwaa iwe yenu, ila Kalebu mwanage Yefune na Yoshua mwanage Nuni. <verse eid="NUM 14:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 14:31"/>Mweye mulonga wanenu ogogigwa, lakini niye nowavikiza wanenu mwiisi imuibezeli, na isi ayo yokuwa kae yao. <verse eid="NUM 14:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 14:32"/>Lakini mweye mofila kukuno kuluwala. <verse eid="NUM 14:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 14:33"/>Wanenu ogunga na kugaya kukuno kuluwala kwa miyaka malongo mane mbuli ya mweye kuswela kutamanila mbaka vonda mufe mose kuluwala. <verse eid="NUM 14:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 14:34"/>Mbuli ya ago gehile genu, mogaya kwa miyaka malongo mane, kamba vizili siku azo zimucholile kuisungulila isi ayo, kila siku mwaka umoja. Avo, mojuwa kumulema Imulungu ndio choni.’ <verse eid="NUM 14:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 14:35"/>Niye Mndewa Imulungu nilonga, nowatendela vivo kamba vimuiting'hane kunilema. Wanhu wose okwamila baha kuluwala na wose ofila baha.”<verse eid="NUM 14:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 14:36"/>Wanhu waja watumigwe na Musa wachole kuisungulila isi ayo, waja wabwelile na kuwatenda wanhu wose wamuyalalile Mndewa Imulungu kwa kugala usenga wihile mbuli ya isi ayo, <verse eid="NUM 14:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 14:37"/>wanhu awo wagalile usenga awo wafa kwa mikubulo kuulongozi wa Mndewa Imulungu. <verse eid="NUM 14:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 14:38"/>Lakini Yoshua mwanage Nuni, na Kalebu mwanage Yefune, wasigala wagima mna iwanhu awo wacholile kuisungulila isi ayo.<verse eid="NUM 14:38"/></para>
  <para style="s">Wanhu ogeza kuchola mna iisi iwalongeligwe ogweleligwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 1:41-46">Kumbukumbu 1:41-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 14:39"/>Nayo Musa kawalongela Waizilaeli mbuli zija ziyalongeligwe na Mndewa Imulungu, na hewo walila kwa usungu. <verse eid="NUM 14:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 14:40"/>Imitondo ng'hani wachola kuvigongo walonga, “Sambi todaha kuchola hanhu aho hayatulongele Mndewa Imulungu. Totogola kamba tutenda nzambi.”<verse eid="NUM 14:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 14:41"/>Lakini Musa kalonga, “Avo habali mobena lagano da Mndewa Imulungu? Avo mohumwa! <verse eid="NUM 14:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 14:42"/>Sikumuchole ako kuna ivigongo, sambi mutoigwe na iwanhu owehila, kwavija Mndewa Imulungu heli na mweye. <verse eid="NUM 14:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 14:43"/>Avo mwahachola kuitowa na Waamaleki na Wakanaani, mofa kuing'hondo kwavija mulema kumkweleleza Mndewa Imulungu, heyo hali hamoja na mweye.”<verse eid="NUM 14:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 14:44"/>Lakini hewo wasusumiza kuchola uchanha kuvigongo, hamoja sanduku da lagano da Mndewa Imulungu na vivija Musa hasegele kuna ing'hambi. <verse eid="NUM 14:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 14:45"/>Avo Waamaleki na Wakanaani wakalile okala mwiisi ayo ya ivigongo wahumuluka hasi wawatowa na kuwahuma, wawawinga mbaka mwiisi ya Holima.<verse eid="NUM 14:45"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="NUM 15"/>
  <para style="s">Malagizo mbuli ya nhosa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 15:1"/>Mndewa Imulungu kamulongela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 15:2"/>“Walongele Waizilaeli vino ‘Vonda mwingile mwiisi iniwagwelela mukale, <verse eid="NUM 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 15:3"/>na mweye mogala nhosa yenu kuulongozi wangu niye Mndewa Imulungu kulawa mzifugo zenu, nhosa za kusoma moto hebu nhosa ziyagwe kwa kuvikiza gaja gaulongile hebu kwa kulonda wenyego hebu kwa nyimwilinyimwili zenu, nhosa azo zogala mnung'ho uninogeza niye Mndewa Imulungu. <verse eid="NUM 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 15:4"/>Avo munhu ayo yogala ng'hondolo hebu mbuzi kamba nhosa yake, vivija yamgalile Mndewa Imulungu nhosa ya ndiya, vibaba vibili va usage ulibule midundulu na utibwilizigwe na mavuta nyhupa imoja, <verse eid="NUM 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 15:5"/>hamoja na nyhupa imoja ya divai kamba nhosa ya king'waji. Vinhu avo vigaligwe hamoja na inhosa ya kusoma moto hebu zinhosa ziyagwe.<verse eid="NUM 15:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 15:6"/>“ ‘Kamba munhu kogala ng'hondolo mbigalo vivija yagale mhishi imoja ya usage ulibule midundulu na utibwilizigwe na mavuta nyhupa imoja na nusu kamba nhosa ya ndiya, <verse eid="NUM 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 15:7"/>hamoja na nyhupa imoja na nusu ya divai kamba nhosa ya king'waji, ili kutenda ininung'hile goya niye Mndewa Imulungu.<verse eid="NUM 15:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 15:8"/>“ ‘Kipindi vonda munigalile niye Mndewa Imulungu ng'ombe mbigalo mbuli ya nhosa ya kusoma moto hebu nhosa ziyagwe kwa kuvikiza gaja gaulongile hebu kwa kugala kuilumba, <verse eid="NUM 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 15:9"/>vivija mugale nhosa ya ndiya ya usage unogile mhishi imoja na vibaba vibili utibwilizigwe na mavuta nyhupa mbili, <verse eid="NUM 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 15:10"/>hamoja na divai nyhupa mbili kamba nhosa ya king'waji isomigwa kwa moto, ili kugala mnung'ho uninogeza niye Mndewa Imulungu.<verse eid="NUM 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 15:11"/>“ ‘Avo vinhu avo vilavigwe hamoja na kila ng'ombe mbigalo, na ng'hondolo na mbuzi. <verse eid="NUM 15:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 15:12"/>Vinhu avo vongezigwe kwa kuigala na iwanyama onda walavigwe. <verse eid="NUM 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 15:13"/>Kila Mwiizilaeli yakweleleze malagizo gago kipindi viyolava nhosa ya kusoma moto, kamba mnung'ho uninogeza niye Mndewa Imulungu. <verse eid="NUM 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 15:14"/>Na kamba kuna munhu baki yokala hamoja na mweye kwa siku ndodo hebu siku nyingi, yahalonda kulava nhosa yake ya kusoma moto kamba mnung'ho uninogeza niye Mndewa Imulungu, munhu ayo yatende kamba mweye vimutenda. <verse eid="NUM 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 15:15"/>Muulelo wenu wose onda wize, malagizo gagaja gomukweleleza mweye gago gonda wakweleleze hewo na vivija munhu baki yoyose yokala hamoja na mweye. Mgameso ga Mndewa Imulungu mose mwa sawa, <verse eid="NUM 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 15:16"/>mweye na heyo molongozwa na malagizo gago.’ ”<verse eid="NUM 15:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 15:17"/>Mndewa Imulungu kamulongela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 15:18"/>“Walongele Waizilaeli, ‘Vonda mwingile mwiisi yonda niwagale, <verse eid="NUM 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 15:19"/>kila vonda muje ndiya ya isi ayo, molondigwa mwike kumgwazo hanhu ha ndiya na mundavile niye Mndewa Imulungu. <verse eid="NUM 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 15:20"/>Mwahakoka magate, gate da ichanduso dilawile mna izindiya za ichanduso, dilavigwe kamba nhosa ilawile hanhu ha kubigila uhemba. <verse eid="NUM 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 15:21"/>Mundavile niye Mndewa Imulungu nhosa ayo ulelo wenu wose onda wize.<verse eid="NUM 15:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 15:22"/>“ ‘Lakini kamba munhu bila kujuwa kaleka kugagoga malagizo gose ganiwagwelele niye Mndewa Imulungu kubitila Musa, <verse eid="NUM 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 15:23"/>na kamba ako kumwande wanhu oleka kugakweleleza gaja gose niye Mndewa Imulungu ganimulongele Musa, <verse eid="NUM 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 15:24"/>avo kamba kinhu acho kitendigwa bila kujuwa, bila Waizilaeli wose kujuwa, avo Waizilaeli wose wagale bofu dimoja da kimbigalo da ng'ombe mbuli ya nhosa ya kusoma moto, kamba mnung'ho uninogeza niye Mndewa Imulungu, hamoja na inhosa ya indiya na iking'waji kamba malagizo vigalonda. Vivija wanhu wagale mbuzi mbigalo imoja kamba nhosa ya kusegesa nzambi. <verse eid="NUM 15:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 15:25"/>Mulava nhosa kowatendela loholo wanhu wose wa Izilaeli, na nzambi zao zogeligwa kumgongo kwavija watenda nzambi bila kujuwa, na wagala nhosa zao kwa Mndewa Imulungu, nhosa ya kusoma moto na nhosa ya kusegesa nzambi. <verse eid="NUM 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 15:26"/>Avo Waizilaeli wose na iwanhu baki okala hamoja na hewo, nzambi zao zogeligwa kumgongo kwavija wose waitenda nzambi ayo bila kujuwa.<verse eid="NUM 15:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 15:27"/>“ ‘Munhu yahatenda nzambi bila kujuwa, kolondigwa yagale mbuzi imoja mtwanzi yeli na mwaka umoja yawe nhosa ya kusegesa nzambi. <verse eid="NUM 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 15:28"/>Mulava nhosa yamtendele loholo munhu ayo kuulongozi wa Mndewa Imulungu, na nzambi zake zogeligwa kumgongo. <verse eid="NUM 15:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 15:29"/>Mokuwa na malagizo gagano kwa munhu yoyose yotenda nzambi bila kujuwa, yawe mwenekae hebu munhu baki yokala hamoja na mweye.<verse eid="NUM 15:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 15:30"/>“ ‘Lakini munhu yoyose yotenda nzambi giladi, yawe mwenekae hebu munhu baki, ayo komuliga Mndewa Imulungu, avo kolondigwa yabaguligwa mna iwanhu zake. <verse eid="NUM 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 15:31"/>Kwavija kagalema gaja gayalongile Mndewa Imulungu na kabena malagizo gake. Munhu ayo yabaguligwe na nzambi yake yokuwa mdipala jake mwenyego.’ ”<verse eid="NUM 15:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Munhu yabenile malagizo ga siku da kubwihila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 15:32"/>Siku dimoja Waizilaeli viwakalile kuluwala, wamona munhu imoja kodondola ngodi kudisiku da kubwihila. <verse eid="NUM 15:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 15:33"/>Avo, munhu ayo kagaligwa kuulongozi wa Musa na Haluni na mting'hano wose wa Izilaeli. <verse eid="NUM 15:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 15:34"/>Avo wamgela mmakono, kwavija wakala hawajuwile munhu ayo yatendigwe choni. <verse eid="NUM 15:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 15:35"/>Avo, Mndewa Imulungu kamulongela Musa, “Munhu ayo kolondigwa yakomigwe, umting'hano wose wa Izilaeli wamtowe mabwe kunze ya ing'hambi.” <verse eid="NUM 15:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 15:36"/>Avo, wanhu wamulava kunze ya ing'hambi, wamtowa mabwe mbaka kafa, kamba Mndewa Imulungu viyamulagize Musa.<verse eid="NUM 15:36"/></para>
  <para style="s">Malagizo mbuli ya vikumbi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 15:37"/>Abaho Mndewa Imulungu kamulongela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 15:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 15:38"/>“Walongele wanhu wa Izilaeli, ‘Muisonele vikumbi mna izimhindo za viwalo venu, na mwike luzi lwa langi ya buluu uchanha ya kila kikumbi. Mutende vivo muulelo wenu wose onda wize. <verse eid="NUM 15:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 15:39"/>Vikumbi avo vokuwa kinhu cha kukumbuka kumwenu. Kila mwahavona mogakumbuka malagizo gangu na kugakweleleza, ili sikumukweleleze gaja gomulonda na gaja gomukona kwa meso genu wenyego. <verse eid="NUM 15:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 15:40"/>Vikumbi avo vowakumbusa malagizo gangu gose na mogagoga gose, na mweye mokala mung'alile kumwangu. <verse eid="NUM 15:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 15:41"/>Niye ayo Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu niwalavile mwiisi ya Misili ili niwe Imulungu wenu. Niye ayo Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu.’ ”<verse eid="NUM 15:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="NUM 16"/>
  <para style="s">Kola na Dasani na Abilamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 16:1"/>Ako kumwande, Kola mwanage Ishali, mzukulu wa Kohati mwanage Lawi, hamoja na wanhu wadatu kulawa kabila da Lubeni wakala, Datani na Abilamu wanage Eliabu na Oni mwanage Peleti, <verse eid="NUM 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 16:2"/>awo wose hamoja na vilongozi magana mabili na malongo matano, wasaguligwe na Waizilaeli wose, wamulema Musa. <verse eid="NUM 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 16:3"/>Waiting'hana kuulongozi wa Musa na Haluni wawalongela, “Mweye mubanza ng'hani! Mting'hano wa wanhu wose ung'ala na kila munhu yeli hano kang'ala, na Mndewa Imulungu kahamoja na siye wose. Habali mweye moitenda wakulu wa mting'hano wa wanhu wa Mndewa Imulungu?”<verse eid="NUM 16:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 16:4"/>Musa viyahulike avo, kaibwanha hasi kingubanguba. <verse eid="NUM 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 16:5"/>Abaho kamulongela Kola na iwanhu wose wamkweleleze, “Mayo imitondo, Mndewa Imulungu kolagusa nani yeli wake na nani yong'ala, na heyo yonda yamsagule, komtenda yakwese behi yake. <verse eid="NUM 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 16:6"/>Avo, tendeni vino, imitondo gweye na wanhu wako okukweleleza, soleni viya va kuhalila makala ga moto, <verse eid="NUM 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 16:7"/>haleni makala ga moto na mugele ubani uchanha yake, abaho mvigale kuulongozi wa Mndewa Imulungu. Abaho tolola nani yasaguligwe na Mndewa Imulungu. Mweye Walawi mbanza ng'hani!”<verse eid="NUM 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 16:8"/>Musa kagendelela kumulongela Kola, “Tegelezeni mweye Walawi! <verse eid="NUM 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 16:9"/>Vino, mweye mokona mbuli ndodo kumwenu, Mndewa Imulungu kawasagula mweye hagati ya Waizilaeli wose, ili mumkwesele behi na musang'hane mdihema da Mndewa Imulungu, na muwasang'hanile wanhu wose? <verse eid="NUM 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 16:10"/>Kawagwaa ukulu wa kukala behi na heyo, mweye hamoja na Walawi waenu wose. Lakini sambi vivija molonda na ulava nhosa? <verse eid="NUM 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 16:11"/>Avo, gweye na wayago momulema Mndewa Imulungu. Mweye momuyalalila Haluni, lakini ukweli mweye momuyalalila Imulungu.”<verse eid="NUM 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 16:12"/>Abaho Musa katuma usenga kwa Datani na Abilamu wanage Eliabu, ili weze, lakini hewo walonga, “Hatwiza bule! <verse eid="NUM 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 16:13"/>Vino mbuli ndodo gweye kutulava Misili, isi imemile maziwa na uki, ili wize kutukoma kuno kuluwala? Abaho koitenda mkulu wetu! <verse eid="NUM 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 16:14"/>Abaho hutugalile mwiisi imemile maziwa na uki na hutugwelele migunda ya kulima na migunda ya mizabibu. Kogizaga kodaha kuwatenda wanhu wano wawe wasuwameso? Siye hatwiza bule!”<verse eid="NUM 16:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 16:15"/>Musa kagevuzika ng'hani, kamulongela Mndewa Imulungu, “Sikuuzitogole nhosa za wanhu wano. Niye sisolile kihongwe wa munhu yoyose na simulumize munhu!”<verse eid="NUM 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 16:16"/>Musa kamulongela Kola, “Mayo gweye na wayago mwize kuulongozi wa Mndewa Imulungu. Vivija Haluni kokuwa hamoja na mweye. <verse eid="NUM 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 16:17"/>Kila imoja wenu yasole kiya chake cha kuhalila makala ga moto, na yagele ubani na abaho yakigale kuulongozi wa Mndewa Imulungu, vose kwa vose vokuwa viya magana mabili na malongo matano, vivija gweye na Haluni, kila imoja kokuwa na kiya chake.”<verse eid="NUM 16:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 16:18"/>Avo kila imoja wao kasola kiya chake cha kuhalila makala ga moto, kagela makala ga moto na ubani, abaho wachola na wema wima hana ulwivi lwa dihema da mting'hano, hamoja na Musa na Haluni. <verse eid="NUM 16:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 16:19"/>Na heyo Kola kawating'haniza wanhu wose hamoja, wema wima kuulongozi wa Musa na Haluni awo wakalile hana ulwivi lwa dihema da mting'hano. Abaho ukulu wa Mndewa Imulungu uwalawilila wanhu wose! <verse eid="NUM 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 16:20"/>Abaho Mndewa Imulungu kamulongela Musa na Haluni, <verse eid="NUM 16:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 16:21"/>“Segeleni hagati ya umting'hano uno, ili niwakome wose sambi baha.”<verse eid="NUM 16:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 16:22"/>Lakini Musa na Haluni wagwa kingubanguba walonga, “Go Mndewa Imulungu, gweye uli mwanduso wa ugima wa wanhu wose. Vino munhu imoja yahakutendela gehile kowagevuzikila wanhu wose?” <verse eid="NUM 16:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 16:23"/>Mndewa Imulungu kamulongela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 16:24"/>“Walongele wanhu, ‘Kweseni kutali na ikibanda cha Kola na Datani na Abilamu.’ ”<verse eid="NUM 16:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 16:25"/>Avo Musa kachola kwa Datani na Abilamu, na vilongozi wa Waizilaeli wamkweleleza, <verse eid="NUM 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 16:26"/>viyavikile kawalongela iwanhu, “Chonde segeleni kuna ivibanda va wanhu wano wehile, sikumkwase kinhu chao chochose, ili sikumukomigwe hamoja na hewo mbuli ya nzambi yao.” <verse eid="NUM 16:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 16:27"/>Avo wanhu wasegela kutali na ikibanda cha Kola na Datani na Abilamu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 16:27">Datani na Abilamu walawa kunze na kwima hana ulwivi lwa ivibanda vao hamoja na wehe zao na wanao wose mbaka waja wakalile okong'ha. <verse eid="NUM 16:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 16:28"/>Musa kawalongela iwanhu, “Sambi mojuwa kamba Mndewa Imulungu ayo yanilagize niye kutenda mbuli zino zose, na siyo notenda vinilonda. <verse eid="NUM 16:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 16:29"/>Kamba wanhu wano wahafa ifa kamba siku zose wanhu wayagwe viwofa, avo mjuwe kamba Mndewa Imulungu hanitumile bule. <verse eid="NUM 16:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 16:30"/>Lakini kamba Mndewa Imulungu yahatenda kinhu hakinatendigwa, na kamba isi yogubuka na kuwameza wanhu wano hamoja na vinhu vao vose, ochola hanhu kowochola wanhu wafile kuno wang'hali wagima, baho mojuwa wanhu wano wambezeli Mndewa Imulungu.”<verse eid="NUM 16:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 16:31"/>Bahaja viyamambukize kulonga mbuli azo, isi igubuka hasi ya Dasani na Abilamu, <verse eid="NUM 16:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 16:32"/>na iwameza wanhu awo hamoja na kae zao na wanhu wose wailumbile hamoja na Kola na vinhu vao vose. <verse eid="NUM 16:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 16:33"/>Wahumulukila kowochola wanhu wafile kuno wang'hali wagima. Isi iwagubika, wose walawanya. <verse eid="NUM 16:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 16:34"/>Waizilaeli wose wayagwe wakalile behi viwahulike wanhu awo olila, wakimbila walonga, “Tukimbile! Isi sikuitumeze na siye vivija!”<verse eid="NUM 16:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 16:35"/>Abaho Mndewa Imulungu kagala moto uwalukuza wanhu waja magana mabili na malongo matano wacholile kulava ubani.<verse eid="NUM 16:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 16:36"/>Abaho Mndewa Imulungu kamulongela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 16:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 16:37"/>“Mulongele Eleazali mwanage Haluni imulava nhosa yavisegese avo iviya hana umoto, yaupwililise kutali awo umoto, kwavija viya avo ving'ala. <verse eid="NUM 16:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 16:38"/>Viya avo ving'ala kwavija wanhu awo wavigala muupango wa nhosa wa Mndewa Imulungu. Avo, visole viya avo va wanhu awo wakomigwe mbuli ya nzambi zao, vilumbuligwe kwa moto ili viwe ngubiko ya upango wa nhosa. Mbuli ayo yokuwa kilaguso kwa Waizilaeli wose.”<verse eid="NUM 16:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 16:39"/>Avo Eleazali imulava nhosa kavisola viya avo va shaba ya kiguzi, vigaligwe kuulongozi wa Mndewa Imulungu na wanhu waja walukuzigwe vilumbuligwa kwa moto, na ilawa ngubiko ya upango wa nhosa. <verse eid="NUM 16:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 16:40"/>Mbuli ayo ikala kilaguso kwa Waizilaeli kamba munhu heli mulava nhosa, ndio kulonga halawa muulelo wa Haluni sikuyachole hana uupango wa nhosa na kusoma ubani kuulongozi wa Mndewa Imulungu. Ama sivo kokomigwa kamba Kola na wayage. Ago gose gatendigwa kamba Mndewa Imulungu viyamulagize Eleazali kubitila Musa.<verse eid="NUM 16:40"/></para>
  <para style="s">Haluni kowahonya iwanhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 16:41"/>Imitondo yake Waizilaeli wose wamuyalalila Musa na Haluni walonga, “Muwakoma wanhu wa Mndewa Imulungu.” <verse eid="NUM 16:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 16:42"/>Viwakalile waiting'hane kuulongozi wa Musa na Haluni kuno oiyalala, wahinduka kulola kuna dihema da mting'hano, wona wingu digubika dihema, na ukulu wa Mndewa Imulungu ulawilila aho. <verse eid="NUM 16:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 16:43"/>Musa na Haluni wachola wema kuulongozi wa dihema da mting'hano, <verse eid="NUM 16:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 16:44"/>na Mndewa Imulungu kamulongela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 16:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 16:45"/>“Segeleni hagati ya iwanhu awo, sambi baha nolonda kuwakoma wose!” Lakini hewo wagwa kingubanguba.<verse eid="NUM 16:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 16:46"/>Musa kamulongela Haluni, “Sola kiya chako cha kuhalila makala ga moto, gela makala ga moto kulawa muupango wa nhosa, abaho ugele ubani na uchole nacho himahima kwa iwanhu uwatendele loholo. Lopola! Ng'hasiliki ya Mndewa Imulungu iwavikila na utamu usonga hagati yao.” <verse eid="NUM 16:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 16:47"/>Avo Haluni katenda kamba Musa viyamulongele. Kasola kiya chake na kakimbila mbaka hagati ya iwanhu wakalile waiting'hane. Utamu ukala usongile hagati ya iwanhu, kagela ubani mna ikiya chake na kawatendela iwanhu loholo. <verse eid="NUM 16:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 16:48"/>Viyatendile avo, utamu awo usegela na heyo kakala hagati ya iwanhu wafile na wagima. <verse eid="NUM 16:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 16:49"/>Iwanhu wose kwa wose wafile kwa utamu awo wakala elufu kumi na nne na magana saba (14,700), bila kuwapeta waja wafile mbuli ya nzambi ya Kola. <verse eid="NUM 16:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 16:50"/>Utamu awo viusegele, Haluni kabwela kwa Musa hana ulwivi lwa dihema da mting'hano.<verse eid="NUM 16:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="NUM 17"/>
  <para style="s">Fimbo ya Haluni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 17:1"/>Mndewa Imulungu kamulongela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 17:2"/>“Walongele Waizilaeli wakugalile fimbo longo na mbili, kila kilongozi wa kabila fimbo imoja. Ujandike twaga da kila imoja wao mna ifimbo yake, <verse eid="NUM 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 17:3"/>na twaga da Haluni ujandike uchanha ya ifimbo ilagusa kabila da Lawi. Avo hokuwa na fimbo imoja kwa kila kilongozi wa kabila. <verse eid="NUM 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 17:4"/>Abaho uzisole fimbo azo uzigale mdihema da mting'hano na uzike kuulongozi wa sanduku da lagano hanhu aho kuniiting'hanaga na gweye. <verse eid="NUM 17:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 17:5"/>Fimbo ya munhu yonda nimsagule, yozuka. Kwa nzila ayo nowatenda Waizilaeli waleke kuwayalalila mweye.”<verse eid="NUM 17:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 17:6"/>Musa kawalongela Waizilaeli. Vilongozi wa iwanhu wose wamgwaa kila imoja fimbo yake kamba kabila jake vidili, zose kwa zose zikala fimbo longo na mbili. Fimbo ya Haluni ikigwa hamoja na fimbo azo. <verse eid="NUM 17:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 17:7"/>Abaho Musa kazika fimbo azo zose kuulongozi wa Mndewa Imulungu mna dihema da mting'hano.<verse eid="NUM 17:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 17:8"/>Imitondo yake, Musa kengila mna dihema da mting'hano, mumo kayona fimbo ya Haluni imunhu kulawa kabila da Lawi, izuka na ilawa matambi galike maluwa na kulela matunda gepile ga mulozi. <verse eid="NUM 17:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 17:9"/>Abaho Musa kazigala kunze fimbo zose aho kuulongozi wa Mndewa Imulungu, kawalagusila Waizilaeli wose, na kila kilongozi kasola fimbo yake. <verse eid="NUM 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 17:10"/>Mndewa Imulungu kamulongela Musa, “Ibweze fimbo ya Haluni kuulongozi wa disanduku da lagano. Aho yokala goya, acho chokuwa kinhu cha kuwazuma iwanhu awo walemaga kamba wahagendelela kuiyalala wofa.” <verse eid="NUM 17:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 17:11"/>Musa katenda kamba Mndewa Imulungu viyamulagize.<verse eid="NUM 17:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 17:12"/>Waizilaeli wamulongela Musa, “Lola! Tokobozigwa! Wose tofa! <verse eid="NUM 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 17:13"/>Munhu yoyose yonda yakwese hana dihema da Mndewa Imulungu kofa. Vino wose vivija tofa?”<verse eid="NUM 17:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="NUM 18"/>
  <para style="s">Sang'hano za walava nhosa na Walawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 18:1"/>Mndewa Imulungu kamulongela Haluni, “Gweye na wanago na Walawi wayagwe wa lukolo lwa Kohati mosola gehile gose mbuli ya dihema king'ala. Gweye na wanago mopapa gehile gose gotendigwa na iwalava nhosa mbuli ya sang'hano ayo. <verse eid="NUM 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 18:2"/>Gweye, wanago na ulelo wako wose mosang'hana kamba walava nhosa mdihema kuulongozi wa sanduku da lagano, wanhu wayagwe wa kabila jako owataza kipindi gweye na wanago vimusang'hana. <verse eid="NUM 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 18:3"/>Hewo osang'hana sang'hano zose zonda uwagwelele mna dihema. Lakini hawalondigwa kuvikwasa viya vili mdihema hebu kuukwesela behi upango wa nhosa, wahatenda avo wose gweye na wao mofa. <verse eid="NUM 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 18:4"/>Hewo osang'hana hamoja na gweye kuna dihema da mting'hano, na osang'hana sang'hano zao lakini munhu yoyose iyagwe sikuyakukwesele behi.<verse eid="NUM 18:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 18:5"/>“Gweye na wanago wao monda musang'hane aho hana ihanhu hong'ala na muupango wa nhosa ili ng'hasiliki yangu sikuiwezile kabili Waizilaeli. <verse eid="NUM 18:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 18:6"/>Niye ayo niwasagule ndugu zenu Walawi mna iwanhu Waizilaeli kamba nhunza kumwenu. Hewo walavigwa mbuli yangu niye Mndewa Imulungu ili wasang'hane kuna dihema da mting'hano. <verse eid="NUM 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 18:7"/>Lakini gweye wiiyeka na wanago mosang'hane kamba walava nhosa mbuli ya uupango wa nhosa na vinhu vose vili mna ihanhu hong'ala. Sang'hano ayo yenu mweye kwavija niwagwaa nhunza ya ulava nhosa. Munhu yoyose iyagwe yahakwesa behi na ihanhu hong'ala yakomigwe.”<verse eid="NUM 18:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Fungu da walava nhosa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 18:8"/>Mndewa Imulungu kamulongela Haluni, “Nokugwaa gweye sadaka ziwanilavile Waizilaeli, nokugwaa vinhu Waizilaeli wavilavile kumwangu nokugwaa gweye. Nokugwaa gweye na ulelo wako vinhu vose avo kamba fungu jenu, ajo dokuwa fungu jenu siku zose. <verse eid="NUM 18:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 18:9"/>Mna ivinhu vose ving'alile ng'hani vija havilukuzigwa muumoto, avo vokuwa venu. Nhosa ya ndiya na nhosa ya kusegesa nzambi na nhosa ya kulihila gehile. Kila kinhu wanhu chonda wandavile kamba nhosa ing'ala chokuwa chako na wanago. <verse eid="NUM 18:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 18:10"/>Diyeni vinhu avo kamba vinhu ving'alile ng'hani, wambigalo waiyeka awo olondigwa kuvija vinhu avo, vinhu avo ving'ala kumwenu.<verse eid="NUM 18:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 18:11"/>“Vivija vinhu viyagwe vose vonda wanilavile Waizilaeli kamba nhosa ya kwinuligwa uchanha, vinhu avo vokuwa venu. Nokugwaa gweye na wanago na wandele zako kamba fungu jenu siku zose. Munhu yoyose mulukolo lwako hafitile kodaha kuja vinhu avo.<verse eid="NUM 18:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 18:12"/>“Nokugwaa vinhu vose vinogile kulawa mna ivinhu va ichanduso kusengigwa viondavila Waizilaeli. Mavuta ganogile, divai na ndiya. <verse eid="NUM 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 18:13"/>Matunda gose gaichanduso ga mmigunda yao gonda wanilavile gokuwa genu. Munhu yoyose mulukolo lwako hafitile kodaha kuja.<verse eid="NUM 18:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 18:14"/>“Kila kinhu cha Waizilaeli kilavigwe kamba nhosa kumwangu niye Mndewa Imulungu chokuwa chenu. <verse eid="NUM 18:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 18:15"/>Kila mwana wa chaudele wa Waizilaeli yolavigwa kumwangu, yawe mwana chaudele wa munhu hebu wa mnyama kokuwa wenu. Lakini molondigwa muwagombole wana wose wa chaudele wa wanhu, vivija molondigwa muwagombole wana wose wafitile wa chaudele wa wanyama. <verse eid="NUM 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 18:16"/>Awo wose molondigwa muwagombole vonda wavikize mwezi umoja na walaviligwe vihande vitano va shaba, kamba viwopima hanhu hong'ala.<verse eid="NUM 18:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 18:17"/>“Lakini wana chaudele wa ng'ombe hebu ng'hondolo hebu mbuzi, sikuwagomboligwe kwavija hewo wang'ala. Damu yao uimizile muupango wa nhosa na mavuta gao mugasome moto gawe nhosa ya kusoma moto ilava mnung'ho uninogeza niye Mndewa Imulungu. <verse eid="NUM 18:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 18:18"/>Nyama yao yokuwa yenu, kamba ikidali kinuligwa uchanha na kamba kihili cha mgulu wa kudila.<verse eid="NUM 18:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 18:19"/>“Vinhu vose viondavila Waizilaeli nokugwaa gweye na wanago na wandele zako, ajo dokuwa fungu jenu siku zose. Dino dokuwa lagano da siku zose mgameso gangu mbuli ya gweye na ulelo wako.”<verse eid="NUM 18:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 18:20"/>Mndewa Imulungu kamulongela Haluni, “Gweye kokuwa kuduhu uhazi mwiisi ayo, vivija kokuwa kuduhu fungu jojose mna iwanhu, fungu jako na uhazi wako mna iwanhu wa Izilaeli dokuwa niye.”<verse eid="NUM 18:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Fungu da Walawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 18:21"/>“Mbuli ya Walawi, hewo niwagwaa mafungu ga longo gose goondavila Waizilaeli kamba uhazi wao. Dino dijo fungu jao kwa sang'hano iwotenda kuna dihema jangu da mting'hano. <verse eid="NUM 18:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 18:22"/>Kulawa sambi, wanhu wayagwe wa Izilaeli sikuwadikwesele behi dihema da mting'hano ili sikuwatende nzambi na kuigalila ifa yao. <verse eid="NUM 18:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 18:23"/>Lakini Walawi waiyeka awo onda wasang'hane kuna dihema da mting'hano na kudilola goya. Lagizo dino dokuwa da siku zose ulelo wenu wose. Walawi okuwa waduhu uhazi mna iwanhu wa Izilaeli, <verse eid="NUM 18:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 18:24"/>kwavija niwagwelela gamafungu ga longo goondavila Waizilaeli kamba uhazi wao. Lekaavo nilonga hewo okuwa waduhu uhazi mna iwanhu wa Izilaeli.”<verse eid="NUM 18:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Fungu da longo da Walawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 18:25"/>Abaho Mndewa Imulungu kamulongela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 18:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 18:26"/>“Vivija walongele Walawi malagizo gano, ‘Vonda mubokele gamafungu ga longo ago ganiwagwelele mweye kamba uhazi wenu mna iwanhu wa Izilaeli, vivija mundavile niye Mndewa Imulungu fungu da longo da vinhu avo. <verse eid="NUM 18:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 18:27"/>Sadaka ayo yotogoligwa kamba gaja gaichanduso kusengigwa hebu kamba zabibu zilavigwe. <verse eid="NUM 18:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 18:28"/>Avo vivo vonda mundavile niye Mndewa Imulungu sadaka za fungu da longo zonda mubokele kulawa kwa Waizilaeli. Sadaka ayo yonda mundavile niye Mndewa Imulungu kamba fungu jenu da longo, mumgwelele Haluni, imulava nhosa. <verse eid="NUM 18:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 18:29"/>Kulawa mna zinhosa azo zose zonda mubokele, mundavile niye Mndewa Imulungu hanhu hanogile ha zinhosa.’<verse eid="NUM 18:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 18:30"/>“Avo ukawalongele, ‘Mwahanilavila hanhu hanogile ha zinhosa, hanhu hasigale hokuwa henu, kamba viili kwa mwene mgunda viyosola zabibu zisigale na ndiya isigale yahamambukiza kulava nhosa zake. <verse eid="NUM 18:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 18:31"/>Avo mweye na ulelo wenu modaha kuvija vinhu avo hanhu hohose, kwavija awo uhazi wenu mbuli ya sang'hano yenu kuna dihema da mting'hano. <verse eid="NUM 18:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 18:32"/>Mokuwa mduhu nzambi mwahaja vinhu avo, kamba munilavila niye Mndewa Imulungu hanhu hanogile ha zinhosa, na mweye hamvifitiza ivinhu ving'ala va Waizilaeli na hamufa bule.’ ”<verse eid="NUM 18:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="NUM 19"/>
  <para style="s">Mitozi ya ng'ombe mdung'hu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 19:1"/>Abaho Mndewa Imulungu kagendelela kuwalongela Musa na Haluni, <verse eid="NUM 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 19:2"/>“Gano gago malagizo gonilava, niye Mndewa Imulungu. Walongeleni Waizilaeli wawagalile ng'ombe mdung'hu mtwanzi yelibule kilema chochose na yawe yang'hali hanatenda sang'hano ya kulima. <verse eid="NUM 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 19:3"/>Mweye mumgwelele ng'ombe ayo Eleazali imulava nhosa. Ng'ombe ayo yalavigwe kunze ya ing'hambi na yachinjigwe kuulongozi wa ayo imulava nhosa.<verse eid="NUM 19:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 19:4"/>“Abaho Eleazali imulava nhosa yasole damu kidogo na yaimize kwa kidole chake miyanza saba, kulozela umwambu wa kuulongozi wa dihema da mting'hano. <verse eid="NUM 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 19:5"/>Ng'ombe ayo wose hamoja na ing'hwembe na inyama na idamu na ivinhu vose va mgati, visomigwe moto kuulongozi wa imulava nhosa. <verse eid="NUM 19:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 19:6"/>Abaho imulava nhosa yasole lubiki lwa mwelezi na bunho da hisopo na sufi ndung'hu, yavigele vose muumoto awo ukwaka. <verse eid="NUM 19:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 19:7"/>Yahamambukiza, ayo imulava nhosa yavifuwe viwalo vake na yakoge mazi lukuli lose, abaho kodaha kubwela mna ing'hambi, na kokala yafitile mbaka ichungulo. <verse eid="NUM 19:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 19:8"/>Vivija imunhu ayo yonda yamsome moto ayo ing'ombe yavifuwe viwalo vake kwa mazi na yakoge lukuli lose, vivija na heyo kokala yafitile mbaka ichungulo.<verse eid="NUM 19:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 19:9"/>“Munhu yong'ala yazole ayo imitozi ya ing'ombe na yaigale hanhu hanogile kunze ya ing'hambi. Mitozi ayo ikigwe goya na isang'hanilwe na iwanhu wose wa Izilaeli kutendela mazi ga kusegesela gehile, ili kusegesa nzambi. <verse eid="NUM 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 19:10"/>Imunhu yonda yaizole imitozi ya ayo ing'ombe kolondigwa yafuwe viwalo vake lakini kokala yafitile mbaka ichungulo. Lagizo dino da siku zose, kwa Waizilaeli wose na iwanhu baki okala hamoja nao.<verse eid="NUM 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Malagizo mbuli ya kung'ala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 19:11"/>“Munhu yoyose yahakwasa maiti kokala yafitile kwa siku saba. <verse eid="NUM 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 19:12"/>Siku da kadatu na siku da isaba munhu ayo yaisunhe kwa gaja gamazi ga kusegesa gehile na heyo kokuwa kang'ala. Lakini kamba haisunha kudisiku da kadatu na da isaba munhu ayo kosigala vivo yafitile. <verse eid="NUM 19:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 19:13"/>Munhu yoyose yahakwasa maiti na haisunha kodifitiza hema da Mndewa Imulungu na yabaguligwe na iwanhu wa Izilaeli. Munhu ayo kosigala yafitile kwavija hamiziligwe gaja gamazi ga kusegesa gehile.<verse eid="NUM 19:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 19:14"/>“Gano gago malagizo kamba munhu yahafila mdihema. Munhu yoyose yokwingila mdihema ajo hebu munhu yeli mumo mng'anda ya dihema kokuwa kafita kwa siku saba. <verse eid="NUM 19:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 19:15"/>Kiya chochose hakigubikigwe chokuwa kifita. <verse eid="NUM 19:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 19:16"/>Munhu yoyose yonda yakwase maiti ga munhu yakomigwe hebu munhu yafile mwenyego mng'anda hebu munhu yahakwasa mizege ya munhu yafile hebu munhu yahakwasa panga, munhu ayo kokuwa kafita kwa siku saba.<verse eid="NUM 19:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 19:17"/>“Mbuli ya wanhu awo wafitile isoligwe ayo imitozi ya ing'ombe mdung'hu ya kusegesa gehile na ihanganyigwe na mazi ga lwanda mna inongo. <verse eid="NUM 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 19:18"/>Abaho munhu yong'ala yasole bunho da hisopo yadivabike mgamazi gago abaho yadimizile dihema na viya vose vili mng'anda na iwanhu weli mumo mng'anda. Vivija yammizile gago gamazi, munhu ayo yakwasile imizege ya munhu yafile hebu ayo yakwasile imaiti ya munhu yakomigwe hebu imunhu yakwasile maiti ya munhu yafile mwenyego hebu imunhu yakwasile panga. <verse eid="NUM 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 19:19"/>Kudisiku da kadatu na da isaba munhu ayo yong'ala yammizile imunhu yafitile mazi gago, avo kudisiku da saba komtenda yang'ale ayo imunhu yafitile, na heyo yavifuwe viwalo vake na yakoge na ichungulo kokuwa kang'ala.<verse eid="NUM 19:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 19:20"/>“Lakini kamba munhu kafita na haisunhile bule, munhu ayo kobaguligwa na iwanhu wose kwavija kodifitiza hema da Mndewa Imulungu. Kwavija hamiziligwe gago gamazi ga kusegesa gehile, avo munhu ayo kokuwa kafita. <verse eid="NUM 19:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 19:21"/>Wanhu wadigoge lagizo dino siku zose. Vivija imunhu yomiza gago gamazi ga kusegesa gehile, yafuwe viwalo vake, na munhu yoyose yogakwasa gago gamazi kokuwa kafita mbaka ichungulo. <verse eid="NUM 19:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 19:22"/>Kinhu chochose chonda yakikwase munhu ayo yafitile, kinhu acho chokuwa kifita, na munhu yonda yakikwase kinhu acho kokuwa kafita mbaka ichungulo.”<verse eid="NUM 19:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="NUM 20"/>
  <para style="s">Mazi golawa mdibwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 17:1-7">Kulawa 17:1-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 20:1"/>Wanhu wose Waizilaeli, wavika kuluwala lwa Sini, mna umwezi wa ichanduso weka ng'hambi yao ako Kadeshi. Viwakalile kuko Miliamu kafa na kazikigwa.<verse eid="NUM 20:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 20:2"/>Hanhu aho hawekile ing'hambi kukala kuduhu mazi ga kung'wa. Avo wanhu wose waiting'hana kuulongozi wa Musa na Haluni. <verse eid="NUM 20:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 20:3"/>Waiyalala walonga, “Vinoga twahafile hamoja na ndugu zetu kuulongozi wa dihema da Mndewa Imulungu! <verse eid="NUM 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 20:4"/>Habali mutugala siye iwanhu wa Mndewa Imulungu kuno kuluwala? Vino mutugala ili tufe hamoja na fugo zetu? <verse eid="NUM 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 20:5"/>Vino habali mutulava Misili na mutugala hanhu hano hehile? Hano haduhu ndiya hebu tini hebu zabibu hebu makomamanga. Vivija hata mazi ga kung'wa hano haduhu!”<verse eid="NUM 20:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 20:6"/>Avo, Musa na Haluni wasegela aho hana umting'hano, wachola kwima hana ulwivi lwa dihema da mting'hano, wagwa kingubanguba. Avo ukulu wa Mndewa Imulungu uwalawila, <verse eid="NUM 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 20:7"/>na Mndewa Imulungu kamulongela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 20:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 20:8"/>“Sola fimbo yako, abaho gweye na Haluni, muwating'hanize iwanhu wose wa Izilaeli. Abaho mgameso gao udilongele dibwe dili kuulongozi wao dilave mazi gake. Avo utende dibwe dilave mazi ili iwanhu wose wa Izilaeli na fugo yao wang'we mazi gago.”<verse eid="NUM 20:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 20:9"/>Musa kachola kuisola ayo ifimbo kuulongozi wa Mndewa Imulungu kamba viyalagizwe. <verse eid="NUM 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 20:10"/>Abaho Musa na Haluni wawating'haniza iwanhu wose kuulongozi wa idibwe na Musa kawalongela, “Tegelezeni mweye iwanhu wehile, vino tuwalavile mazi kulawa mdibwe dino?” <verse eid="NUM 20:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 20:11"/>Abaho Musa kenula fimbo yake, kaditowa ajo idibwe miyanza mibili. Ilawa mbwibwi ya mazi aho, wanhu wang'wa hamoja na fugo yao.<verse eid="NUM 20:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 20:12"/>Lakini Mndewa Imulungu kamulongela Musa na Haluni, “Kwavija mweye hamnitogole hebu kunigwaa ukulu mgameso ga Waizilaeli, avo kwa mbuli ayo honda muwengize iwanhu wao mna iisi inongile nowagwelela.” <verse eid="NUM 20:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 20:13"/>Mazi gago gakemigwa Meliba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kwa Kiebulania </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Meliba </char><char style="ft" closed="false">fambulo jake kuiyalala.</char></note> kwavija hanhu aho Waizilaeli wamuyalalila Mndewa Imulungu na heyo kailagusa kamba kang'ala hagati yao.<verse eid="NUM 20:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Wanhu ogomesigwa sikuwabitile Edomu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 20:14"/>Abaho Musa kawatuma wanhu kulawa Kadeshi wachole kwa mndewa wa Edomu wamulongele, “Ndugu yako Izilaeli kolonga vino, gweye kugajuwa magayo gose tugapatile, <verse eid="NUM 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 20:15"/>kujuwa iwahenga zetu viwacholile ako Misili, na wakala ng'hani ako na wadununzigwa, vivija na siye watudununza. <verse eid="NUM 20:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 20:16"/>Tumulilila Mndewa Imulungu na heyo kahulika kulila kwetu, katugalila imsenga wake yatusegese ako Misili. Avo, sambi twa hano Kadeshi, kudibuga diibakane na isi yako. <verse eid="NUM 20:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 20:17"/>Chonde tokupula ututogolele tubite mwiisi yako. Hatubojoga gaja gahandigwe mmigunda yenu na hatubojoga zabibu. Vivija hatung'wa mazi ga ivisima venu. Tokweleleza inzila ing'hulu ya mndewa na tobita bila kuhinduka ukudila hebu ukumoso mbaka vonda tulawe mwiisi yako.”<verse eid="NUM 20:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 20:18"/>Lakini mndewa wa Edomu kedika, “Aka, hamubita mwiisi yangu, kamba mwahabita nowavamila na nowatowa kwa misime.” <verse eid="NUM 20:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 20:19"/>Waizilaeli wamulongela, “Siye tokweleleza inzila ing'hulu, kamba siye na fugo yetu twahang'wa mazi genu, towaliha. Siye tolonda kubita, chonde tutogolele.”<verse eid="NUM 20:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 20:20"/>Lakini mndewa wa Edomu kasusumiza, “Hatulonda mubite.” Bahaja Waedomu weli na nguvu walawilila waitowe na hewo. <verse eid="NUM 20:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 20:21"/>Avo Waedomu wawalemela Waizilaeli kubita mna iisi yao. Avo, Waizilaeli wahindula wabita nzila iyagwe.<verse eid="NUM 20:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Haluni kofa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 20:22"/>Abaho Waizilaeli wose wagendelela na mwanza kulawa ako Kadeshi na wavika kulugongo lwa Holi. <verse eid="NUM 20:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 20:23"/>Ako kulugongo lwa Holi, kuna imbaka ya isi ya Edomu, Mndewa Imulungu kamulongela Musa na Haluni, <verse eid="NUM 20:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 20:24"/>“Gweye Haluni kofa, na honda wingile bule mwiisi inilongile nowagwaa Waizilaeli kwavija gweye na Musa munilema niye kuja Meliba. <verse eid="NUM 20:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 20:25"/>Gweye Musa msole Haluni na mwanage Eleazali, uwagale kuno uchanha kulugongo lwa Holi. <verse eid="NUM 20:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 20:26"/>Abaho msaule Haluni viwalo vake va ulava nhosa na umvaze imwana Eleazali. Haluni kofila kuko kulugongo.”<verse eid="NUM 20:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 20:27"/>Musa katenda kamba Mndewa Imulungu viyamulagize. Wose wadatu wakwela kulugongo lwa Holi kuulongozi wa iwanhu wose wa Izilaeli. <verse eid="NUM 20:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 20:28"/>Abaho Musa kamsaula Haluni viwalo vake va ulava nhosa, kamvaza imwana Eleazali. Na Haluni kafa kuko kulugongo. Abaho Musa na Eleazali wahumuluka hasi ya ulugongo. <verse eid="NUM 20:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 20:29"/>Mting'hano wose viupatile usenga awo kamba Haluni kafa wamuwasila tanga kwa siku malongo madatu.<verse eid="NUM 20:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="NUM 21"/>
  <para style="s">Wakanaani ohumwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 21:1"/>Mndewa imoja Mkanaani wa Aladi, yakalile ako Negebu viyajuwile kamba Waizilaeli wakala okwiza kubitila nzila ya Atalimu, kachola kuwavamila na wanhu wayagwe kawagoga. <verse eid="NUM 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 21:2"/>Avo Waizilaeli waiduwila kwa Mndewa Imulungu walonga, “Kamba wahawagela wanhu wano mmakono getu, avo togananga mabuga gao.” <verse eid="NUM 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 21:3"/>Mndewa Imulungu kawatendela kamba viwapulile, kawatenda Wakanaani wahumwe. Waizilaeli wawakoma Wakanaani wose, hamoja na mabuga gao. Avo hanhu aho hakemigwa Holima.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kwa Kiebulania </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Holima </char><char style="ft" closed="false">fambulo jake kubanangigwa.</char></note><verse eid="NUM 21:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zoka da shaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 21:4"/>Waizilaeli wagendelela na mwanza kulawa kulugongo lwa Holi wabitila nzila ilongoza kuna ibahali ya Shamu ili waizunguluke isi ya Edomu. Lakini mnzila wanhu wadonha kugendelela na umwanza. <verse eid="NUM 21:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 21:5"/>Avo wasonga kumuyalalila Mndewa Imulungu na Musa, walonga, “Habali mutulava Misili ili tufile hano kuluwala? Hano haduhu ndiya iyagwe wala mazi ga kung'wa, na tudonha kuja ndiya ino ihile.”<verse eid="NUM 21:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 21:6"/>Baho Mndewa Imulungu kagala mizoka ikalile na sumu na iwaluma iwanhu, na Waizilaeli wengi wafa. <verse eid="NUM 21:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 21:7"/>Avo, wanhu wamcholela Musa, wamulongela, “Tutenda nzambi tumuyalalila Mndewa Imulungu na gweye vivija. Mpule Mndewa Imulungu yatusegesele imizoka ino.” Avo Musa kawapulila iwanhu kwa Mndewa Imulungu. <verse eid="NUM 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 21:8"/>Avo, Mndewa Imulungu kamulongela Musa, “Tenda zoka da shaba, udinanike mdibiki. Munhu yoyose yonda yalumigwe na zoka, yahadilola ajo dizoka da shaba kohona.” <verse eid="NUM 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 21:9"/>Avo Musa katenda zoka da shaba kadinanika mdibiki. Kila munhu yalumigwe na zoka viyadilolile ajo dizoka da shaba kahona.<verse eid="NUM 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mwanza wa kuchola Moabu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 21:10"/>Avo Waizilaeli wagendelela na mwanza wao na weka ng'hambi yao ako Oboti. <verse eid="NUM 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 21:11"/>Kulawa ako wachola mbaka Iye Abalimu, kuluwala mwambu wa kudilawila zuwa, ako Moabu. <verse eid="NUM 21:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 21:12"/>Kulawa ako wachola na weka ng'hambi yao kubonde da Zeledi. <verse eid="NUM 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 21:13"/>Kulawa ako wachola na weka ng'hambi yao kuluwala mwambu wa kasikazini ya lwanda lwa Alinoni, awo uluwala lugendelela mbaka mwiisi ya Waamoli. Lwanda lwa Alinoni awo ukalile imbaka ya Wamoabu na Waamoli. <verse eid="NUM 21:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 21:14"/>Lekaavo yandikigwa mna ikitabu cha ng'hondo za Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:14">“Buga da Wahebu mwiisi ya Sufa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:14">na mabonde ga Alinoni,<verse eid="NUM 21:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 21:15"/>na mtelemuko wa gamabonde</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:15">uvikile mbaka buga da Ali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:15">na kuchola kuna imbaka ya isi ya Moabu!”<verse eid="NUM 21:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 21:16"/>Kulawa kuko Waizilaeli wachola mbaka Beeli, ako kuna ikisima Mndewa Imulungu kiyamulongele Musa, yawating'hanize iwanhu na heyo kowagwaa mazi. <verse eid="NUM 21:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 21:17"/>Aho Waizilaeli wemba lwila luno,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:17">“Kisima lava mazi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:17">Kimbileni!<verse eid="NUM 21:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 21:18"/>Kisima kihimbigwe na iwakulu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:18">kisima kihimbigwe na wanhu weli na ukulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:18">wakihimba kwa fimbo zao.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 21:18">Kulawa kuluwala wachola mbaka Matana, <verse eid="NUM 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 21:19"/>kulawa Matana mbaka Nahalieli, kulawa Nahalieli mbaka Bamoti, <verse eid="NUM 21:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 21:20"/>na kulawa Bamoti mbaka kubonde dili Moabu kuna inhembeti ya lugongo lwa Pisiga, luilola na uluwala.<verse eid="NUM 21:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Waizilaeli owahuma Sihoni na Ogu awo iwandewa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 2:26-3:11">Kumbukumbu 2:26-3:11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 21:21"/>Waizilaeli wamgalila mndewa Sihoni wa Waamoli usenga uno, <verse eid="NUM 21:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 21:22"/>“Ututogolele tubite mwiisi yako, honda tubite mna imigunda yako ya ndiya, na migunda ya mizabibu na hatung'wa mazi ga visima venu, tobita mna inzila ya mndewa mbaka vonda tubite mwiisi yako.” <verse eid="NUM 21:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 21:23"/>Lakini Sihoni hawatogolele Waizilaeli wabite mwiisi yake. Kawating'haniza wakalizi wake, kachola kuluwala ako Yahasa kawavamila Waizilaeli. <verse eid="NUM 21:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 21:24"/>Lakini Waizilaeli wamkoma, waisola isi ayo kulawa hana ulwanda lwa Alinoni mbaka lwanda lwa Yaboki, aho hana imbaka ya isi ya Waamoni, aho hokalizigwa ng'hani. <verse eid="NUM 21:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 21:25"/>Waizilaeli wagasola mabuga ago gose ga Waamoli na vivija wadisola dibuga dikulu da Heshiboni na ivijiji vake vose. <verse eid="NUM 21:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 21:26"/>Heshiboni dikala buga kulu da mndewa Sihoni wa Waamoli, ayo aho umwaka kaitowa na mndewa wa Moabu yakalile yalongole na kaisola isi ayo yose mbaka lwanda lwa Alinoni. <verse eid="NUM 21:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 21:27"/>Lekaavo iwanhu okwimba lwila luno,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:27">“Izoni Heshiboni na mudizenge kabili.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:27">Buga da mndewa Sihoni dizengwe vinogile kabili.<verse eid="NUM 21:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 21:28"/>Kwavija moto ulawa Heshiboni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:28">Milambi ya moto ilawa kudibuga da Sihoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:28">ugasakaza mabuga ga Ali ako Moabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:28">uvinanga vigongo va lwanda lwa Alinoni.<verse eid="NUM 21:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 21:29"/>Mugaya mweye wanhu Moabu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:29">Mubanangigwa mweye wanhu wa Kemoshi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:29">Muwatenda wanenu wa kimbigalo watange tange kwa bwembwe!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:29">Wandele zenu wasoligwa kamba watumwa wa mndewa Sihoni wa Waamoli.<verse eid="NUM 21:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 21:30"/>Lakini sambi ulelo wao ubanangigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:30">kulawa Heshiboni mbaka Diboni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:30">na kulawa Nashimu mbaka Nofa, behi ya Medeba.”<verse eid="NUM 21:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 21:31"/>Avo Waizilaeli wakala mwiisi ya Waamoli. <verse eid="NUM 21:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 21:32"/>Abaho Musa kawatuma wanhu wachole wakadisungulile buga da Yazeli. Avo wadivamila na kudisola buga ajo, wawawinga Waamoli wakalile mumo.<verse eid="NUM 21:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 21:33"/>Abaho Waizilaeli wahindula na wagoga inzila ichola Bashani. Mndewa Ogu wa ako Bashani kachola na iwakalizi wake ili wawavamile ako kudibuga da Edilei. <verse eid="NUM 21:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 21:34"/>Lakini Mndewa Imulungu kamulongela Musa, “Sikuumdumbe kwavija nimgela mmakono gako, heyo hamoja na iwakalizi wake na isi yake yose. Komtendela kamba viumtendele Sihoni, imndewa wa Waamoli, ayo yakalile ako Heshiboni.” <verse eid="NUM 21:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 21:35"/>Avo Waizilaeli wamkoma Ogu hamoja na wanage na iwakalizi wake wose, hawamulekile hata munhu imoja, abaho waisola isi yake.<verse eid="NUM 21:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="NUM 22"/>
  <para style="s">Balaamu kokemigwa na mndewa wa Moabu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 22:1"/>Waizilaeli wagendelela na mwanza na weka ng'hambi yao kudibawe da Moabu, mwambu wa kudilawilila zuwa wa lwanda lwa Yolidani, uilola na buga da Yeliko dikalile umwambu wa ulwanda.<verse eid="NUM 22:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 22:2"/>Mndewa Balaki mwanage Sipoli, kagajuwa gose Waizilaeli gawawatendele Waamoli. <verse eid="NUM 22:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 22:3"/>Avo heyo hamoja na Wamoabu wawadumba ng'hani Waizilaeli, kwavija Waizilaeli wakala wengi ng'hani. <verse eid="NUM 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 22:4"/>Avo Wamoabu wawalongela vilongozi wa Midiani, “Lunhu luno sambi baha lonanga kila kinhu kituzunguluke kamba ng'ombe mbigalo viyoja mijani mmigunda.” Avo Balaki mwanage Sipoli ayo yakalile mndewa wa Moabu kipindi acho, <verse eid="NUM 22:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 22:5"/>kamtumila usenga Balaamu mwanage Beoli ako Petoli, behi na lwanda lwa Fulate, mwiisi ya Amawi. Kamulongela vino, “Hana wanhu walawile mwiisi ya Misili, wanhu awo wenela kila hanhu mwiisi na vivija olonda kuniboka isi yangu. <verse eid="NUM 22:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 22:6"/>Avo wize uniduwilizile wanhu wano kwavija wana nguvu kubanza niye. Sengine nodaha kuwahuma na kuwawinga sikuwengile mwiisi yangu, kwavija nokujuwa, gweye wahamtambikila munhu, munhu ayo kotambikilwa na wahamduwila munhu, munhu ayo koduwiligwa.”<verse eid="NUM 22:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 22:7"/>Avo vilongozi wa Moabu na Midiani wasola sente zilondigwa mbuli ya kuduwiliza, wasegela wachola kwa Balaamu. Viwavikile wamgwaa Balaamu usenga wa Balaki.<verse eid="NUM 22:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 22:8"/>Balaamu kawalongela, “Kilo cha lelo muwase baha, na niye nowalongela gaja gonda yanongele Mndewa Imulungu.” Avo awo iwavele wa Moabu wakala na Balaamu.<verse eid="NUM 22:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 22:9"/>Abaho Imulungu kamwidika Balaamu, kamuuza, “Awano kina nani iwokala na gweye?”<verse eid="NUM 22:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 22:10"/>Balaamu kamwidika Mndewa Imulungu, “Balaki mwanage Sipoli, mndewa wa Moabu, kanigalila usenga kamba, <verse eid="NUM 22:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 22:11"/>hana wanhu walawa Misili, na hewo wenela kila hanhu mwiisi. Kanipula nichole nikawaduwile wanhu awo ili yadahe kuwatowa na kuwawinga.”<verse eid="NUM 22:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 22:12"/>Mndewa Imulungu kamulongela Balaamu, “Sikuuchole hamoja na iwanhu wano na sikuuwaduwile wanhu awo kwavija wanhu awo watambikiligwa.”<verse eid="NUM 22:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 22:13"/>Avo, imitondo Balaamu kalamuka, kawacholela awo ivilongozi wa Balaki kawalongela, “Bweleni mwiisi yenu, kwavija Mndewa Imulungu kangomesa kuchola na mweye.” <verse eid="NUM 22:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 22:14"/>Avo awo ivilongozi wa Moabu walawanya, wabwela kwa Balaki wamulongela, “Balaamu kalema kwiza na siye.”<verse eid="NUM 22:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 22:15"/>Abaho, Balaki kawatuma vilongozi wayagwe, wakala wengi ng'hani na wakala na ukulu kubanza awo walongole. <verse eid="NUM 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 22:16"/>Hewo wavika kwa Balaamu wamulongela, “Balaki mwanage Sipoli kolonga vino, ‘Sikuutogole kinhu chochose kikukimile uleke kwiza kumwangu! <verse eid="NUM 22:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 22:17"/>Niye nokugwaa vinhu vingi, na nokutendela kinhu chochose chonda unipule. Wize uwaduwile wanhu wano.’”<verse eid="NUM 22:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 22:18"/>Lakini Balaamu kawedika awo iwanhu wa Balaki, “Hata kamba Balaki yahanigwelela ng'anda yake kuno imema sente na zahabu, niye sidaha kubena lagizo da Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wangu, kwa mbuli ndodo hebu ng'hulu. <verse eid="NUM 22:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 22:19"/>Lakini chonde muwase baha kilo cha lelo kamba waja waenu walongole, ili nijuwe gaja gonda yanongele kabili Mndewa Imulungu.” <verse eid="NUM 22:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 22:20"/>Avo, kilo acho Mndewa Imulungu kamwidika Balaamu kamulongela, “Kamba awo weza kukukema, chola nao, lakini utende gaja gaiyeka gonda nikulongele.” <verse eid="NUM 22:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 22:21"/>Balaamu kalamuka imitondo kamtanda kihongwe wake kachola na awo ivilongozi.<verse eid="NUM 22:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Balaamu na kihongwe na msenga wa Mndewa Imulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 22:22"/>Mndewa Imulungu kamgevuzikila Balaamu kwavija kachola na iwanhu awo, avo msenga wa Mndewa Imulungu kamkimila mnzila kipindi acho Balaamu kakala yakwelile kihongwe wake na iwasang'hanaji wake wakala na heyo. <verse eid="NUM 22:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 22:23"/>Avo, ikihongwe viyamone msenga ayo wa Mndewa Imulungu kema mnzila kuno kagoga sime, kaleka inzila kabita kumgwazo. Balaamu kamtowa ayo ikihongwe kambweza mnzila.<verse eid="NUM 22:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 22:24"/>Abaho msenga ayo wa Mndewa Imulungu kalongola, kema hanhu hana inzila sisili, hagati ya migunda ya mizabibu na kukala na senyenge ya mabwe ukudila na ukumoso. <verse eid="NUM 22:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 22:25"/>Kihongwe viyamone msenga ayo wa Mndewa Imulungu, kaibwanha kuna uluwa na mgulu wa Balaamu ukwatuligwa aho hauluwa. Avo, Balaamu kamtowa kabili ayo ikihongwe.<verse eid="NUM 22:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 22:26"/>Abaho msenga ayo wa Mndewa Imulungu kalongola kabili, kema hanhu hasisili, aho hudaha kubita ukudila hebu ukumoso. <verse eid="NUM 22:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 22:27"/>Ayo ikihongwe viyamone msenga ayo wa Mndewa Imulungu kema aho, kawasa hasi. Balaamu kagevuzika, kamtowa kwa fimbo yake. <verse eid="NUM 22:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 22:28"/>Abaho Mndewa Imulungu kamtenda ayo ikihongwe yalonge, kamulongela Balaamu, “Nikutendela choni mbaka kunitowa miyanza midatu?”<verse eid="NUM 22:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 22:29"/>Balaamu kamulongela ayo ikihongwe, “Gweye kunitenda nambozi! Maza ng'halile na sime nahakukomile sambi baha.”<verse eid="NUM 22:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 22:30"/>Ikihongwe kamulongela Balaamu, “Niye ayo ikihongwe wako iija, nikupapaga siku zose mbaka lelo, lini nikutendela kamba vino?” Balaamu kedika, “Aka.”<verse eid="NUM 22:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 22:31"/>Baho Mndewa Imulungu kagagubula meso ga Balaamu na heyo kamona msenga wa Mndewa Imulungu kema mnzila, kuno kagoga sime. Balaamu kaibwanha hasi kingubanguba. <verse eid="NUM 22:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 22:32"/>Msenga ayo wa Mndewa Imulungu, kamulongela Balaamu, “Habali kumtowa kihongwe wako miyanza midatu? Niye niza kukukimila, kwavija hulondigwa uchole kuko. <verse eid="NUM 22:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 22:33"/>Kihongwe wako kanyona, na kainega miyanza yose midatu. Maza hainegile nahakukomile gweye, na ikihongwe ino nahamulekile mgima.” <verse eid="NUM 22:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 22:34"/>Balaamu kamulongela msenga ayo wa Mndewa Imulungu, “Nitenda nzambi kwavija sijuwile kamba kwima mnzila kunikimila. Avo sambi kamba gweye hulonda nigendelele na mwanza uno, avo nobwela ukae.” <verse eid="NUM 22:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 22:35"/>Msenga ayo wa Mndewa Imulungu kamulongela Balaamu, “Chola na iwanhu wano, lakini ulonge gaja gaiyeka gonda nikulongele.” Avo Balaamu kagendelela na umwanza hamoja na ivilongozi wa Balaki.<verse eid="NUM 22:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 22:36"/>Balaki viyahulike kamba Balaamu kamnzila kokwiza, kachola kumbokela kudibuga da Ali, buga dijo dikala mwiingema ya lwanda lwa Alinoni kuna imbaka ya Moabu. <verse eid="NUM 22:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 22:37"/>Balaki kamulongela Balaamu, “Habali hawizile kumwangu vinikukemile? Vino gweye kugelegeza sidaha bule kukugwaa vinhu vingi?”<verse eid="NUM 22:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 22:38"/>Balaamu kamwidika Balaki, “Sambi niza kumwako! Vino niye nodaha kulonga mbuli yoyose inilonda? Mbuli yonda yanongele Imulungu ayo yonda nonge.”<verse eid="NUM 22:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 22:39"/>Avo, Balaamu kachola hamoja na Balaki wavika kudibuga da Kiliati Husoti. <verse eid="NUM 22:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 22:40"/>Ako Balaki kalava nhosa ya ng'ombe na ng'hondolo, kawagwaa inyama iyagwe Balaamu na awo ivilongozi wakalile hamoja na heyo.<verse eid="NUM 22:40"/></para>
  <para style="s">Balaamu kosonga kulagula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 22:41"/>Imitondo Balaki kamsola Balaamu, kakwela na heyo mbaka Bamoti Baali, kuko Balaamu kadaha kuwona Waizilaeli wayagwe.<verse eid="NUM 22:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="NUM 23"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 23:1"/>Balaamu kamulongela Balaki, “Nizengele mhango saba hano abaho unigalile ng'ombe mbigalo saba na ng'hondolo mbigalo saba.” <verse eid="NUM 23:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 23:2"/>Balaki katenda kamba Balaamu viyamulongele. Avo walava nhosa mna kila upango, ng'ombe mbigalo imoja na ng'hondolo mbigalo imoja.<verse eid="NUM 23:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 23:3"/>Abaho Balaamu kamulongela Balaki, “Kala hano behi na inhosa yako ya kusoma moto, niye nokwela uchanha sengine Mndewa Imulungu kolonga na niye. Kinhu chochose chonda yandagusile nokwiza kukulongela.” Avo Balaamu kakwela yaiyeka kuna inhembeti ya ulugongo. <verse eid="NUM 23:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 23:4"/>Imulungu kamulawila Balaamu, abaho Balaamu kamulongela, “Nitanda mhango saba na nilava nhosa uchanha ya kila upango ng'ombe mbigalo imoja na ng'hondolo mbigalo imoja.”<verse eid="NUM 23:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 23:5"/>Mndewa Imulungu kamgwaa usenga Balaamu na kamulongela, “Bwela kwa Balaki na mgwee usenga awo.” <verse eid="NUM 23:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 23:6"/>Avo Balaamu kabwela na kamvika Balaki kema bahaja behi na nhosa yake, hamoja na vilongozi wose wa Moabu.<verse eid="NUM 23:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 23:7"/>Balaamu kamgwaa Balaki uusenga kwa kulagula kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:7">“Balaki kanigala hano kulawa Alamu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:7">Ona, mndewa wa Moabu kanigala kulawa kuvigongo va mwambu wa kudilawilila zuwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:7">Kalonga, ‘Izo uniduwilizile wanhu wa Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:7">ona, izo uwaduwile Waizilaeli!’<verse eid="NUM 23:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 23:8"/>Lakini, vino nomduwilaze munhu haduwiligwe na Imulungu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:8">Vino nowasuwaze wanhu hawasuwigwe na Mndewa Imulungu?<verse eid="NUM 23:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 23:9"/>Kulawa kuna inhembeti ya imibwe nowona,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:9">Kulawa uchanha ya ivigongo nowasungulila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:9">Lola wanhu wano okala waiyeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:9">Na watambikiligwa kubanza wanhu wa isi ziyagwe.<verse eid="NUM 23:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 23:10"/>Nani yodaha kuwapeta wanhu wa Yakobo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:10">Nani yodaha kugapeta mabumbila ga Izilaeli?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:10">Beta ifa yangu iwe kamba imoja wa awo iwanhu wa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:10">Beta niye nife kamba munhu yanogile mgameso ga Imulungu.”<verse eid="NUM 23:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 23:11"/>Abaho Balaki kamulongela Balaamu, “Kunhenda choni? Nikugala hano uwaduwile wanhu onihila lakini gweye kuwatambikila.”<verse eid="NUM 23:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 23:12"/>Balaamu kamwidika Balaki, “Niye nolondigwa kulonga mbuli zija ziyanigwelele Mndewa Imulungu.”<verse eid="NUM 23:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Balaamu kolagula kabili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 23:13"/>Abaho Balaki kamulongela Balaamu, “Tuchole hanhu hayagwe aho kodaha kuwona lakini hudaha kuwona wose. Abaho uniduwilizile wanhu awo kulawa kuko.” <verse eid="NUM 23:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 23:14"/>Avo Balaki kamgala Balaamu kumgunda wa Sofimu kuna inhembeti ya ulugongo lwa Pisiga. Kuko vivija kazenga mhango saba, na kalava nhosa uchanha ya kila upango, ng'ombe mbigalo imoja na ng'hondolo mbigalo imoja.<verse eid="NUM 23:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 23:15"/>Balaamu kamulongela Balaki, “Kala hano behi na nhosa yako ya kusoma moto, niye nochola kuja umwambu kulonga na Mndewa Imulungu.”<verse eid="NUM 23:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 23:16"/>Mndewa Imulungu kamulawilila Balaamu kamgwaa usenga yonda yalonge na kamulongela yabwele kwa Balaki. <verse eid="NUM 23:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 23:17"/>Avo Balaamu kabwela, na kamvika Balaki kema behi na nhosa yake ya kusoma moto, hamoja na vilongozi wose wa Moabu. Balaki kamuuza Balaamu, “Mndewa Imulungu kakulongela choni?” <verse eid="NUM 23:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 23:18"/>Avo, Balaamu kamgwaa Balaki uusenga kwa kulagula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:18">“Izo Balaki utegeleze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:18">Nhegeleze gweye mwanage Sipoli.<verse eid="NUM 23:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 23:19"/>Imulungu siyo munhu yavize,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:19">Na heyo siyo munhu yagimbule magesa gake.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:19">Kotenda kinhu chochose chonda yalonge,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:19">Na kotenda gose kamba viyalongile kotenda.<verse eid="NUM 23:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 23:20"/>Lola nigweleligwa malagizo ga kuwatambikila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:20">na heyo kawatambikila avo niye sidaha kugimbula kinhu.<verse eid="NUM 23:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 23:21"/>Mndewa Imulungu honile dihile kwa wana wa Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:21">Vivija honile ndwagi kwa Waizilaeli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:21">Mndewa Imulungu kahamoja na hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:21">Na hewo omtogola kamba Mndewa wao.<verse eid="NUM 23:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 23:22"/>Imulungu kawalava mwiisi ya Misili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:22">na heyo kowagombela kwa nguvu zake kamba simba viyogombela wanage.<verse eid="NUM 23:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 23:23"/>Kuduhu uhawi kwa wanhu wa Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:23">Kuduhu munhu yodaha kuwaloga Waizilaeli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:23">Mbuli ya Izilaeli wanhu olonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:23">‘Loleni unzonza uyatendile Imulungu!’<verse eid="NUM 23:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 23:24"/>Lola Waizilaeli wenuka kamba simba mtwanzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:24">okwima wima kamba simba mbigalo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:24">Oigala na simba yoleka kuwasa mbaka yamambukize kuja kija kiyasakile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:24">na kong'wa damu ya vija viyakomile.”<verse eid="NUM 23:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 23:25"/>Abaho Balaki kamulongela Balaamu, “Kamba huwaduwila vivija sikuuwatambikile!”<verse eid="NUM 23:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 23:26"/>Balaamu kamwidika Balaki, “Vino sikulongele kamba chonda yalonge Mndewa Imulungu acho kinilondigwa kutenda?”<verse eid="NUM 23:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Balaamu kolagula lwa kadatu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 23:27"/>Balaki kamulongela Balaamu, “Izo nokugala hanhu hayagwe, sengine Imulungu kokutogolela uniduwilizile wanhu awo kulawa kuko.” <verse eid="NUM 23:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 23:28"/>Avo Balaki kamsola Balaamu mbaka kuna inhembeti ya ulugongo lwa Peoli, aho munhu yahema koluona uluwala. <verse eid="NUM 23:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 23:29"/>Balaamu kamulongela Balaki, “Unizengele mhango saba hano abaho unitandile ng'ombe mbigalo saba na ng'hondolo mbigalo saba.” <verse eid="NUM 23:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 23:30"/>Avo Balaki katenda kamba Balaamu viyamulongele, abaho kalava nhosa uchanha ya kila upango ng'ombe mbigalo imoja na ng'hondolo mbigalo imoja.<verse eid="NUM 23:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="NUM 24"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 24:1"/>Avo, Balaamu kajuwa kamba Mndewa Imulungu kolonda kuwatambikila Waizilaeli, avo hacholile kabili kulagula ila kakala kolola kuluwala. <verse eid="NUM 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 24:2"/>Kawona Waizilaeli weka ng'hambi, kila kabila dikala hanhu hake. Abaho Loho ya Imulungu imwizila, <verse eid="NUM 24:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 24:3"/>na heyo kalonga usenga uno wa ulaguzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:3">“Usenga wangu niye Balaamu mwanage Beoli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:3">Usenga wa munhu yafumbuligwe gameso.<verse eid="NUM 24:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 24:4"/>Usenga wa munhu yahulike mbuli za Imulungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:4">Munhu yalagusiligwe kinhu na Mndewa Imulungu yeli na Udahi wose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:4">Munhu yagwile kingubanguba na kugona gose.<verse eid="NUM 24:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 24:5"/>Vibanda venu vinoga mweye iwanhu wa Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:5">Ona, ng'hambi zenu zinoga mweye wanhu wa Izilaeli!<verse eid="NUM 24:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 24:6"/>Kamba mabonde golava mazi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:6">Kamba kihati kili behi na lwanda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:6">Kamba mikuyu ihandigwe na Mndewa Imulungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:6">Kamba mikenge ili behi na mazi.<verse eid="NUM 24:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 24:7"/>Okuwa na mazi mengi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:7">Mbeyu zao zofonza mazi mengi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:7">Mndewa wao kokuwa mkulu kubanza Agagi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:7">Undewa wao okwenela kila hanhu.<verse eid="NUM 24:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 24:8"/>Imulungu kawalava mwiisi ya Misili.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:8">Heyo kowagombela kwa nguvu zake kamba simba viyowagombela wanage.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:8">Kowakoboza wanhu wa isi owehila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:8">Koibena mizege yao.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:8">Kowahoma kwa migoha yake.<verse eid="NUM 24:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 24:9"/>Kowasa kamba simba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:9">Nani yogeza kumulamusa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:9">Yatambikiligwe munhu yoyose yowatambikila mweye Waizilaeli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:9">Yaduwiligwe yoyose yowaduwila mweye.”<verse eid="NUM 24:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 24:10"/>Balaki kamgevuzikila Balaamu, katowa makono gake kamulongela, “Nikukema uwaduwile iwanhu onihila, lakini miyanza yose midatu kuwatambikila! <verse eid="NUM 24:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 24:11"/>Avo, sambi baha ulawanye, nilonda kukugwaa nhunza, lakini lola Mndewa Imulungu kakugomesa sikuupate nhunza azo.”<verse eid="NUM 24:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 24:12"/>Balaamu kamwidika Balaki, “Vino siwalongele iwasenga wautumile kumwangu, <verse eid="NUM 24:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 24:13"/>hata kamba Balaki yahanigwelela ng'anda yake imemile sente na zahabu, niye sidaha kulema lagizo da Mndewa Imulungu, kwa kutenda kamba vinilonda niye mbuli yoyose inogile hebu ihile. Nilonga chochose chonda yalonge Mndewa Imulungu acho chonda nilonge. <verse eid="NUM 24:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 24:14"/>Avo nobwela kwa wanhu zangu, lakini ning'hali sinasegela beta nikulongele mbuli zonda watende wanhu awo kwa wanhu wako ako kumwande.”<verse eid="NUM 24:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Balaamu kolagula lwa ikane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 24:15"/>Avo Balaamu kalonga usenga uno wa ulaguzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:15">“Usenga wangu niye Balaamu mwanage Beoli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:15">usenga wa munhu yafumbuligwe gameso,<verse eid="NUM 24:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 24:16"/>usenga wa munhu yahulike mbuli za Imulungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:16">Munhu yagajuwile gaja ga Imulungu yeli Uchanha Ng'hani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:16">Munhu yalagusiligwe vinhu na Mndewa Imulungu yeli na Udahi wose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:16">Munhu yagwile kingubanguba na meso gake gona gose.<verse eid="NUM 24:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 24:17"/>Nomona ayo yonda yeze, lakini aho kumwande nomulola.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:17">Nomona lakini heli habehi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:17">Nhondo yolawa muulelo wa Yakobo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:17">Kolawila mndewa mna iwanhu wa Izilaeli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:17">Kwa fimbo yake kowazabula vilongozi wa Wamoabu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:17">Kowakoma wanhu wose wa ulelo wa Seti.<verse eid="NUM 24:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 24:18"/>Kowahuma iwanhu omwihila kulawa Edomu na Seili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:18">lakini Waizilaeli ogendelela kuhuma.<verse eid="NUM 24:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 24:19"/>Munhu imoja kulawa muulelo wa Yakobo kotawala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:19">Na kowakoma iwanhu onda wasigale kudibuga.”<verse eid="NUM 24:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Balaamu komambukiza kulagula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 24:20"/>Abaho Balaamu kawalola Waamaleki, kalonga usenga uno wa ulaguzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:20">“Waamaleki ni wanhu wa isi ili na nguvu kubanza zose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:20">Lakini ako kumwande yopotela yose.”<verse eid="NUM 24:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 24:21"/>Abaho Balaamu kawalola Wakeni, kalonga usenga uno wa ulaguzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:21">“Kae zenu mweye Wakeni zihola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:21">kamba mvulu izengigwe uchanha ya dibwe kulu.<verse eid="NUM 24:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 24:22"/>Lakini mweye Wakeni mokomigwa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:22">kipindi Ashulu vonda yawagoge.”<verse eid="NUM 24:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 24:23"/>Vivija Balaamu kalonga usenga uno wa ulaguzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:23">“Vino nani yonda yahone, Imulungu vonda yatende mbuli azo?<verse eid="NUM 24:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 24:24"/>Ngalawa zokwiza kulawa Kitimu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:24">owavamila Ashulu na Ebeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:24">na hewo vivija obanangigwa.”<verse eid="NUM 24:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 24:25"/>Avo Balaamu kenuka, kasegela kabwela ukae kumwake, vivija Balaki nayo kasegela.<verse eid="NUM 24:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 24"/>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="NUM 25"/>
  <para style="s">Waizilaeli ako Peoli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 25:1"/>Avo Waizilaeli viwakalile okala ako Shitimu, iwambigalo wasonga kuwasa na iwatwanzi wa Moabu. <verse eid="NUM 25:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 25:2"/>Watwanzi awo wawagoneka Waizilaeli mna zinhambiko zao za kuilavila nhosa imilungu yao. Waizilaeli waja ndiya yao na waitambikila imilungu ayo. <verse eid="NUM 25:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 25:3"/>Waizilaeli wailumba na imulungu Baali Peoli, Mndewa Imulungu kawagevuzikila Waizilaeli. <verse eid="NUM 25:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 25:4"/>Avo, Mndewa Imulungu kamulongela Musa, “Wasole vilongozi wose wa Waizilaeli, na uwabote kuulongozi wangu imisi, ili nileke kuwagevuzikila iwanhu.” <verse eid="NUM 25:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 25:5"/>Avo Musa kawalongela iwasemi wa Izilaeli, “Kila imoja wenu yamkome munhu yoyose kumwenu yailumbile na imulungu Baali Peoli.”<verse eid="NUM 25:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 25:6"/>Mwiizilaeli imoja kamsola mtwanzi imoja Mmidiani kamgala kuna ikibanda chake, kipindi Musa na Waizilaeli wose olola viwakalile hana ulwivi lwa dihema da mting'hano omulilila Mndewa. <verse eid="NUM 25:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 25:7"/>Avo, Finehasi mwanage Eleazali mzukulu wa Haluni, imulava nhosa, viyonile avo, kenuka kasegela hana umting'hano awo, kasola mgoha, <verse eid="NUM 25:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 25:8"/>kamkweleleza ayo Imwiizilaeli mbaka kuna ikibanda kawahoma mgoha mmunda wose wabili. Utamu ukalile owakoma Waizilaeli usegela. <verse eid="NUM 25:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 25:9"/>Iwanhu wafile mbuli ya awo uutamu wakala elufu ishilini na nne (24,000).<verse eid="NUM 25:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 25:10"/>Mndewa Imulungu kamulongela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 25:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 25:11"/>“Finehasi mwanage Eleazali mzukulu wa Haluni imulava nhosa, kakukimila kugevuzika kwangu mbuli ya Waizilaeli, mna iwanhu wose heyo yaiyeka ayo yonile usungu kamba vinyona niye. Lekaavo siwakomile Waizilaeli wose. <verse eid="NUM 25:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 25:12"/>Avo mulongele kamba notenda na heyo lagano da tindiwalo. <verse eid="NUM 25:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 25:13"/>Kumwake heyo na ulelo wake okuwa walava nhosa siku zose kwavija kona usungu mbuli yangu niye Imulungu wake na kawatendela loholo Waizilaeli.”<verse eid="NUM 25:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 25:14"/>Ayo Imwiizilaeli yakomigwe hamoja na mtwanzi wa Kimidiani twaga jake kakemigwa Zimili mwanage Salu, imoja wa kilongozi wa wanhu wa kabila da Simeoni. <verse eid="NUM 25:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 25:15"/>Na ayo imtwanzi Mmidiani yakomigwe, twaga jake kakemigwa Kozibi biti Suli, yakalile kilongozi wa kabila ako Midiani.<verse eid="NUM 25:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 25:16"/>Mndewa Imulungu kamulongela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 25:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 25:17"/>“Wavamileni Wamidiani na muwakome, <verse eid="NUM 25:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 25:18"/>kwavija hewo wawatendela gehile, wawabunyika mbuli ya Peoli na mbuli ya Kozibi yakomigwe kipindi utamu viwizile ako Peoli.”<verse eid="NUM 25:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 25"/>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="NUM 26"/>
  <para style="s">Wanhu opetigwa kabili.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 26:1"/>Vigabitile gago Mndewa Imulungu kamulongela Musa na Eleazali mwanage Haluni imulava nhosa, <verse eid="NUM 26:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 26:2"/>“Wapeteni Waizilaeli wose kila munhu kamba viyeli mna dikabila jake. Wapeteni wambigalo wose kusongela weli na miyaka malongo mabili na kugendelela awo odaha kuchola kuing'hondo.” <verse eid="NUM 26:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 26:3"/>Musa na imulava nhosa Eleazali walonga na iwanhu kudibawe da Moabu, behi na lwanda lwa Yolidani, ukalile oilola na buga da Yeliko dikalile umwambu wa ulwanda, wawalongela, <verse eid="NUM 26:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 26:4"/>“Wapeteni iwanhu kusongela waja weli na miyaka malongo mabili na kugendelela, kamba Mndewa Imulungu viyamulagize Musa.” Iwanhu wose kwa wose walawile Misili wakala wano.<verse eid="NUM 26:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 26:5"/>Mdikabila da Lubeni chaudele wa Yakobo zilawa ng'holo zino.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 26:5">Kubitila Henoki lulawa lukolo lwa Wahanoki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 26:5">kubitila Palu lulawa lukolo lwa Wapalu,<verse eid="NUM 26:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 26:6"/>kubitila Hesiloni lulawa lukolo lwa Wahesiloni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 26:6">kubitila Kalimi lulawa lukolo lwa Wakalimi.<verse eid="NUM 26:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 26:7"/>Iwambigalo wose kwa wose wapetigwe kulawa mzing'holo za kabila da Lubeni wakala elufu alobaini na ndatu na magana saba na selasini (43,730).<verse eid="NUM 26:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 26:8"/>Mwanage Palu kakala Eliabu, <verse eid="NUM 26:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 26:9"/>na wanage Eliabu wakala Nemueli na Datani na Abilamu, awo iwabili Datani na Abilamu wakala wasaguligwe mna umting'hano lakini wamuleka Musa na Haluni na wailumba na iwanhu wamkweleleze Kola, viwamulemile Mndewa Imulungu. <verse eid="NUM 26:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 26:10"/>Isi igubuka na iwameza, wafa hamoja na Kola na iwanhu wamkweleleze, moto viuwalukuze wanhu magana mabili na malongo matano, acho kiwa kinhu cha kuwazuma iwanhu. <verse eid="NUM 26:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 26:11"/>Lakini wanhu wa ulelo wa Kola hawakomigwe wose.<verse eid="NUM 26:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 26:12"/>Mdikabila da Simeoni zilawa ng'holo zino.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 26:12">Kubitila Nemueli lulawa lukolo lwa Wanemueli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 26:12">kubitila Yamini lulawa lukolo lwa Wayamini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 26:12">kubitila Yakini lulawa lukolo lwa Wayakini,<verse eid="NUM 26:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 26:13"/>kubitila Zela lulawa lukolo lwa Wazela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 26:13">kubitila Shauli lulawa lukolo lwa Washauli.<verse eid="NUM 26:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 26:14"/>Iwambigalo wose kwa wose wapetigwe kulawa mzing'holo za kabila da Simeoni wakala elufu ishilini na mbili na magana mbili (22,200).<verse eid="NUM 26:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 26:15"/>Mdikabila da Gadi zilawa ng'holo zino.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 26:15">Kubitila Sifoni lulawa lukolo lwa Wasifoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 26:15">kubitila Hagi lulawa lukolo lwa Wahagi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 26:15">kubitila Shuni lulawa lukolo lwa Washuni,<verse eid="NUM 26:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 26:16"/>kubitila Ozini lulawa lukolo lwa Waozini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 26:16">kubitila Eli lulawa lukolo lwa Waeli,<verse eid="NUM 26:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 26:17"/>kubitila Alodi lulawa lukolo lwa Waalodi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 26:17">kubitila Aleli lulawa lukolo lwa Waaleli.<verse eid="NUM 26:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 26:18"/>Iwambigalo wose kwa wose wapetigwe kulawa mzing'holo za kabila da Gadi wakala elufu alobaini na magana tano (40,500).<verse eid="NUM 26:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 26:19"/>Wanage Yuda wakala Eli na Onani. Awo wafila mwiisi ya Kanaani.<verse eid="NUM 26:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 26:20"/>Mdikabila da Yuda zilawa ng'holo zino.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 26:20">Kubitila Shela lulawa lukolo lwa Washela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 26:20">kubitila Pelesi lulawa lukolo lwa Wapelesi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 26:20">kubitila Zela lulawa lukolo lwa Wazela.<verse eid="NUM 26:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 26:21"/>Wanage Pelesi wakala Hesiloni na Hamuli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 26:21">Kubitila Hesiloni lulawa lukolo lwa Wahesiloni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 26:21">kubitila Hamuli lulawa lukolo lwa Wahamuli.<verse eid="NUM 26:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 26:22"/>Iwambigalo wose kwa wose wapetigwe kulawa mzing'holo za kabila da Yuda wakala elufu sabini na sita na magana tano (76,500).<verse eid="NUM 26:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 26:23"/>Mdikabila da Isakali zilawa ng'holo zino.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 26:23">Kubitila Tola lulawa lukolo lwa Watola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 26:23">kubitila Puva lulawa lukolo lwa Wapuva,<verse eid="NUM 26:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 26:24"/>kubitila Yashubu lulawa lukolo lwa Wayashubu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 26:24">kubitila Shimuloni lulawa lukolo lwa Washimuloni.<verse eid="NUM 26:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 26:25"/>Iwambigalo wose kwa wose wapetigwe kulawa mzing'holo za kabila da Isakali wakala elufu sitini na nne na magana ndatu (64,300).<verse eid="NUM 26:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 26:26"/>Mdikabila da Zabuloni zilawa ng'holo zino.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 26:26">Kubitila Seledi lulawa lukolo lwa Waseledi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 26:26">kubitila Eloni lulawa lukolo lwa Waeloni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 26:26">kubitila Yaleeli lulawa lukolo lwa Wayaleeli.<verse eid="NUM 26:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 26:27"/>Iwambigalo wose kwa wose wapetigwe kulawa mzing'holo za kabila da Zebuloni wakala elufu sitini na magana tano (60,500).<verse eid="NUM 26:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 26:28"/>Kulawa Yusufu tatao Manase na Efulaimu galawa makabila mabili, kabila da Manase na kabila da Efulaimu.<verse eid="NUM 26:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 26:29"/>Mdikabila da Manase zilawa ng'holo zino.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 26:29">Kubitila Makili lulawa lukolo lwa Wamakili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 26:29">kubitila Gileadi lulawa lukolo lwa Wagileadi,<verse eid="NUM 26:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 26:30"/>wanage Gileadi wakala Yezeli na Heleki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 26:30">kubitila Yezeli lulawa lukolo lwa Wayezeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 26:30">kubitila Heleki lulawa lukolo lwa Waheleki,<verse eid="NUM 26:30"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 26:31"/>kubitila Asilieli lulawa lukolo lwa Waasilieli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 26:31">kubitila Shekemu lulawa lukolo lwa Washekemu,<verse eid="NUM 26:31"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 26:32"/>kubitila Shemida lulawa lukolo lwa Washemida,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 26:32">kubitila Hefeli lulawa lukolo lwa Wahefeli.<verse eid="NUM 26:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 26:33"/>Selofehadi mwanage Hefeli halelile wana wa kimbigalo, ila kalela wana wa kitwanzi waiyeka, matwaga gao gakala Mala na Nuhu na Hogila na Milika na Tiliza.<verse eid="NUM 26:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 26:34"/>Iwambigalo wose kwa wose wapetigwe kulawa mzing'holo za kabila da Manase wakala elufu hamsini na mbili na magana saba (52,700).<verse eid="NUM 26:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 26:35"/>Mdikabila da Efulaimu zilawa ng'holo zino.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 26:35">Kubitila Shutela lulawa lukolo lwa Washutela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 26:35">kubitila Bekeli lulawa lukolo lwa Wabekeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 26:35">kubitila Tahani lulawa lukolo lwa Watahani.<verse eid="NUM 26:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 26:36"/>Mwanage Shutela kakala Elani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 26:36">kubitila Elani lulawa lukolo lwa Waelani.<verse eid="NUM 26:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 26:37"/>Iwambigalo wose kwa wose wapetigwe kulawa mzing'holo za kabila da Efulaimu wakala elufu selasini na mbili na magana tano (32,500). Kabila zose azo mbili zilawa kwa Yusufu.<verse eid="NUM 26:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 26:38"/>Mdikabila da Benjamini zilawa ng'holo zino.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 26:38">Kubitila Bela lulawa lukolo lwa Wabela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 26:38">kubitila Ashibeli lulawa lukolo lwa Waashibeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 26:38">kubitila Ahilamu lulawa lukolo lwa Waahilamu,<verse eid="NUM 26:38"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 26:39"/>kubitila Shufamu lulawa lukolo lwa Washufamu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 26:39">kubitila Hufamu lulawa lukolo lwa Wahufamu.<verse eid="NUM 26:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 26:40"/>Wanage Bela wakala Alidi na Naamani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 26:40">Kubitila Alidi lulawa lukolo lwa Waalidi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 26:40">kubitila Naamani lulawa lukolo lwa Wanaamani.<verse eid="NUM 26:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 26:41"/>Iwambigalo wose kwa wose wapetigwe kulawa mzing'holo za kabila da Benjamini wakala elufu alobaini na tano na magana sita (45,600).<verse eid="NUM 26:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 26:42"/>Mdikabila da Dani lulawa lukolo luno.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 26:42">Kubitila Shuhamu lulawa lukolo lwa Washuhamu.<verse eid="NUM 26:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 26:43"/>Iwambigalo wose kwa wose wapetigwe kulawa mzing'holo za kabila da Dani wakala elufu sitini na nne na magana nne (64,400).<verse eid="NUM 26:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 26:44"/>Mdikabila da Asheli zilawa ng'holo zino.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 26:44">Kubitila Imina lulawa lukolo lwa Waimina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 26:44">kubitila Ishivi lulawa lukolo lwa Waishivi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 26:44">kubitila Belia lulawa lukolo lwa Wabelia.<verse eid="NUM 26:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 26:45"/>Wanage Belia wakala Hebeli na Malikieli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 26:45">Kubitila Hebeli lulawa lukolo lwa Wahebeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 26:45">kubitila Malikieli lulawa lukolo lwa Wamalikieli.<verse eid="NUM 26:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 26:46"/>Asheli kakala na mndele yakemigwe Sela.<verse eid="NUM 26:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 26:47"/>Iwambigalo wose kwa wose wapetigwe kulawa mzing'holo za kabila da Asheli wakala elufu hamsini na ndatu na magana nne (53,400).<verse eid="NUM 26:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 26:48"/>Mdikabila da Nafutali zilawa ng'holo zino.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 26:48">Kubitila Yaseeli lulawa lukolo lwa Wayaseeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 26:48">kubitila Guni lulawa lukolo lwa Waguni,<verse eid="NUM 26:48"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 26:49"/>kubitila Yeseli lulawa lukolo lwa Wayeseli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 26:49">kubitila Shilemu lulawa lukolo lwa Washilemu.<verse eid="NUM 26:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 26:50"/>Iwambigalo wose kwa wose wapetigwe kulawa mzing'holo za kabila da Nafutali wakala elufu alobaini na tano na magana nne (45,400).<verse eid="NUM 26:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 26:51"/>Waizilaeli wose kwa wose viwapetigwe wakala laki sita na elufu imoja na magana saba na selasini (601,730).<verse eid="NUM 26:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="NUM 26:52"/>Abaho Mndewa Imulungu kamulongela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 26:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NUM 26:53"/>“Wanhu wa makabila gano gose uwagwelele isi ayo kamba uhazi wao, kamba viwapetigwe kwa matwaga gao. <verse eid="NUM 26:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="NUM 26:54"/>Kabila dili na wanhu wengi wagweleligwe uhazi mkulu na kabila dili na wanhu wadodo wagweleligwe uhazi mdodo. Kila kabila digweleligwe uhazi wake kamba iwanhu viweli. <verse eid="NUM 26:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="NUM 26:55"/>Vivija isi ayo igoligwe kwa kubwanha simbi. Kila kabila digweleligwe isi ayo kamba matwaga ga wahenga zao vigeli. <verse eid="NUM 26:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="NUM 26:56"/>Uhazi wa kila kabila ugoligwe kwa kubwanha simbi, kila kabila digweleligwe kamba vidili kulu hebu vidili dodo.”<verse eid="NUM 26:56"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="NUM 26:57"/>Mdikabila da Lawi zilawa ng'holo zino.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 26:57">Kubitila Gelishoni lulawa lukolo lwa Wagelishoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 26:57">kubitila Kohati lulawa lukolo lwa Wakohati,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 26:57">kubitila Melali lulawa lukolo lwa Wamelali.<verse eid="NUM 26:57"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="NUM 26:58"/>Vivija ng'holo zino zilawa mdikabila da Lawi, Walibini na Wahebuloni na Wamahili na Wamushi na Wakola. Kohati kakala tata wa Amulamu. <verse eid="NUM 26:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="NUM 26:59"/>Mwehe wa Amulamu twaga jake kakemigwa Yokebedi biti Lawi, kalelekela ako Misili. Mtwanzi ayo kamulelela Amulamu wana wadatu, wa kimbigalo wabili, Haluni na Musa na mtwanzi imoja yakemigwe Miliamu. <verse eid="NUM 26:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="NUM 26:60"/>Haluni kakala na wana wa kimbigalo wane, Nadabu na Abihu na Eleazali na Itamali. <verse eid="NUM 26:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="NUM 26:61"/>Lakini Nadabu na Abihu wafa viwamgalile Mndewa Imulungu nhosa ya moto haung'ala. <verse eid="NUM 26:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="NUM 26:62"/>Walawi wambigalo wose kwa wose kusongela wana weli na mwezi umoja na kugendelela wakala elufu ishilini na ndatu (23,000). Wano hawapetigwe hamoja na Waizilaeli wayagwe kwavija wao hawagweleligwe isi yoyose kamba uhazi wao mna iwanhu wa Izilaeli.<verse eid="NUM 26:62"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="NUM 26:63"/>Wano awo wambigalo mna iwanhu wa Izilaeli wapetigwe na Musa na imulava nhosa Eleazali kudibawe da Moabu, behi na lwanda lwa Yolidani uilola na buga da Yeliko dikalile umwambu wa ulwanda. <verse eid="NUM 26:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="NUM 26:64"/>Kuduhu hata munhu imoja yasigale mna iwanhu wapetigwe na Musa na imulava nhosa Haluni, kipindi viwawapetile iwanhu kwa mwanza wa ichanduso ako kuluwala lwa Sinai. <verse eid="NUM 26:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="NUM 26:65"/>Kwavija Mndewa Imulungu kakala yalongile wose ofila kuluwala, na vivo ikalile kuduhu hata munhu imoja yasigale mgima, ila Kalebu mwanage Yefune na Yoshua mwanage Nuni.<verse eid="NUM 26:65"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 26"/>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="NUM 27"/>
  <para style="s">Wandele wa Selofehadi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 27:1"/>Mala na Nuhu na Hogila na Milika na Tiliza wakala wandele wa Selofehadi. Selofehadi kakala mwanage Hefeli, Hefeli kakala mwanage Gileadi, Gileadi kakala mwanage Makili na Makili kakala mwanage Manase na Manase kakala mwanage Yusufu. <verse eid="NUM 27:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 27:2"/>Avo, awo iwandele wane wamcholela Musa, wema kuulongozi wa Eleazali imulava nhosa na vilongozi wose wa Izilaeli hana ulwivi lwa dihema da mting'hano walonga, <verse eid="NUM 27:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 27:3"/>“Tataetu kafa ako kuluwala. Hakalile mna iwanhu wamkweleleze Kola, ayo yamulemile Mndewa Imulungu ila heyo kafa kwa nzambi zake mwenyego, na kakala kabule wana wa kimbigalo. <verse eid="NUM 27:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 27:4"/>Avo habali twaga da tataetu dipotele mna iwanhu wa Izilaeli kwavija kakala kabule wana wa kimbigalo? Avo mtugwelele uhazi hamoja na iwandugu wa tataetu.”<verse eid="NUM 27:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 27:5"/>Avo Musa kaigala mbuli ayo kuulongozi wa Mndewa Imulungu. <verse eid="NUM 27:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 27:6"/>Mndewa Imulungu kamulongela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 27:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 27:7"/>“Azo ziwolonga iwandele wa Selofehadi za ukweli, uwagwelele uhazi hamoja na iwandugu wa tatao, waleke wasole uhazi wa tatao. <verse eid="NUM 27:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 27:8"/>Abaho uwalongele Waizilaeli kamba munhu yahafa bila kuleka mwana wa kimbigalo, uhazi awo yagweleligwe mwana wa ikitwanzi. <verse eid="NUM 27:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 27:9"/>Na kamba kabule mwana wa kitwanzi, avo uhazi awo wagweleligwe wakulu zake hebu wadodo zake. <verse eid="NUM 27:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 27:10"/>Na kamba kabule wakulu hebu wadodo, uhazi awo wagweleligwe tata zake wakulu hebu wadodo. <verse eid="NUM 27:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 27:11"/>Na kamba kabule tata mkulu hebu mdodo, avo uhazi awo yagweleligwe ndugu yake wa behi, na heyo yausole kamba wake mwenyego. Gano gago malagizo gangu kwa Waizilaeli, kamba niye Mndewa Imulungu vinikulagize.”<verse eid="NUM 27:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yoshua kosaguligwa yawalongoze Waizilaeli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 31:1-8">Kumbukumbu 31:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 27:12"/>Mndewa Imulungu kamulongela Musa, “Kwela uchanha ya ivigongo vino va Abalimu, uilole isi yonda niwagwelele Waizilaeli. <verse eid="NUM 27:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 27:13"/>Wahamambukiza kuilola na gweye vivija kofa kamba ndugu yako Haluni viyafile, <verse eid="NUM 27:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 27:14"/>kwavija hamdigogile lagizo jangu kuja kuluwala lwa Sini. Kipindi iwanhu wose viwaniyalalile kuja Meliba, mulema kulagusa ukulu wangu mgameso gao viwalondile wagweleligwe mazi.” <verse eid="NUM 27:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 27:15"/>Musa kampula Mndewa Imulungu, kalonga, <verse eid="NUM 27:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 27:16"/>“Go, Mndewa Imulungu wangu, gweye uli mwanduso wa ugima nokupula umsagule munhu wa kuwalola iwanhu wano, <verse eid="NUM 27:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 27:17"/>na yawalongoze mna izisang'hano zao zose, ili sikuwawe kamba ng'hondolo yelibule msusilaji.”<verse eid="NUM 27:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 27:18"/>Avo Mndewa Imulungu kamulongela Musa, “Msole Yoshua mwanage Nuni, imunhu yeli na moyo unogile, abaho umwikile makono, <verse eid="NUM 27:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 27:19"/>na gweye umwimize kuulongozi wa imulava nhosa Eleazali na umting'hano wose na gweye umsagule yawe kilongozi wao. <verse eid="NUM 27:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 27:20"/>Umgwelele hanhu ha sang'hano zako ili Waizilaeli wose wamtegeleze. <verse eid="NUM 27:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 27:21"/>Heyo yamuuzege Eleazali imulava nhosa yeli na dija idibwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kwa Kiebulania dibwe dino dokemigwa </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Ulimu.</char></note> da kujuwa gaja igangu. Kwa nzila ayo Eleazali komulongoza Yoshua na iwanhu wose wa Izilaeli mna zimbuli zose.” <verse eid="NUM 27:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 27:22"/>Musa katenda kamba viyalagizwe na Mndewa Imulungu. Kamsola Yoshua na kamwimiza kuulongozi wa Eleazali imulava nhosa na iwanhu wose wa Izilaeli. <verse eid="NUM 27:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 27:23"/>Abaho kamwikila makono na kamgwaa isang'hano kamba viyalagizwe na Mndewa Imulungu.<verse eid="NUM 27:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 27"/>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="NUM 28"/>
  <para style="s">Nhosa za kila siku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 29:38-46">Kulawa 29:38-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 28:1"/>Mndewa Imulungu kamulongela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 28:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 28:2"/>“Walongele Waizilaeli vino, mweye mundavile nhosa zilondigwa mna ikipindi kikigwe, ndiya za kusoma moto zilava mnung'ho uninogeza niye.<verse eid="NUM 28:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 28:3"/>“Walongele inhosa ya ndiya ya kusoma moto yonda wandavile iwe, wana ng'hondolo wabili wa mwaka umoja welibule kilema chochose, nhosa ayo ilavigwe kila siku. <verse eid="NUM 28:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 28:4"/>Mwana ng'hondolo imoja yalavigwe imitondo na wa kabili ichungulo, <verse eid="NUM 28:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 28:5"/>kila mwana ng'hondolo imoja yalavigwe hamoja na vibaba vibili va usage unogile utibwilizigwe na mavuta ganogile nyhupa imoja. <verse eid="NUM 28:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 28:6"/>Ino yokuwa nhosa ilavagwa kila siku, na yosomigwa kwa moto, nhosa ayo isonga kulavigwa kulugongo lwa Sinai kamba nhosa ya ndiya, ilava mnung'ho uninogeza niye Mndewa Imulungu. <verse eid="NUM 28:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 28:7"/>Nhosa ya king'waji ya nyhupa imoja ya divai ilavigwe na kila imwana ng'hondolo. Nhosa ayo ya king'waji uigide mna ihanhu hong'ala. <verse eid="NUM 28:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 28:8"/>Ichungulo umulave ija imwana ng'hondolo wa kabili hamoja na imhishi ya usage utibwilizigwe na mavuta na inhosa ya king'waji isomigwa kwa moto kamba ija wa imitondo. Nhosa ayo ya ndiya yolava mnung'ho uninogeza niye Mndewa Imulungu.”<verse eid="NUM 28:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nhosa za siku za kubwihila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 28:9"/>Mna isiku ya Kubwihila, mulave nhosa ya wana ng'hondolo wabili weli na mwaka umoja na welibule kilema chochose, hamoja na mhishi imoja ya usage unogile utibwilizigwe na mavuta na mulave na inhosa ya king'waji. <verse eid="NUM 28:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 28:10"/>Nhosa ino ya kusoma moto ilavigwe kila siku ya Kubwihila bila kuleka ija inhosa ilavagwa kila siku hamoja na inhosa ya king'waji.<verse eid="NUM 28:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nhosa za kila mwezi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 28:11"/>Na kila mwezi viusonga, munilavile niye Mndewa Imulungu nhosa ya kusoma moto, ng'ombe mbigalo wabili, ng'hondolo mbigalo imoja na wana ng'hondolo mbigalo saba wa mwaka umoja, wose awo sikuwawe na kilema chochose. <verse eid="NUM 28:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 28:12"/>Vivija mulave nhosa ya ndiya ya mhishi imoja na vibaba vibili va usage unogile utibwilizigwe na mavuta kwa kila ng'ombe mbigalo, na mhishi imoja ya usage unogile utibwilizigwe na mavuta mbuli ya ing'hondolo mbigalo, <verse eid="NUM 28:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 28:13"/>na vibaba vibili va usage unogile utibwilizigwe na mavuta kwa kila imwana ng'hondolo. Nhosa zino za kusoma moto azo nhosa za ndiya zilava mnung'ho uninogeza niye Mndewa Imulungu. <verse eid="NUM 28:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 28:14"/>Divai kamba nhosa ya king'waji nyhupa mbili zilavigwe kwa kila ing'ombe mbigalo na nyhupa imoja na nusu ilavigwe kwa kila ng'hondolo mbigalo na nyhupa imoja ilavigwe kwa kila imwana ng'hondolo. Ino ayo inhosa ya kusoma moto ya kila mwezi mna umwaka mgima. <verse eid="NUM 28:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 28:15"/>Vivija munilavile niye Mndewa Imulungu nhosa ya kusegesa nzambi, mbuzi mbigalo imoja, bila kuleka ija inhosa ya kusoma moto ilavagwa kila siku hamoja na inhosa ya king'waji.<verse eid="NUM 28:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nhosa za Pasaka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 23:5-14">Walawi 23:5-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 28:16"/>Mna isiku ya longo na nne ya mwezi wa ichanduso yokuwa Pasaka ya Mndewa Imulungu. <verse eid="NUM 28:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 28:17"/>Mna isiku ya longo na tano ya mwezi awo nyimwilinyimwili ya magate hagageligwe hamila yosonga. Kwa siku saba muje magate hagageligwe hamila. <verse eid="NUM 28:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 28:18"/>Mna isiku ya ichanduso ya nyimwilinyimwili ayo hokuwa na mting'hano ung'alile. Siku ayo sikumusang'hane. <verse eid="NUM 28:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 28:19"/>Mulave nhosa ya kusoma moto kamba nhosa ya ndiya kumwangu niye Mndewa Imulungu. Ng'ombe mbigalo wabili, ng'hondolo mbigalo imoja, wana ng'hondolo mbigalo saba wa mwaka umoja, wose awo sikuwawe na kilema chochose. <verse eid="NUM 28:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 28:20"/>Vivija mulave na inhosa ya ndiya ya mhishi imoja na vibaba vibili va usage utibwilizigwe na mavuta kwa kila ing'ombe mbigalo, mhishi imoja mbuli ya ing'hondolo mbigalo, <verse eid="NUM 28:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 28:21"/>na vibaba vibili kwa kila imwana ng'hondolo mna iwao saba. <verse eid="NUM 28:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 28:22"/>Vivija mulave mbuzi mbigalo imoja kamba nhosa ya kusegesa nzambi ili kuwatendela loholo. <verse eid="NUM 28:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 28:23"/>Mulave vinhu avo vose bila kuleka ija inhosa ya kusoma moto ilavagwa kila siku. <verse eid="NUM 28:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 28:24"/>Vivija kwa siku azo zose saba, mulave nhosa ya kusoma moto kamba nhosa ya ndiya, ilava mnung'ho uninogeza niye Mndewa Imulungu. Nhosa ayo muilave bila kuleka ija inhosa ya kusoma moto ilavagwa kila siku hamoja na inhosa ya king'waji. <verse eid="NUM 28:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 28:25"/>Mna isiku ya saba mutende mting'hano ung'alile, na sikumusang'hane.<verse eid="NUM 28:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nhosa ya nyimwilinyimwili ya mawiki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 23:15-22">Walawi 23:15-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 28:26"/>Mna isiku ya ichanduso ya nyimwilinyimwili ya mawiki, kipindi vimunilavila niye Mndewa Imulungu gaja gaichanduso kusengigwa, mutende mting'hano ung'alile, na sikumusang'hane. <verse eid="NUM 28:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 28:27"/>Mulave nhosa ya kusoma moto, ilava mnung'ho uninogeza niye Mndewa Imulungu. Ng'ombe mbigalo wabili, ng'hondolo mbigalo imoja, wana ng'hondolo saba wa kimbigalo wa mwaka umoja, welibule kilema chochose. <verse eid="NUM 28:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 28:28"/>Vivija mulave nhosa ya ndiya ya mhishi imoja na vibaba vibili va usage unogile utibwilizigwe na mavuta kwa kila ng'ombe mbigalo, na mhishi imoja mbuli ya ing'hondolo mbigalo, <verse eid="NUM 28:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 28:29"/>na vibaba vibili kwa kila imwana ng'hondolo, mna iwao saba. <verse eid="NUM 28:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 28:30"/>Vivija mulave mbuzi mbigalo imoja kamba nhosa ya kusegesa nzambi ili kuwatendela loholo. <verse eid="NUM 28:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 28:31"/>Mulave vinhu avo vose bila kuleka ija inhosa ya kusoma moto ilavagwa kila siku hamoja na inhosa ya king'waji. Vivija iwanyama awo wose sikuwawe na kilema chochose.<verse eid="NUM 28:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 28"/>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="NUM 29"/>
  <para style="s">Nhosa ya nyimwilinyimwili ya mhalati</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 23:23-25">Walawi 23:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 29:1"/>Mna isiku ya ichanduso ya mwezi wa saba, mutende mting'hano ung'alile, na sikumusang'hane. Siku ayo yokuwa ya kutowa mhalati. <verse eid="NUM 29:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 29:2"/>Mulave nhosa ya kusoma moto, ilava mnung'ho uninogeza niye Mndewa Imulungu, ng'ombe mbigalo imoja, ng'hondolo mbigalo imoja na wana ng'hondolo wa kimbigalo saba wa mwaka umoja, wose awo sikuwawe na kilema chochose. <verse eid="NUM 29:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 29:3"/>Vivija mulave nhosa ya ndiya ya usage unogile utibwilizigwe na mavuta, mhishi imoja na vibaba vibili mbuli ya ing'ombe mbigalo, na mhishi imoja mbuli ya ing'hondolo mbigalo, <verse eid="NUM 29:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 29:4"/>na vibaba vibili kwa kila imwana ng'hondolo mna iwao saba. <verse eid="NUM 29:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 29:5"/>Vivija mulave mbuzi mbigalo imoja kamba nhosa ya kusegesa nzambi ili kuwatendela loholo. <verse eid="NUM 29:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 29:6"/>Mulave vinhu avo vose bila kuleka ija inhosa ya kusoma moto na inhosa ya king'waji na inhosa ya ndiya ilavagwa siku ya ichanduso ya kila mwezi na inhosa ya kusoma moto na inhosa ya indiya na inhosa ya king'waji ilavagwa kila siku. Nhosa azo zolava mnung'ho uninogeza niye Mndewa Imulungu.<verse eid="NUM 29:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nhosa za siku ya kutendeligwa loholo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 23:26-32">Walawi 23:26-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 29:7"/>Mna isiku ya longo ya mwezi awo wa saba mutende mting'hano ung'alile. Siku ayo mfunge kuja na sikumusang'hane sang'hano yoyose. <verse eid="NUM 29:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 29:8"/>Mundavile niye Mndewa Imulungu nhosa ya kusoma moto ilava mnung'ho uninogeza niye. Ng'ombe mbigalo imoja, ng'hondolo mbigalo imoja na wana ng'hondolo wa kimbigalo saba wa mwaka umoja, wose awo sikuwawe na kilema chochose. <verse eid="NUM 29:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 29:9"/>Vivija mulave nhosa ya ndiya ya usage unogile utibwilizigwe na mavuta, mhishi imoja na vibaba vibili mbuli ya ing'ombe mbigalo, na mhishi imoja mbuli ya ing'hondolo mbigalo, <verse eid="NUM 29:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 29:10"/>na vibaba vibili kwa kila imwana ng'hondolo mna iwao saba. <verse eid="NUM 29:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 29:11"/>Vivija mulave mbuzi mbigalo imoja kamba nhosa ya kusegesa nzambi bila kuleka inhosa ya kuwatendela wanhu loholo hamoja na inhosa ya kusoma moto ilavagwa kila siku, na nhosa yake ya indiya na nhosa ya king'waji.<verse eid="NUM 29:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nhosa ya nyimwilinyimwili ya vibanda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 23:33-44">Walawi 23:33-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 29:12"/>Mna isiku ya longo na tano ya mwezi awo wa saba mutende mting'hano ung'alile. Muideng'helele nyimwilinyimwili kwa siku saba mbuli ya Mndewa Imulungu na sikumusang'hane. <verse eid="NUM 29:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 29:13"/>Siku ayo mulave nhosa ya kusoma moto kamba nhosa ya ndiya ilava mnung'ho uninogeza niye Mndewa Imulungu. Ng'ombe mbigalo longo na wadatu, ng'hondolo mbigalo wabili na wana ng'hondolo wa kimbigalo longo na nne wa mwaka umoja, wose awo sikuwawe na kilema chochose. <verse eid="NUM 29:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 29:14"/>Vivija mulave nhosa ya ndiya ya usage unogile utibwilizigwe na mavuta, mhishi imoja na vibaba vibili kwa kila ing'ombe mbigalo, na mhishi imoja kwa kila ing'hondolo mbigalo, <verse eid="NUM 29:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 29:15"/>na vibaba vibili kwa kila imwana ng'hondolo mna iwao longo na nne. <verse eid="NUM 29:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 29:16"/>Vivija mulave mbuzi mbigalo imoja kamba nhosa ya kusegesa nzambi. Laveni vinhu avo bila kuleka ija inhosa ya kusoma moto ilavagwa kila siku hamoja na nhosa yake ya indiya na nhosa ya iking'waji.<verse eid="NUM 29:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 29:17"/>Siku da kabili mulave ng'ombe mbigalo longo na wabili na ng'hondolo mbigalo wabili, wana ng'hondolo wa kimbigalo wa mwaka umoja longo na nne, wose awo sikuwawe na kilema chochose. <verse eid="NUM 29:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 29:18"/>Vivija mulave inhosa ya indiya na inhosa ya king'waji hamoja na iwang'ombe mbigalo na iwang'hondolo mbigalo na iwana ng'hondolo kamba viikalile siku da ichanduso. <verse eid="NUM 29:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 29:19"/>Vivija mulave mbuzi mbigalo imoja kamba nhosa ya kusegesa nzambi. Laveni vinhu avo bila kuleka ija inhosa ya kusoma moto ilavagwa kila siku hamoja na nhosa yake ya indiya na nhosa ya iking'waji.<verse eid="NUM 29:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 29:20"/>Siku ya kadatu mulave ng'ombe mbigalo longo na imoja na ng'hondolo mbigalo wabili, na wana ng'hondolo wa kimbigalo wa mwaka umoja longo na nne, wose awo sikuwawe na kilema chochose. <verse eid="NUM 29:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 29:21"/>Vivija mulave inhosa ya indiya na inhosa ya king'waji hamoja na iwang'ombe mbigalo na iwang'hondolo mbigalo na iwana ng'hondolo kamba vikalile siku da ichanduso. <verse eid="NUM 29:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 29:22"/>Vivija mulave mbuzi mbigalo imoja kamba nhosa ya kusegesa nzambi. Laveni vinhu avo bila kuleka ija inhosa ya kusoma moto ilavagwa kila siku hamoja na nhosa yake ya indiya na nhosa ya iking'waji.<verse eid="NUM 29:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 29:23"/>Siku ya ikane mulave ng'ombe mbigalo longo, na ng'hondolo mbigalo wabili, na wana ng'hondolo wa kimbigalo wa mwaka umoja longo na nne, wose awo sikuwawe na kilema chochose. <verse eid="NUM 29:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 29:24"/>Vivija mulave inhosa ya indiya na inhosa ya king'waji hamoja na iwang'ombe mbigalo na iwang'hondolo mbigalo na iwana ng'hondolo kamba vikalile siku da ichanduso. <verse eid="NUM 29:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 29:25"/>Vivija mulave mbuzi mbigalo imoja kamba nhosa ya kusegesa nzambi. Laveni vinhu avo bila kuleka ija inhosa ya kusoma moto ilavagwa kila siku hamoja na nhosa yake ya indiya na nhosa ya iking'waji.<verse eid="NUM 29:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 29:26"/>Siku ya tano mulave ng'ombe mbigalo tisa, na ng'hondolo mbigalo wabili, na wana ng'hondolo wa kimbigalo wa mwaka umoja longo na nne, wose awo sikuwawe na kilema chochose. <verse eid="NUM 29:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 29:27"/>Vivija mulave inhosa ya indiya na inhosa ya king'waji hamoja na iwang'ombe mbigalo na iwang'hondolo mbigalo na iwana ng'hondolo kamba viikalile siku da ichanduso. <verse eid="NUM 29:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 29:28"/>Vivija mulave mbuzi mbigalo imoja kamba nhosa ya kusegesa nzambi. Laveni vinhu avo bila kuleka ija inhosa ya kusoma moto ilavagwa kila siku hamoja na nhosa yake ya indiya na nhosa ya iking'waji.<verse eid="NUM 29:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 29:29"/>Siku ya sita mulave ng'ombe mbigalo nane, na ng'hondolo mbigalo wabili, na wana ng'hondolo wa kimbigalo wa mwaka umoja longo na nne, wose awo sikuwawe na kilema chochose. <verse eid="NUM 29:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 29:30"/>Vivija mulave inhosa ya indiya na inhosa ya king'waji hamoja na iwang'ombe mbigalo na iwang'hondolo mbigalo na iwana ng'hondolo kamba viikalile siku da ichanduso. <verse eid="NUM 29:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 29:31"/>Vivija mulave mbuzi mbigalo imoja kamba nhosa ya kusegesa nzambi. Laveni vinhu avo bila kuleka ija inhosa ya kusoma moto ilavagwa kila siku hamoja na nhosa yake ya indiya na nhosa ya iking'waji.<verse eid="NUM 29:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 29:32"/>Siku ya saba mulave ng'ombe mbigalo saba, na ng'hondolo mbigalo wabili, na wana ng'hondolo wa kimbigalo wa mwaka umoja longo na nne, wose awo sikuwawe na kilema chochose. <verse eid="NUM 29:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 29:33"/>Vivija mulave inhosa ya indiya na inhosa ya king'waji hamoja na iwang'ombe mbigalo na iwang'hondolo mbigalo na iwana ng'hondolo kamba vikalile siku da ichanduso. <verse eid="NUM 29:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 29:34"/>Vivija mulave mbuzi mbigalo imoja kamba nhosa ya kusegesa nzambi. Laveni vinhu avo bila kuleka ija inhosa ya kusoma moto ilavagwa kila siku hamoja na nhosa yake ya indiya na nhosa ya iking'waji.<verse eid="NUM 29:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 29:35"/>Mna isiku ya nane mutende mting'hano ung'alile na sikumusang'hane. <verse eid="NUM 29:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 29:36"/>Mulave nhosa ya kusoma moto kamba nhosa ya ndiya ilava mnung'ho uninogeza niye Mndewa Imulungu. Ng'ombe mbigalo imoja, ng'hondolo mbigalo imoja na wana ng'hondolo saba wa mwaka umoja, wose awo sikuwawe na kilema chochose. <verse eid="NUM 29:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 29:37"/>Vivija mulave inhosa ya indiya na inhosa ya king'waji hamoja na iwang'ombe mbigalo na iwang'hondolo mbigalo na iwana ng'hondolo kamba viilondigwe. <verse eid="NUM 29:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 29:38"/>Vivija mulave mbuzi mbigalo imoja kamba nhosa ya kusegesa nzambi. Laveni vinhu avo bila kuleka ija inhosa ya kusoma moto ilavagwa kila siku hamoja na nhosa yake ya indiya na nhosa ya iking'waji. <verse eid="NUM 29:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 29:39"/>Gano gago malagizo mbuli ya nhosa ya kusoma moto, na nhosa ya ndiya na nhosa ya king'waji na nhosa ya kugala kuilumba zonda mundavile niye Mndewa Imulungu mna ikipindi cha nyimwilinyimwili zenu, bila kuleka inhosa ya kuvikiza gaja gaulongile na nhosa ya kulonda mwenyego.<verse eid="NUM 29:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 29:40"/>Avo, Musa kawalongela Waizilaeli kila kinhu kiyamulongele Mndewa Imulungu.<verse eid="NUM 29:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 29"/>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="NUM 30"/>
  <para style="s">Malagizo mbuli ya kuiduwila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 30:1"/>Musa kawagwaa malagizo gano vilongozi wa makabila ga Izilaeli. Gano gago gayamulagize Mndewa Imulungu. <verse eid="NUM 30:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 30:2"/>Munhu yahaiduwila kwa Mndewa Imulungu, hebu yahalonga kwa kuiduwila kamba kuna kinhu kokitenda, munhu ayo kolondigwa sikuyabene kuiduwila kwake na yatende gose kamba viyalongile kwa mulomo wake.<verse eid="NUM 30:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 30:3"/>Kamba mndele yogendelela kukala mng'anda ya tatake yahaiduwila kinhu kwa Mndewa Imulungu na kuifunga mwenyego kwa mbuli ayo, <verse eid="NUM 30:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 30:4"/>na tatake komuhulika na hamgomesa bule, avo mndele ayo kolondigwa yatende kila kinhu kamba viyalongile. <verse eid="NUM 30:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 30:5"/>Lakini kamba tata wa mndele ayo kahulika na kamgomesa kutenda gago yalongile, avo mndele ayo halondigwa kutenda mbuli azo ziyalongile. Mndewa Imulungu koigela kumgongo mbuli ayo kwavija tatake kamgomesa kutenda gayalongile.<verse eid="NUM 30:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 30:6"/>Lakini kamba mndele ayo kasoligwa na kuno kaiduwila kinhu kwa Mndewa hebu kalonga kinhu bila kugelegeza goya na kuifunga mwenyego kwa mbuli zake, <verse eid="NUM 30:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 30:7"/>na mkasano wake kazihulika mbuli azo na hamgomese bule, avo kolondigwa yatende kamba viyalongile. <verse eid="NUM 30:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 30:8"/>Lakini kamba mkasano wake kazihulika mbuli azo na kamgomesa avo ayo imkasano kokuwa kaisegesa mbuli ayo na Mndewa Imulungu koigela kumgongo mbuli ayo.<verse eid="NUM 30:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 30:9"/>Lakini mtwanzi mgane hebu yasigwe kolondigwa yatende kila kinhu kamba viyalongile kotenda kwa Mndewa Imulungu.<verse eid="NUM 30:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 30:10"/>Mtwanzi yasoligwe yahaiduwila kinhu hebu kulonga kotenda kinhu kwa Mndewa, <verse eid="NUM 30:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 30:11"/>na mkasano wake kahulika na hamgomese bule, avo kolondigwa yatende kila kinhu kiyalongile. <verse eid="NUM 30:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 30:12"/>Lakini kamba mkasano wake vonda yahulike mbuli azo komgomesa avo hata kamba mtwanzi ayo kolonda kutenda kila kinhu kiyalongile avo halondigwa yatende na kwavija imkasano kazisegesa, avo Mndewa Imulungu koigela kumgongo mbuli ayo. <verse eid="NUM 30:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 30:13"/>Mkasano wake kodaha kusegesa hebu kuitogola mbuli yoyose ilongigwa na mtwanzi ayo kwa kuiduwila na kumtenda yaifunge mwenyego. <verse eid="NUM 30:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 30:14"/>Lakini kamba imkasano halonga mbuli yoyose toka siku viyomuhulika mwehe wake kolonga mbuli kwa kuiduwila avo kokuwa kaitogola mbuli ayo kulawa siku dijo viyaihulike kwavija halongile mbuli yoyose. <verse eid="NUM 30:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 30:15"/>Lakini kamba yahazitogola na baho kumwande kozilema avo heyo kolondigwa yapape gehile ga mwehe wake.<verse eid="NUM 30:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 30:16"/>Gano gago malagizo ga Mndewa Imulungu gayamgwelele Musa kwa mbigalo na mwehe wake na kwa tata na mndele wake kamba mndele ayo hanasoligwa na kokala kwa tatake.<verse eid="NUM 30:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 30"/>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="NUM 31"/>
  <para style="s">Waizilaeli owavamila Wamidiani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 31:1"/>Mndewa Imulungu kamulongela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 31:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 31:2"/>“Uwabwezele Wamidiani kwa gaja gawawatendele Waizilaeli, wahamambukiza kutenda vivo gweye kofa.”<verse eid="NUM 31:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 31:3"/>Avo Musa kawalongela iwanhu, “Watandeni wakalizi wachole wakawavamile Wamidiani na kuwabwezela gehile mbuli ya Mndewa Imulungu. <verse eid="NUM 31:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 31:4"/>Kulawa kila kabila da Izilaeli, musagule wakalizi wa ng'hondo elufu imoja.”<verse eid="NUM 31:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 31:5"/>Avo wanhu elufu imoja wasaguligwa kulawa kila kabila da Waizilaeli, wose kwa wose wakala wambigalo elufu kumi na mbili waitandile kwa ng'hondo. <verse eid="NUM 31:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 31:6"/>Musa kawagala wanhu awo kuna ing'hondo, kilongozi wao kakala Finehasi mwanage imulava nhosa Eleazali akuno kavipapa viya va hanhu hong'ala na zimhalati za kutowa ili kulava kilaguso cha ng'hondo. <verse eid="NUM 31:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 31:7"/>Waivamila isi ya Wamidiani kamba Mndewa Imulungu viyamulagize Musa, wawakoma wambigalo wose.<verse eid="NUM 31:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 31:8"/>Mna iwanhu awo wakomigwe kukala na wandewa watano wa isi ya Midiani, wakala Evi na Lekemu na Suli na Huli na Leba. Vivija wamkoma Balaamu mwanage Beoli.<verse eid="NUM 31:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 31:9"/>Waizilaeli wavisola vinhu vao vose, vivija wasola watwanzi na iwana na ng'ombe na fugo zose ziyagwe. <verse eid="NUM 31:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 31:10"/>Gamabuga na ng'hambi zao wavisoma kwa moto. <verse eid="NUM 31:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 31:11"/>Wavisola ivinhu vose na iwanhu wawagogile na iwanyama, <verse eid="NUM 31:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 31:12"/>wamgalila Musa na Eleazali, na iwanhu wose wa Izilaeli wakalile wekile ng'hambi kudibawe da Moabu, behi na lwanda lwa Yolidani uilola na buga da Yeliko dikalile umwambu wa ulwanda.<verse eid="NUM 31:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iwakalizi obwela kulawa kuna ing'hondo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 31:13"/>Avo Musa na Eleazali na ivilongozi wose wa umting'hano wa Waizilaeli wachola kunze ya ing'hambi kuwabokela awo iwakalizi. <verse eid="NUM 31:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 31:14"/>Musa kawagevuzikila iwakulu wa wakalizi wose, iwakulu wa wakalizi elufu imoja na iwakulu wa wakalizi gana, wabwelile kulawa kuna ing'hondo. <verse eid="NUM 31:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 31:15"/>Musa kawauza, “Habali muwaleka watwanzi wose wano wawe wagima? <verse eid="NUM 31:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 31:16"/>Kumbukeni kamba, iwatwanzi awo wakweleleza lagizo da Balaamu, na watenda Waizilaeli wamtendele Mndewa Imulungu nzambi ako Peoli mbaka mitamu iwezila iwanhu wa Mndewa Imulungu. <verse eid="NUM 31:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 31:17"/>Avo wakomeni wana wose wa kimbigalo na kila mndele yawasile na mbigalo. <verse eid="NUM 31:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 31:18"/>Lakini sikumuwakome wandele wose waja hawanawasa na wambigalo, walekeni wagima mbuli yenu wenyego. <verse eid="NUM 31:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 31:19"/>Iwanhu wose hagati yenu wakomile wanhu hebu kukwasa maiti olondigwa wakale kunze ya ing'hambi kwa siku saba, muisunhe mweye na iwanhu muwagogile kudisiku da kadatu na siku da isaba. <verse eid="NUM 31:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 31:20"/>Vivija mkisunhe kila kiwalo, na kila kinhu kitendigwe kwa ng'hwembe, kila kinhu kitendigwe kwa mibahila ya mbuzi hebu mibiki.”<verse eid="NUM 31:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 31:21"/>Mulava nhosa Eleazali kawalongela iwambigalo wose wabwelile kulawa kuna ing'hondo, “Gano gago malagizo gayagweleligwe Musa na Mndewa Imulungu. <verse eid="NUM 31:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 31:22"/>Zahabu na shaba na shaba ya kiguzi na chuma na bati na lisasi, <verse eid="NUM 31:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 31:23"/>na vose viyagwe vibitaga muumoto, vibitizwe muumoto ili kuvitenda ving'hale, na vivija volondigwa vitendigwe ving'ale kwa gaja gamazi ga kusegesa gehile. Vinhu vose viyagwe havidahaga kukala muumoto avo vitendigwe ving'ale kwa gago gamazi ga kusegesa gehile. <verse eid="NUM 31:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 31:24"/>Siku ya saba muvifue viwalo venu na mweye mokuwa mong'ala na modaha kwingila mwiing'hambi.”<verse eid="NUM 31:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kugoligwa kwa ivinhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 31:25"/>Mndewa Imulungu kamulongela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 31:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 31:26"/>“Gweye na Eleazali imulava nhosa hamoja na vilongozi wa ng'holo za makabila ga Waizilaeli vipeteni ivinhu vose na iwanhu na iwanyama visoligwe kuna ing'ondo. <verse eid="NUM 31:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 31:27"/>Vigoleni vinhu avo mna gamafungu mabili, fungu dimoja dokuwa da iwakalizi wacholile kuna ing'hondo na diyagwe dokuwa da iwanhu wose wayagwe wa Izilaeli. <verse eid="NUM 31:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 31:28"/>Abaho kulawa mdifungu da iwakalizi wacholile kuna ing'hondo, usole kinhu kimoja kulawa mna kila vinhu magana matano, iwe wanhu, ng'ombe, vihongwe, ng'hondolo hebu mbuzi. <verse eid="NUM 31:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 31:29"/>Vinhu avo umgwelele imulava nhosa Eleazali kamba sadaka kwa Mndewa Imulungu. <verse eid="NUM 31:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 31:30"/>Kulawa mdifungu da iwanhu wose, lava kinhu kimoja kwa kila vinhu malongo matano, iwe wanhu, ng'ombe, vihongwe, ng'hondolo hebu mbuzi. Vinhu avo uwagwee Walawi awo osang'hana mna dihema da Mndewa Imulungu.” <verse eid="NUM 31:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 31:31"/>Musa na imulava nhosa Eleazali watenda kamba Mndewa Imulungu viyamulagize Musa.<verse eid="NUM 31:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 31:32"/>Ivinhu viwasolile awo iwakalizi ako kuna ing'hondo vikala, ng'hondolo laki sita na elufu sabini na tano (675,000), <verse eid="NUM 31:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 31:33"/>ng'ombe elufu sabini na mbili (72,000), <verse eid="NUM 31:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 31:34"/>vihongwe elufu sitini na imoja (61,000), <verse eid="NUM 31:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 31:35"/>na wandele hawanawasa na wambigalo wakala elufu selasini na mbili (32,000). <verse eid="NUM 31:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 31:36"/>Nusu ya ivinhu avo wagweleligwa iwakalizi wacholile kuna ing'hondo, ng'hondolo laki ndatu na elufu selasini na saba na magana tano (337,500), <verse eid="NUM 31:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 31:37"/>mna iwang'hondolo awo walavigwe kwa Mndewa Imulungu wakala ng'hondolo magana sita na sabini na tano (675). <verse eid="NUM 31:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 31:38"/>Ng'ombe wa awo iwakalizi wakala elufu selasini na sita (36,000), na mna iwao iwang'ombe sabini na mbili walavigwa kwa Mndewa Imulungu kamba sadaka. <verse eid="NUM 31:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 31:39"/>Vihongwe wa awo iwakalizi wakala elufu selasini na magana tano (30,500), na mna iwao vihongwe sitini na imoja walavigwa kwa Mndewa Imulungu kamba sadaka. <verse eid="NUM 31:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 31:40"/>Iwanhu wakala elufu kumi na sita (16,000), na mna iwao wanhu selasini na mbili walavigwa kwa Mndewa Imulungu. <verse eid="NUM 31:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 31:41"/>Avo Musa kamgwelela vinhu avo Eleazali imulava nhosa kamba sadaka kwa Mndewa Imulungu, kamba Mndewa Imulungu viyamulagize Musa.<verse eid="NUM 31:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 31:42"/>Ija inusu iyagwe iwagweleligwe Waizilaeli, ayo iyaibagule Musa na ija inusu iwagweleligwe iwakalizi wacholile kuna ing'hondo, <verse eid="NUM 31:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 31:43"/>wakala ng'hondolo laki ndatu na elufu selasini na saba na magana tano (337,500), <verse eid="NUM 31:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 31:44"/>ng'ombe wakala elufu selasini na sita (36,000), <verse eid="NUM 31:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 31:45"/>vihongwe wakala elufu selasini na magana tano (30,500), <verse eid="NUM 31:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 31:46"/>wanhu wakala elufu kumi na sita (16,000). <verse eid="NUM 31:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 31:47"/>Kulawa mna inusu ayo iwagweleligwe Waizilaeli, Musa kalava mnyama imoja hebu munhu imoja kulawa kila bumbila da malongo matano, kamba Mndewa Imulungu viyamulagize, kawagwaa Walawi awo wasang'hane kuna dihema da Mndewa Imulungu.<verse eid="NUM 31:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 31:48"/>Abaho iwakulu wa iwakalizi elufu imoja na iwakulu wa wakalizi gana, wamcholela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 31:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 31:49"/>wamulongela, “Go mkulu, siye tuwapeta iwakalizi wose watukalile towalongoza na tona kamba haduhu hata munhu imoja yaswelile. <verse eid="NUM 31:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 31:50"/>Avo tugala viya va zahabu na vikuku na bangili na pete na heleni na ushanga kamba kila munhu viyapatile. Tuvigala ili tutendeligwe loholo kuulongozi wa Mndewa Imulungu.” <verse eid="NUM 31:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 31:51"/>Avo, Musa na Eleazali wavibokela vinhu avo vigeligwe ulembo kwa zahabu. <verse eid="NUM 31:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="NUM 31:52"/>Zahabu yose ilavigwe kwa Mndewa Imulungu ikala yovika kamba kilo magana mabili. <verse eid="NUM 31:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NUM 31:53"/>Kila mkalizi hakalile kilongozi kasigala na vinhu vake mwenyego viyasolile ako kuna ing'hondo. <verse eid="NUM 31:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="NUM 31:54"/>Avo Musa na Eleazali imulava nhosa waibokela zahabu ayo kulawa mmakono ga awo iwakulu wa wakalizi, waigala mna dihema da mting'hano, ili iwe kinhu cha kukumbuka kwa Waizilaeli kuulongozi wa Mndewa Imulungu.<verse eid="NUM 31:54"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 31"/>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="NUM 32"/>
  <para style="s">Makabila geli umwambu wa kudilawila zuwa wa Yolidani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 3:12-22">Kumbukumbu 3:12-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 32:1"/>Makabila ga Lubeni na Gadi gakala na fugo nyingi. Avo viwone isi ya Yazeli na Gileadi zofaya kwa fugo zao, <verse eid="NUM 32:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 32:2"/>wamcholela Musa na Eleazali na ivilongozi wose wa umting'hano wawalongela, <verse eid="NUM 32:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 32:3"/>“Mabuga ga Ataloti na Diboni na Yazeli na Nimla na Heshiboni na Eleale na Sebamu na Nebo na Beoni, <verse eid="NUM 32:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 32:4"/>isi ayo yose Mndewa Imulungu kaihuma mbuli ya Waizilaeli, isi ayo inoga kwa fugo, na siye tuna fugo nyingi, <verse eid="NUM 32:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 32:5"/>avo kamba mweye munogelwa towapula mutugwelele isi ayo iwe yetu, sikutuloke umwambu wa lwanda lwa Yolidani.”<verse eid="NUM 32:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 32:6"/>Musa kawedika awo iwanhu wa makabila ga Gadi na Lubeni, “Molonda kusigala hano akuno ndugu zenu Waizilaeli ochola kuna ing'hondo? <verse eid="NUM 32:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 32:7"/>Habali mowadonheza Waizilaeli sikuwachole mwiisi iyawalongele Mndewa Imulungu kowagwelela? <verse eid="NUM 32:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 32:8"/>Wahenga zenu watenda vivo viniwatumile kulawa Kadeshi Balinea wakaisungulile isi ayo. <verse eid="NUM 32:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 32:9"/>Hewo wachola mbaka kubonde da Eshikoli, wayona isi ayo lakini viwabwelile wawadonheza Waizilaeli ili sikuwengile mwiisi iyalongile Mndewa Imulungu kowagwaa. <verse eid="NUM 32:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 32:10"/>Mndewa Imulungu kagevuzika ng'hani siku dijo na kaiduwila kalonga, <verse eid="NUM 32:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 32:11"/>‘Kuduhu hata munhu yoyose mna iwanhu walawile Misili yeli na miyaka malongo mabili na kugendelela, yonda yayone isi inilongile nowagwaa Abulahamu na Isaka na Yakobo, kwavija hawanikweleleze kwa mizoyo yao yose.’ <verse eid="NUM 32:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 32:12"/>Wose honda wayone isi ayo ila Kalebu mwanage Yefune kulawa lukolo lwa Wakenizi na Yoshua mwanage Nuni, kwavija wao wanikweleleza kwa mizoyo yao yose. <verse eid="NUM 32:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 32:13"/>Mndewa Imulungu kawagevuzikila Waizilaeli kawatenda tanga nzulule kuluwala kwa miyaka malongo mane mbaka ulelo wose wa awo watendile gehile wafa. <verse eid="NUM 32:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 32:14"/>Sambi mweye ulelo wa wene nzambi, muzuka hanhu ha iwahenga zenu, na molonda kwengeza kugevuzika kwa Mndewa Imulungu kwa Waizilaeli. <verse eid="NUM 32:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 32:15"/>Kamba mweye mwahalema kumkweleleza, heyo kowaleka kabili kuluwala na mweye mowatenda wanhu wose wano wakomigwe.”<verse eid="NUM 32:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 32:16"/>Avo wamcholela Musa wamulongela, “Tutogolele tuwazengele ng'hondolo zetu mabumba, na tuwazengele mabuga wanetu hano. <verse eid="NUM 32:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 32:17"/>Lakini siye wenyego toitanda kuchola kuna ing'hondo hamoja na ndugu zetu Waizilaeli, na tolongola mbaka tuwavikize hanhu honda wakale. Kipindi acho wanetu okala mna gamabuga gazunguluswe ili sikuwavamiligwe na iwenekae wa isi ino. <verse eid="NUM 32:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 32:18"/>Siye hatubwela ukae mbaka Waizilaeli wose vonda wagweleligwe hanhu hao kamba uhazi wao. <verse eid="NUM 32:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 32:19"/>Honda tuhazi kinhu chochose ako umwambu wa lwanda lwa Yolidani, kwavija siye tupata uhazi wetu mwambu uno wa kudilawila zuwa wa Yolidani.”<verse eid="NUM 32:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 32:20"/>Avo Musa kawalongela, “Kamba kweli motenda kamba vimulongile, avo baha kuulongozi wa Mndewa Imulungu, muitande kuchola kuna ing'hondo. <verse eid="NUM 32:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 32:21"/>Kila mkalizi wenu yaloke lwanda lwa Yolidani na kuno molongozwa na Mndewa Imulungu, mowavamila iwanhu owehila mbaka Mndewa Imulungu vonda yawatende wahumwe, <verse eid="NUM 32:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 32:22"/>na moisola isi ayo. Mwahatenda gago mobwela kwavija mokuwa musang'hana gaja golondigwa na Mndewa Imulungu kwa ndugu zenu Waizilaeli. Abaho Mndewa Imulungu kowatogolela muisole isi ino ya umwambu wa kudilawila zuwa wa Yolidani. <verse eid="NUM 32:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 32:23"/>Lakini kamba hamgavikiza gago gamulongile, mokuwa mumtendela Mndewa Imulungu nzambi, na mujuwe kamba mokobozwa. <verse eid="NUM 32:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 32:24"/>Avo wazengeleni wanenu mabuga na wazengeleni ng'hondolo zenu mabumba, lakini mutende kamba vimulongile!”<verse eid="NUM 32:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 32:25"/>Abaho wanhu wa makabila ga Gadi na Lubeni wamulongela Musa, “Siye wasang'hanaji wako tosang'hana kamba Mndewa Imulungu viyatulagize. <verse eid="NUM 32:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 32:26"/>Wehe zetu na wanetu na ng'hondolo na ng'ombe osigala hano mwiisi ya Gileadi. <verse eid="NUM 32:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 32:27"/>Lakini siye wasang'hanaji wako tuitanda kuchola kuna ing'hondo kuno tolongozwa na Mndewa Imulungu. Toloka ulwanda lwa Yolidani na kuitowa na hewo kamba viulongile.”<verse eid="NUM 32:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 32:28"/>Abaho Musa kalava malagizo gano kwa imulava nhosa Eleazali na Yoshua mwanage Nuni, na ivilongozi wa ng'holo za makabila ga Waizilaeli. <verse eid="NUM 32:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 32:29"/>“Kamba wanhu wa makabila ga Gadi na Lubeni wahaloka lwanda lwa Yolidani hamoja na mweye kuno wapapa migoha yao na kuno molongozwa na Mndewa Imulungu, mwahawatowa iwanhu awo na kuisola isi ayo, avo muwagwelele isi ya Gileadi iwe yao. <verse eid="NUM 32:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 32:30"/>Lakini kamba hawaloka hamoja na mweye na migoha yao, avo osola hanhu ha isi ya Kanaani hamoja na mweye.”<verse eid="NUM 32:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 32:31"/>Iwanhu wa makabila ga Gadi na Lubeni wedika, “Go, mkulu, siye wasang'hanaji wako totenda kamba Mndewa Imulungu viyatulongele. <verse eid="NUM 32:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 32:32"/>Kwa kulongozwa na Mndewa Imulungu, toloka na migoha yetu mbaka mwiisi ya Kanaani, lakini isi itugweleligwe hano hana umwambu wa kudilawila zuwa wa Yolidani yokuwa yetu.”<verse eid="NUM 32:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 32:33"/>Avo Musa kawagwelela, iwanhu wa makabila ga Gadi na Lubeni na nusu ya iwanhu wa kabila da Manase mwanage Yusufu, isi yose ya mndewa Sihoni wa Waamoli na isi yose ya mndewa Ogu wa Bashani, mabuga gake na isi zizunguluke gamabuga. <verse eid="NUM 32:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 32:34"/>Wanhu wa kabila da Gadi wagazenga kabili mabuga ga Diboni na Ataloti na Aloeli, <verse eid="NUM 32:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 32:35"/>na Atiloti Shofani na Yazeli na Yogibeha, <verse eid="NUM 32:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 32:36"/>na Beti Nimula na Beti Halani, mabuga gago gazunguluswa senyenge na wazenga mabumba ga ng'hondolo. <verse eid="NUM 32:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 32:37"/>Iwanhu wa kabila da Lubeni wagazenga kabili mabuga ga Heshiboni na Eleale na Kiliataimu, <verse eid="NUM 32:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 32:38"/>na Nebo na Baali Meoni na Sibima. Matwaga gamabuga gago wagahindula, wagazenga kabili na wagagwaa matwaga gayagwe.<verse eid="NUM 32:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 32:39"/>Iwanhu wa ulelo wa Makili mwanage Manase, waivamila isi ya Gileadi waisola isi ayo na wawawinga Waamoli wakalile okala mumo. <verse eid="NUM 32:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 32:40"/>Avo Musa kawagwelela iwanhu wa ulelo wa Makili mwanage Manase, isi ayo ya Gileadi na hewo wakala mumo. <verse eid="NUM 32:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 32:41"/>Yaili munhu wa kabila da Manase kavivamila vijiji va isi ya Gileadi na kavisola, kavigwaa twaga da Hawoti Yaili.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">32:41 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kwa Kiebulania </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Hawoti Yaili </char><char style="ft" closed="false">fambulo jake vijiji va Yaili.</char></note> <verse eid="NUM 32:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 32:42"/>Na heyo Noba kadivamila na kadisola buga da Kenati na ivijiji vake, kadikema Noba, twaga jake mwenyego.<verse eid="NUM 32:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 32"/>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="NUM 33"/>
  <para style="s">Mwanza wa kulawa Misili mbaka Moabu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 33:1"/>Azino azo zing'hambi ziwekile Waizilaeli viwasegele mwiisi ya Misili mna gamabumbila gao kwa kulongozwa na Musa na Haluni. <verse eid="NUM 33:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 33:2"/>Musa kajandika twaga da kila hanhu kuwekile ing'hambi, kulawa ng'hambi imoja mbaka iyagwe, kwa kulagizwa na Mndewa Imulungu.<verse eid="NUM 33:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 33:3"/>Waizilaeli wasegela kudibuga da Lamesesi mna isiku ya longo na tano ya mwezi wa ichanduso, siku imoja toka Pasaka. Wasegela kwa kugangamala mgameso gawa Misili wose, <verse eid="NUM 33:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 33:4"/>awo wakalile owazika iwana wose wa chaudele wa kimbigalo wakomigwe na Mndewa Imulungu, kwavija vivija Mndewa Imulungu kaikoboza na imilungu yao yose.<verse eid="NUM 33:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 33:5"/>Avo, Waizilaeli wasegela Lamesesi weka ng'hambi ako Sukoti.<verse eid="NUM 33:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 33:6"/>Kulawa Sukoti weka ng'hambi yao ako Etamu, mwiingema ya uluwala.<verse eid="NUM 33:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 33:7"/>Kulawa Etamu wabweleganya mbaka Pi Hahiloti, umwambu wa kudilawila zuwa wa Baali Sefoni, weka ng'hambi yao behi na Migidoli.<verse eid="NUM 33:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 33:8"/>Kulawa Pi Hahiloti waloka ibahali ya Shamu mbaka kuluwala lwa Etamu, wagendelela na mwanza kwa siku ndatu na weka ng'hambi yao ako Mala.<verse eid="NUM 33:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 33:9"/>Kulawa Mala wachola mbaka Elimu, ako Elimu kukala na mbwibwi za mazi longo na mbili, na mitende malongo saba, weka ng'hambi yao hanhu aho.<verse eid="NUM 33:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 33:10"/>Kulawa Elimu weka ng'hambi yao behi na bahali ya Shamu.<verse eid="NUM 33:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 33:11"/>Kulawa bahali ya Shamu, weka ng'hambi yao kuluwala lwa Sini.<verse eid="NUM 33:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 33:12"/>Kulawa kuluwala lwa Sini weka ng'hambi yao ako Dofika.<verse eid="NUM 33:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 33:13"/>Kulawa Dofika weka ng'hambi yao ako Alushi.<verse eid="NUM 33:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 33:14"/>Kulawa Alushi weka ng'hambi yao ako Lefidimu, kuko kukala kuduhu mazi ga kung'wa.<verse eid="NUM 33:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 33:15"/>Kulawa Lefidimu weka ng'hambi yao ako kuluwala lwa Sinai.<verse eid="NUM 33:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 33:16"/>Kulawa kuluwala lwa Sinai weka ng'hambi yao ako Kibiloti Hataava.<verse eid="NUM 33:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 33:17"/>Kulawa Kibiloti Hataava weka ng'hambi yao ako Haseloti.<verse eid="NUM 33:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 33:18"/>Kulawa Haseloti weka ng'hambi yao ako Litima.<verse eid="NUM 33:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 33:19"/>Kulawa Litima weka ng'hambi yao ako Limoni Pelesi.<verse eid="NUM 33:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 33:20"/>Kulawa Limoni Pelesi weka ng'hambi yao ako Libina.<verse eid="NUM 33:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 33:21"/>Kulawa Libina weka ng'hambi yao ako Lisa.<verse eid="NUM 33:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 33:22"/>Kulawa Lisa weka ng'hambi yao ako Keheleta.<verse eid="NUM 33:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 33:23"/>Kulawa Keheleta weka ng'hambi yao ako kulugongo lwa Shefeli.<verse eid="NUM 33:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 33:24"/>Kulawa kulugongo lwa Shefeli weka ng'hambi yao ako Halada.<verse eid="NUM 33:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 33:25"/>Kulawa Halada weka ng'hambi yao ako Makeloti.<verse eid="NUM 33:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 33:26"/>Kulawa Makeloti weka ng'hambi yao ako Tahati.<verse eid="NUM 33:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 33:27"/>Kulawa Tahati weka ng'hambi yao ako Tela.<verse eid="NUM 33:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 33:28"/>Kulawa Tela weka ng'hambi yao ako Mitika.<verse eid="NUM 33:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 33:29"/>Kulawa Mitika weka ng'hambi yao ako Hashimona.<verse eid="NUM 33:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 33:30"/>Kulawa Hashimona weka ng'hambi yao ako Moseloti.<verse eid="NUM 33:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 33:31"/>Kulawa Moseloti weka ng'hambi yao ako Bene Yakani.<verse eid="NUM 33:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 33:32"/>Kulawa Bene Yakani weka ng'hambi yao ako Holi Hagidigadi.<verse eid="NUM 33:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 33:33"/>Kulawa Holi Hagidigadi weka ng'hambi yao ako Yotibata.<verse eid="NUM 33:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 33:34"/>Kulawa Yotibata weka ng'hambi yao ako Abilona.<verse eid="NUM 33:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 33:35"/>Kulawa Abilona weka ng'hambi yao ako Esioni Gebeli.<verse eid="NUM 33:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 33:36"/>Kulawa Esioni Gebeli weka ng'hambi yao ako kuluwala lwa Sini vivija kokemigwa Kadeshi.<verse eid="NUM 33:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 33:37"/>Kulawa Kadeshi weka ng'hambi yao ako kulugongo lwa Holi, mna imbaka ya isi ya Edomu.<verse eid="NUM 33:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 33:38"/>Kwa kulagizwa na Mndewa Imulungu, Haluni imulava nhosa kakwela kulugongo lwa Holi na kafila kuko, kuna isiku ya ichanduso ya mwezi wa tano, mwaka wa malongo mane toka Waizilaeli viwasegele mwiisi ya Misili. <verse eid="NUM 33:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 33:39"/>Haluni viyafile ako kulugongo lwa Holi kakala na miyaka gana dimoja na malongo mabili na ndatu.<verse eid="NUM 33:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 33:40"/>Mndewa wa Aladi, Mkanaani yakalile ako Negebu mwiisi ya Kanaani kapata usenga kamba Waizilaeli wamnzila okwiza.<verse eid="NUM 33:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 33:41"/>Kulawa kulugongo lwa Holi, Waizilaeli weka ng'hambi yao ako Salimona.<verse eid="NUM 33:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 33:42"/>Kulawa Salimona weka ng'hambi yao ako Punoni.<verse eid="NUM 33:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 33:43"/>Kulawa Punoni weka ng'hambi yao ako Oboti.<verse eid="NUM 33:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 33:44"/>Kulawa Oboti weka ng'hambi yao ako Iye Abalimu kuna imbaka ya Moabu.<verse eid="NUM 33:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 33:45"/>Kulawa Iye Abalimu weka ng'hambi yao ako Diboni Gadi.<verse eid="NUM 33:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 33:46"/>Kulawa Diboni Gadi weka ng'hambi yao ako Alimoni Dibilataimu.<verse eid="NUM 33:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 33:47"/>Kulawa Alimoni Dibilataimu weka ng'hambi yao ako kuvigongo va Abalimu behi na lugongo lwa Nebo.<verse eid="NUM 33:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 33:48"/>Kulawa kuvigongo va Abalimu wagendelela na mwanza na weka ng'hambi yao ako kudibawe da Moabu, behi na lwanda lwa Yolidani uilola na buga da Yeliko dikalile umwambu wa ulwanda. <verse eid="NUM 33:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 33:49"/>Weka ng'hambi yao behi na lwanda lwa Yolidani hagati ya Beti Yeshimoti na Abeli Shitimu ako kudibawe da Moabu.<verse eid="NUM 33:49"/></para>
  <para style="s">Malagizo ga Mndewa Imulungu mbuli ya kuisola isi ya Kanaani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 33:50"/>Kulawa kuko kudibawe da Moabu, behi na lwanda lwa Yolidani uilola na buga da Yeliko dikalile umwambu wa ulwanda, Mndewa Imulungu kamulongela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 33:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 33:51"/>“Walongele Waizilaeli kamba vonda muloke lwanda lwa Yolidani na kwingila mwiisi ya Kanaani, <verse eid="NUM 33:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="NUM 33:52"/>wawingeni wenekae wose wa isi ayo. Mugakindule mabwe gao gose na iminyago yao ya zuma na muhabomole kila hanhu hao ha kutambikila. <verse eid="NUM 33:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NUM 33:53"/>Muisole isi ayo na mukale mumo kwavija niye niwagwelela iwe yenu. <verse eid="NUM 33:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="NUM 33:54"/>Na moigola isi ayo kwa kubwanha simbi kamba iwanhu viweli, isi ing'hulu kwa kabila dili na wanhu wengi na isi indodo kwa kabila dili na wanhu wadodo. <verse eid="NUM 33:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="NUM 33:55"/>Lakini kamba tanhu hamuwawinga iwenekae wa isi ayo, avo awo onda muwaleke okuwa kamba vibanzi mgameso genu hebu kamba miba mzimbavu zenu, na owagaza ng'hani. <verse eid="NUM 33:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="NUM 33:56"/>Kamba hamuwawinga, niye nowatendela mweye kamba vinigelegeze kuwatendela hewo.”<verse eid="NUM 33:56"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 33"/>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="NUM 34"/>
  <para style="s">Zimbaka za isi ya Kanaani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 34:1"/>Mndewa Imulungu kamulongela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 34:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 34:2"/>“Walongele Waizilaeli vino, vonda mwingile mwiisi ya Kanaani, isi iniwagwelele iwe yenu, zimbaka za isi yenu zokuwa kamba vino. <verse eid="NUM 34:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 34:3"/>Umwambu wa kusini imbaka yenu yokuwa kulawa kuluwala lwa Sini mbaka kuna imbaka ya Edomu. Yosongela mwambu wa kudilawila zuwa wa umwambu wa kusini ako kuihelela ibahali ya Mkele. <verse eid="NUM 34:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 34:4"/>Abaho imbaka yenu yogendelela kusini kubitila kuna inzila ya Akilabimu na kubitila Sini mbaka Kadeshi Balinea, umwambu wa kusini. Kulawa kuko yobita mwambu wa kasikazini kwa kuchola mwambu wa kudihongela zuwa mbaka Hasali Adali na yobita mbaka ako Azimoni. <verse eid="NUM 34:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 34:5"/>Kulawa Azimoni yobita kwa kuchola kuna ikizanda cha Misili na yohelela hana ibahali ya Meditelania.<verse eid="NUM 34:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 34:6"/>“Imbaka yenu kwa mwambu wa kudihongela zuwa yokuwa bahali ya Meditelania.<verse eid="NUM 34:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 34:7"/>“Imbaka yenu kwa umwambu wa kasikazini yokuwa kulawa bahali ya Meditelania mbaka kulugongo lwa Holi. <verse eid="NUM 34:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 34:8"/>Kulawa kulugongo lwa Holi yobitila kuna inzila ichola Hamati, na yogendelela mbaka ako Sedadi, <verse eid="NUM 34:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 34:9"/>yobitila ako Zifuloni, na yohelela ako Hasali Enani, ayo iyo imbaka yenu kwa umwambu wa kasikazini.<verse eid="NUM 34:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 34:10"/>“Imbaka yenu kwa umwambu wa kudilawila zuwa yokuwa kulawa Hasali Enani na yobitila ako Shefamu. <verse eid="NUM 34:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 34:11"/>Kulawa Shefamu yogendelela kubitila Libila, mwambu wa kudilawila zuwa wa Aini, abaho imbaka ayo yobita hasi kuna umwambu wa kudilawila zuwa wa lamba da Kineleti<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">34:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Vivija </char><char style="fq" closed="false">lamba da Kineleti </char><char style="ft" closed="false">dojuwika kamba lamba da Galilaya.</char></note>, <verse eid="NUM 34:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 34:12"/>abaho yohumulukila kulozela kuna ulwanda lwa Yolidani mbaka kuna ibahali ya Mkele, zino azo zimbaka nne za isi ayo.”<verse eid="NUM 34:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 34:13"/>Avo, Musa kawalongela Waizilaeli, “Ino ayo isi yonda mwiihazi kwa kubwanha simbi, isi iyalagize Mndewa Imulungu gagweleligwe makabila tisa na nusu. <verse eid="NUM 34:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 34:14"/>Kabila da Lubeni na kabila da Gadi, na nusu ya kabila da Manase wagweleligwa uhazi wao kamba viweli mzing'holo zao. <verse eid="NUM 34:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 34:15"/>Makabila gago mabili na nusu wapata uhazi wao ako umwambu wa kudilawila zuwa wa lwanda lwa Yolidani uilola na buga da Yeliko dikalile umwambu wa ulwanda.”<verse eid="NUM 34:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ivilongozi onda wawagwelele iwanhu isi ya Kanaani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 34:16"/>Abaho Mndewa Imulungu kamulongela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 34:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 34:17"/>“Imulava nhosa Eleazali na Yoshua mwanage Nuni awo onda wawagwelele iwanhu isi ayo kamba uhazi wao. <verse eid="NUM 34:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 34:18"/>Vivija usagule kilongozi imoja kulawa kila kabila ili waitaze kuigola isi ayo. <verse eid="NUM 34:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 34:19"/>Gano gago matwaga ga awo ivilongozi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 34:19">Kabila da Yuda kokuwa Kalebu mwanage Yefune.<verse eid="NUM 34:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 34:20"/>Kabila da Simeoni kokuwa Shemueli mwanage Amihudi.<verse eid="NUM 34:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 34:21"/>Kabila da Benjamini kokuwa Elidadi mwanage Kisiloni.<verse eid="NUM 34:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 34:22"/>Kabila da Dani kokuwa Buki mwanage Yogili.<verse eid="NUM 34:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 34:23"/>Kabila da Manase mwanage Yusufu kokuwa Hanieli mwanage Efodi.<verse eid="NUM 34:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 34:24"/>Kabila da Efulaimu mwanage Yusufu kokuwa Kemueli mwanage Shifitani.<verse eid="NUM 34:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 34:25"/>Kabila da Zabuloni kokuwa Elisafani mwanage Palinaki.<verse eid="NUM 34:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 34:26"/>Kabila da Isakali kokuwa Palitieli mwanage Azani.<verse eid="NUM 34:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 34:27"/>Kabila da Asheli kokuwa Ahihudi mwanage Shelomi.<verse eid="NUM 34:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 34:28"/>Kabila da Nafutali kokuwa Pedaheli mwanage Amihudi.”<verse eid="NUM 34:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 34:29"/>Wano awo iwanhu walagizwe na Mndewa Imulungu wawagwelele Waizilaeli isi ayo ya Kanaani kamba uhazi wao.<verse eid="NUM 34:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 34"/>
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="NUM 35"/>
  <para style="s">Mabuga ga Walawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 35:1"/>Mndewa Imulungu kalonga na Musa kudibawe da Moabu, behi na lwanda lwa Yolidani uilola na buga da Yeliko dikalile umwambu wa ulwanda, kamulongela, <verse eid="NUM 35:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 35:2"/>“Walongele Waizilaeli kamba kulawa mna uuhazi onda wagweleligwe wawagwee Walawi mabuga ga kukala na hanhu ha kudimila fugo zao kumgwazo wa gago gamabuga. <verse eid="NUM 35:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 35:3"/>Mabuga gago gokuwa gao, hewo okala mumo na odima ng'ombe na fugo zao ziyagwe. <verse eid="NUM 35:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 35:4"/>Ihanhu ha kudimila honda muwagwelele awo Walawi ako kumgwazo wa gamabuga kila mwambu kuwe na utali wa magulu magana mane na malongo matano kulawa ako kugamabuga. <verse eid="NUM 35:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 35:5"/>Avo hanhu hose ha kudimila hokuwa na utali wa magulu magana tisa kila umwambu wa dibuga, na dibuga dokuwa aho hagati ya hanhu aho ha kudimila ako kumgwazo wa dibuga. <verse eid="NUM 35:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 35:6"/>Muwagwelele Walawi mabuga sita ga kukimbilila, ili kamba munhu kamkoma miyage bila kulonda kodaha kukimbilila kuko. Vivija muwagwelele mabuga gayagwe malongo mane na mbili. <verse eid="NUM 35:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 35:7"/>Mabuga gose kwa gose gonda muwagwelele Walawi gokuwa malongo mane na nane, muwagwelele mabuga gago hamoja na ihanhu ha kudimila fugo zao. <verse eid="NUM 35:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 35:8"/>Gamabuga gonda walave Waizilaeli kuwagwelela Walawi iwe kamba iwanhu mdikabila dijo viweli, kamba kabila dina wanhu wengi dilave mabuga mengi na kamba kabila dina wanhu wadodo dilave mabuga kidogo. Kila kabila dilave mabuga gake mbuli ya Walawi kamba isi yao iwagweleligwe viili.”<verse eid="NUM 35:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mabuga ga kukimbilila</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 19:13">Kumbukumbu 19:13</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 20:1-9">Yoshua 20:1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 35:9"/>Abaho Mndewa Imulungu kamulongela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 35:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 35:10"/>“Walongele Waizilaeli kamba vonda muloke lwanda lwa Yolidani na kwingila mwiisi ya Kanaani, <verse eid="NUM 35:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 35:11"/>musagule mabuga ga kukimbilila, ili kamba munhu kamkoma miyage bila kulonda kodaha kukimbilila mumo. <verse eid="NUM 35:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 35:12"/>Mabuga gago gokuwa hanhu hanogile ha kukimbilila ili imunhu ayo yamkomile miyage sikuyakomigwe na awo onda wambwezele kwa acho kiyatendile yang'hali hanauzigwa kuulongozi wa umting'hano. <verse eid="NUM 35:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 35:13"/>Musagule mabuga sita mbuli ya hanhu ha kukimbilila. <verse eid="NUM 35:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 35:14"/>Mna gamabuga gago sita gonda musagule, mabuga madatu gawe umwambu wa kudilawila zuwa wa lwanda lwa Yolidani, na madatu gawe mwiisi ya Kanaani. <verse eid="NUM 35:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 35:15"/>Mabuga gago gokuwa hanhu ha kukimbilila mbuli ya Waizilaeli na iwanhu baki iwokala na hewo siku zose hebu iwanhu baki iwokala hamoja na hewo kwa siku ndodo. Munhu yoyose yahamkoma miyage bila kulonda kodaha kukimbilila mumo.<verse eid="NUM 35:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 35:16"/>“Lakini kamba munhu kamtowa miyage kwa kinhu cha zuma, na kumkoma, avo munhu ayo kokuwa mkomaji na heyo yakomigwe. <verse eid="NUM 35:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 35:17"/>Munhu yoyose yahamtowa miyage kwa dibwe, na kumkoma, munhu ayo kokuwa mkomaji na heyo yakomigwe. <verse eid="NUM 35:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 35:18"/>Munhu yahamtowa miyage kwa biki na kumkoma, munhu ayo kokuwa mkomaji na heyo yakomigwe. <verse eid="NUM 35:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 35:19"/>Ndugu wa imunhu ayo yakomigwe yambwezele, na yamkome mkomaji ayo vonda yaiting'hane na heyo.<verse eid="NUM 35:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 35:20"/>“Vivija kamba munhu komwihila miyage abaho komsung'ha hebu komtupila kinhu, <verse eid="NUM 35:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 35:21"/>hebu komtowa ng'honde na kumkoma, avo imunhu ayo yamtowile miyage na kumkoma na heyo yakomigwe. Ndugu wa imunhu ayo yakomigwe na heyo yambwezele kwa kumkoma yahamting'hana.<verse eid="NUM 35:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 35:22"/>“Lakini kamba munhu komsung'ha miyage bila kulonda hebu komtupila kinhu bila ugomvi wowose, <verse eid="NUM 35:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 35:23"/>hebu munhu yahapigisa dibwe na kumkoma munhu bila kulonda, na kuno hagombile na imunhu ayo yamkomile, <verse eid="NUM 35:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 35:24"/>avo umting'hano wose waigelegeze mbuli ayo, mbuli ya ayo yamkomile miyage na ndugu yake imunhu yakomigwe yolonda kumbwezela ayo imkomaji, kamba malagizo gano vigali. <verse eid="NUM 35:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 35:25"/>Awo umting'hano umsegese ayo imunhu yakomile mmakono ga ndugu yake ayo yakomigwe, na wambweze kudibuga da kukimbilila kuko kuyakimbilile. Yakale kuko mbaka vonda yafe imulava nhosa mkulu yasaguligwe kwa kugidiligwa mavuta. <verse eid="NUM 35:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 35:26"/>Lakini munhu ayo yakomile yahalawa kunze ya dibuga da kukimbilila, <verse eid="NUM 35:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 35:27"/>abaho ndugu yake imunhu yakomigwe kamgoga ako kunze ya dibuga da kukimbilila na kumkoma, avo ayo kokuwa hatendile dihile kwa kumkoma munhu ayo. <verse eid="NUM 35:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 35:28"/>Kwavija imunhu ayo yamkomile miyage kolondigwa yakale mumo kudibuga da kukimbilila mbaka vonda yafe imulava nhosa mkulu, lakini yahafa ayo imulava nhosa mkulu kodaha kubwela ukae kumwake.<verse eid="NUM 35:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 35:29"/>“Malagizo gano gawe kwa ulelo wenu wose, hanhu hohose honda mukale.<verse eid="NUM 35:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 35:30"/>“Munhu yoyose yonda yamkome miyage, yatagusigwe ifa kwa usindila wa wanhu wabili na kugendelela onile kija kitendigwe. Munhu yoyose sikuyatagusigwe ifa kwa usindila wa munhu imoja.<verse eid="NUM 35:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 35:31"/>“Sikumubokele malipo gogose ili kumuhonya munhu mkomaji, mkomaji yoyose yahatagusigwa ifa, kolondigwa yakomigwe. <verse eid="NUM 35:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 35:32"/>Sikumubokele malipo gogose kulawa kwa munhu yakimbilile kudibuga da kukimbilila ili kumtenda yabwele ukae kumwake yang'hali hanakufa imulava nhosa mkulu. <verse eid="NUM 35:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 35:33"/>Mwahatenda vivo moifitiza isi yenu imukala, kwavija ukomaji oifitiza isi, na kuduhu nhosa yonda ilavigwe ili kuitenda ing'ale, isi ikomeligwe munhu ila kwa kumkoma imunhu yamkomile miyage. <verse eid="NUM 35:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 35:34"/>Sikumuifitize isi imukala, isi ayo inikala niye vivija, kwavija niye Mndewa Imulungu nokala hagati yenu mweye Waizilaeli.”<verse eid="NUM 35:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 35"/>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="NUM 36"/>
  <para style="s">Uhazi wa watwanzi wasoligwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 36:1"/>Abaho vilongozi wa lukolo lwa Gileadi mwanage Makili na Makili mwanage Manase na Manase mwanage Yusufu wachola kulonga na Musa na vilongozi wayagwe wa ng'holo za Waizilaeli. <verse eid="NUM 36:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 36:2"/>Walonga, “Go mkulu, Mndewa Imulungu kakulagiza uwagwelele isi ayo wanhu wa Izilaeli kamba uhazi wao kwa kubwanha simbi, vivija kakulagiza uwagwelele wandele wa ndugu yetu Selofehadi uhazi wa tatao. <verse eid="NUM 36:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 36:3"/>Lakini hewo wahasoligwa na Waizilaeli wa makabila gayagwe, uhazi wao osegela kumwetu na ochola kwa iwanhu wa gamakabila gonda wasoligwe, avo uhazi wetu siye ohunguka. <verse eid="NUM 36:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 36:4"/>Mna inyimwilinyimwili ya kulekeswa, uhazi awo opetigwa hamoja na uja wa kabila donda wasoligwe, avo kabila jetu honda dipate uhazi awo kabili.”<verse eid="NUM 36:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 36:5"/>Avo Musa kawagwaa Waizilaeli lagizo dino kulawa kwa Mndewa Imulungu, kawalongela “Wanhu wa kabila da ulelo wa Yusufu walonga goya. <verse eid="NUM 36:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 36:6"/>Avo vino vivo viyalagize Mndewa Imulungu mbuli ya wandele wa Selofehadi, odaha kusoligwa na wambigalo wowose owalonda, lakini wambigalo awo walawe mdikabila jao, <verse eid="NUM 36:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 36:7"/>ili uhazi wa Waizilaeli sikuuhamizwe kulawa kabila dimoja kuchola diyagwe, kila Mwiizilaeli yaulole uhazi wa kabila jake. <verse eid="NUM 36:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 36:8"/>Mtwanzi yoyose yeli na uhazi mna gamakabila ga Waizilaeli, kolondigwa yasoligwe na munhu wa kabila jake, ili kila Mwiizilaeli yasole uhazi wa iwahenga zake. <verse eid="NUM 36:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 36:9"/>Avo kokuwa kuduhu uhazi onda uhamizwe kulawa kabila dimoja kuchola diyagwe. Kila kabila da iwanhu wa Izilaeli digoge uhazi wake.”<verse eid="NUM 36:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 36:10"/>Avo awo iwandele wa Selofehadi watenda kamba Mndewa Imulungu viyamulagize Musa. <verse eid="NUM 36:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 36:11"/>Avo Mala na Tiliza na Hogila na Milika na Nuhu, awo iwandele wa Selofehadi wasoligwa na ndugu zao waubanzi wa tatao. <verse eid="NUM 36:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 36:12"/>Wasoligwa mzing'holo za kabila da Manase, mwanage Yusufu, na uhazi wao usigala mdikabila da tatao. <verse eid="NUM 36:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 36:13"/>Gano gago malagizo ga Mndewa Imulungu gayawagwelele Waizilaeli kubitila Musa ako kudibawe da Moabu, behi na lwanda lwa Yolidani uilola na buga da Yeliko dikalile umwambu wa ulwanda.<verse eid="NUM 36:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 36"/>
</usx>
